pos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/fa3edff672c128dc64d8a16574e8754a3f2a0197/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T12:53:28Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T12:53:28Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"0.13.0: group terminals, models, scratchpads & todos by project\n\nAdd a Projects concept as the organizing spine of the cockpit:\n\n- New DevHand.Projects lib + `dev project` module (SQLite registry of\n  projects + saved terminals; slug/root/reserved-`default` validation).\n- Tag todos, scratchpads and models with an optional project slug (SQLite\n  column + idempotent migration; Project field on model JSON); --project\n  filter on add/new/list.\n- Mission Control: sidebar project tree (Default aggregate + collapsible\n  projects), project-scoped selection, project threaded through the panel\n  SDK, and multi-instance keep-alive terminals with per-project named tabs.\n- New /api/projects + /api/projects/{slug}/terminals endpoints and a\n  ?project= filter on /api/models.\n- Deleting a project archives its models/scratchpads/todos (new archived\n  flag, hidden from normal listings) and kills its terminals, via a shared\n  ProjectCascade used by both `dev project rm` and the MC DELETE endpoint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa3d540a199fa7601a3d6ea974dca3bf3e1ada8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/fa3d540a199fa7601a3d6ea974dca3bf3e1ada8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/fa3edff672c128dc64d8a16574e8754a3f2a0197","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/fa3edff672c128dc64d8a16574e8754a3f2a0197","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKGZhM2VkZmY2NzJjMTI4ZGM2NGQ4YTE2NTc0ZTg3NTRhM2YyYTAxOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/44c7c2488b392438fc8aee16643d481e1355b5fc","sha":"44c7c2488b392438fc8aee16643d481e1355b5fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/44c7c2488b392438fc8aee16643d481e1355b5fc"}],"sha":"fa3edff672c128dc64d8a16574e8754a3f2a0197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/fa3edff672c128dc64d8a16574e8754a3f2a0197"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/44c7c2488b392438fc8aee16643d481e1355b5fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:17:37Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:17:37Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Terminal: status bar + scrollbar/overflow polish, drop working-dir field\n\nAdd a bottom status bar to the Mission Control terminal showing idle/running\nstate (with the running command''s name), shell + PID, process count, and live\nmemory of the shell''s process tree. The server samples the tree ~1x/s via a new\nConPTY-side ProcessTree walk (CreateToolhelp32Snapshot) and pushes {type:\"stat\"}\nframes; concurrent PTY sends are serialized through a semaphore.\n\nAlso: fix the start-up overflow by giving the xterm host a definite size and\ndeferring the first fit; only show the scrollbar once there''s scrollback; and\nremove the header working-dir box (commands + terminal use the server''s launch\ndirectory).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a1adba167e5a56d1fec1cb721fe1410921190e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/3a1adba167e5a56d1fec1cb721fe1410921190e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/44c7c2488b392438fc8aee16643d481e1355b5fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/44c7c2488b392438fc8aee16643d481e1355b5fc","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKDQ0YzdjMjQ4OGIzOTI0MzhmYzhhZWUxNjY0M2Q0ODFlMTM1NWI1ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/96fb015266c957f41e6eba97192d5cdeea1d9dd3","sha":"96fb015266c957f41e6eba97192d5cdeea1d9dd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/96fb015266c957f41e6eba97192d5cdeea1d9dd3"}],"sha":"44c7c2488b392438fc8aee16643d481e1355b5fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/44c7c2488b392438fc8aee16643d481e1355b5fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/96fb015266c957f41e6eba97192d5cdeea1d9dd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:54:58Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:54:58Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Terminal: real ConPTY pseudo-terminal in mc and mcd\n\nThe mc/mcd Terminal was a one-shot submission form (type a command, hit\nRun, output wiped each time). Replace it with a real interactive terminal:\nan xterm.js front-end bridged over a new /ws/pty WebSocket to a Windows\nConPTY shell, so it behaves like a terminal window — a persistent session,\na live prompt, colors/cursor control, history, and interactive programs.\n\n- Server/PseudoConsole.cs: ConPTY (CreatePseudoConsole) wrapper — launches a\n  shell attached to a real PTY, streaming raw VT both ways, resizable.\n- MissionControlServer: /ws/pty endpoint (binary = bytes both ways,\n  text = resize/exit control). /ws/run command forms untouched.\n- CommandExecution.ResolveInteractiveShell: prefer a real PowerShell, skip the\n  Microsoft Store pwsh alias stub (never attaches to a PTY).\n- web/Terminal.tsx: xterm.js + fit addon, cockpit-themed, Restart/Clear.\n- App.tsx: Terminal tab renders the live terminal; old form removed.\n\nmcd inherits this by reusing MC''s server + wwwroot verbatim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"823f00a857923d3beb2aded2119f1d9c3b08cce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/823f00a857923d3beb2aded2119f1d9c3b08cce7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/96fb015266c957f41e6eba97192d5cdeea1d9dd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/96fb015266c957f41e6eba97192d5cdeea1d9dd3","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKDk2ZmIwMTUyNjZjOTU3ZjQxZTZlYmE5NzE5MmQ1Y2RlZWExZDlkZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/c413c179abd5cb0c96aba93d490a0425c3bcea5a","sha":"c413c179abd5cb0c96aba93d490a0425c3bcea5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/c413c179abd5cb0c96aba93d490a0425c3bcea5a"}],"sha":"96fb015266c957f41e6eba97192d5cdeea1d9dd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/96fb015266c957f41e6eba97192d5cdeea1d9dd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/c413c179abd5cb0c96aba93d490a0425c3bcea5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:43:59Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:43:59Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Mission Control Desktop: dev mcd hosts the cockpit in a native window\n\nAdd DevHand.Modules.MissionControlDesktop (dev mcd up), a native WebView\n(Photino) shell around the exact same Mission Control server — same SPA,\nAPI, catalog, and Modeler, no frontend duplication. It starts the server on\na free loopback port (auth off by default) and points a window at it;\nclosing the window stops the server.\n\nMissionControlServer gains a non-blocking Start() plus public BaseUrl/\nLoginUrl; Run() is refactored to share an internal BuildApp() with identical\nbehavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8108c5d5e94848c44918ce14d8695b8d63e3e16a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/8108c5d5e94848c44918ce14d8695b8d63e3e16a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/c413c179abd5cb0c96aba93d490a0425c3bcea5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/c413c179abd5cb0c96aba93d490a0425c3bcea5a","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKGM0MTNjMTc5YWJkNWNiMGM5NmFiYTkzZDQ5MGEwNDI1YzNiY2VhNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/0f8a847d7fe5f3fed92dc03928304051845330e1","sha":"0f8a847d7fe5f3fed92dc03928304051845330e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/0f8a847d7fe5f3fed92dc03928304051845330e1"}],"sha":"c413c179abd5cb0c96aba93d490a0425c3bcea5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/c413c179abd5cb0c96aba93d490a0425c3bcea5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/0f8a847d7fe5f3fed92dc03928304051845330e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:47:43Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:47:43Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Scratchpads: add formatting toolbar + Preview/Code mode toggle\n\nThe panel now edits one Markdown document (still the pad''s stored plain-text\ncontent) in either of two modes, toggled from the header:\n\n- Preview — the Plate WYSIWYG plus a formatting toolbar: bold, italic, inline\n  code, H1/H2/H3, quote, code block, bulleted/numbered lists, and undo/redo.\n  Buttons reflect active marks/block type and preserve the selection.\n- Code — the raw Markdown source in a plain textarea.\n\nMarkdown is the single source of truth; Preview serializes on every edit and is\nreloaded from the current Markdown when re-entered (bumped key), so switching\nmodes never diverges or loses content. Save/dirty state, the discard guard, and\nthe 28k-char cap work across both modes.\n\nToolbar is wired to the Plate v53 transform API (toggleMark / toggleBlock /\ntoggle.bulletedList|numberedList, undo/redo). No link button — v53 has no simple\nlink-insert transform; links still work via Markdown source and round-trip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95713a2e5e5ae7d70f2966b3e8507ce834ebbf0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/95713a2e5e5ae7d70f2966b3e8507ce834ebbf0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/0f8a847d7fe5f3fed92dc03928304051845330e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/0f8a847d7fe5f3fed92dc03928304051845330e1","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKDBmOGE4NDdkN2ZlNWYzZmVkOTJkYzAzOTI4MzA0MDUxODQ1MzMwZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/01de4f67bd56b292e26d6abe6f0211d697fb9cbb","sha":"01de4f67bd56b292e26d6abe6f0211d697fb9cbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/01de4f67bd56b292e26d6abe6f0211d697fb9cbb"}],"sha":"0f8a847d7fe5f3fed92dc03928304051845330e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/0f8a847d7fe5f3fed92dc03928304051845330e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/01de4f67bd56b292e26d6abe6f0211d697fb9cbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:36:50Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:36:50Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Panels: let each module build its UI with any framework\n\nThe Mission Control panel runtime was already framework-neutral (the host only\nserves webui/** and dynamic-import()s panel.js for its mount(container, sdk)\nexport). The lock-in was in the build tooling. build-panels.mjs is now a\nper-module dispatcher:\n\n- webui/package.json present -> owned build: npm install (once) + npm run build\n  in that folder, which owns its toolchain/deps and emits panel.js. Any\n  framework (Preact, Svelte, Solid, Vue, Lit, vanilla, or bundling heavy deps).\n- else webui/src/panel.jsx -> the default React/esbuild compile (unchanged).\n- else a committed panel.js with no sources -> nothing to build.\n\nThe embed rule (Directory.Build.props + the scaffolder''s drop-in csproj) now\nexcludes build-time inputs (webui/src, node_modules, package*.json, build.mjs)\nso a self-contained npm panel doesn''t embed its node_modules into the DLL.\n\ndev module new gains --panel-framework <react|preact|vanilla> (implies --panel)\nwith framework-specific templates and next-steps. Docs updated (CLAUDE.md panel\nsection, README) and the stale pre-Plate scratchpads blurb corrected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a5236f0d5daa358adb0c9fa07f06067c5ae2b38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/6a5236f0d5daa358adb0c9fa07f06067c5ae2b38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/01de4f67bd56b292e26d6abe6f0211d697fb9cbb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/01de4f67bd56b292e26d6abe6f0211d697fb9cbb","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKDAxZGU0ZjY3YmQ1NmIyOTJlMjZkNmFiZTZmMDIxMWQ2OTdmYjljYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/501e5d9b881d1904367eef8ea540236c2109c06b","sha":"501e5d9b881d1904367eef8ea540236c2109c06b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/501e5d9b881d1904367eef8ea540236c2109c06b"}],"sha":"01de4f67bd56b292e26d6abe6f0211d697fb9cbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/01de4f67bd56b292e26d6abe6f0211d697fb9cbb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/501e5d9b881d1904367eef8ea540236c2109c06b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:16:23Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:16:23Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Scratchpads: replace textarea editor with a PlateJS rich Markdown editor\n\nThe scratchpads Mission Control panel now edits pads in a PlateJS WYSIWYG\n(headings, marks, lists, blockquotes, code blocks, links, rules) instead of a\nplain textarea + hand-rolled Markdown preview. Pads still persist as plain\nMarkdown (deserialized on load, serialized on save), so the CLI and MCP tools\nkeep their plain-text contract.\n\nUnlike the other panels, which borrow the host''s React and bundle nothing, this\npanel bundles its own React + Plate and mounts on an independent React root;\nsdk.runJson still drives the backend. build-panels.mjs gains a web/node_modules\nresolve fallback and a process.env.NODE_ENV define so a bundled React works in\nthe browser. Drops the now-redundant Edit/Split/Preview toggle and markdown.js.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3d634756f181c98a2942287b7c76ff1ec994c0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/c3d634756f181c98a2942287b7c76ff1ec994c0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/501e5d9b881d1904367eef8ea540236c2109c06b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/501e5d9b881d1904367eef8ea540236c2109c06b","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKDUwMWU1ZDliODgxZDE5MDQzNjdlZWY4ZWE1NDAyMzZjMjEwOWMwNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/0b6b34c8569e50e1f40c8135e344b2a5485a9323","sha":"0b6b34c8569e50e1f40c8135e344b2a5485a9323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/0b6b34c8569e50e1f40c8135e344b2a5485a9323"}],"sha":"501e5d9b881d1904367eef8ea540236c2109c06b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/501e5d9b881d1904367eef8ea540236c2109c06b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/0b6b34c8569e50e1f40c8135e344b2a5485a9323/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:44:20Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:44:20Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"DevHandPaths: drive-/root-relative overrides resolve under Home, not CWD\n\nPath.IsPathRooted accepts \"C:env.db\" and \"\\env.db\", so such an override\nwas used \"verbatim\" and resolved against the process current directory /\ncurrent drive — the data file silently moved per invocation directory.\nOnly fully qualified paths are now taken verbatim; everything else is\nresolved against Home via Path.GetFullPath(path, base).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f73bfe0d91148246c69fef8327de5f0ac2865937","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/f73bfe0d91148246c69fef8327de5f0ac2865937"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/0b6b34c8569e50e1f40c8135e344b2a5485a9323","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/0b6b34c8569e50e1f40c8135e344b2a5485a9323","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKDBiNmIzNGM4NTY5ZTUwZTFmNDBjODEzNWUzNDRiMmE1NDg1YTkzMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/5011fc1f6a3b811b0bc7bb817b74e53ae91c020d","sha":"5011fc1f6a3b811b0bc7bb817b74e53ae91c020d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/5011fc1f6a3b811b0bc7bb817b74e53ae91c020d"}],"sha":"0b6b34c8569e50e1f40c8135e344b2a5485a9323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/0b6b34c8569e50e1f40c8135e344b2a5485a9323"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/5011fc1f6a3b811b0bc7bb817b74e53ae91c020d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:42:50Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:42:50Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Low-severity cleanups: loader, catalog, SQL import/export, panels\n\n- ModuleLoader: dependency DLLs in a drop-in''s folder are no longer\n  rooted as their own load contexts (only top-level DLLs or the one\n  owning a .deps.json); shared-prefix assemblies the host can''t supply\n  fall back to the module''s own copy instead of FileNotFound; module\n  names are validated against the scaffolder''s pattern and the\n  reserved \"module\" branch\n- Catalog: HideBranch() now works (recorded as a path prefix, filtered\n  in the builder, so hidden sub-branches stay out of MC forms and MCP\n  tools); [DefaultValue] flows into the catalog, MCP input schemas\n  (\"default\") and MC form pre-fill\n- Help provider only matches top-level branches (a command sharing a\n  module''s name no longer inherits its notes) and survives a throwing\n  GetHelpNotes()\n- SqlDdl: schema-qualified names (\"public\".\"users\", db.schema.tbl)\n  import as their last segment everywhere including REFERENCES;\n  duplicate CREATE TABLE (IF NOT EXISTS re-dumps) keeps the first\n  definition instead of throwing; exported SQL no longer mixes EOLs\n- model list reports the filename-derived name Load/Delete/Export\n  actually resolve, instead of the drift-prone JSON-internal one\n- env add warns when DPAPI is unavailable and a secret lands as\n  plaintext; stale \"one JSON file per variable\" docs corrected\n- Mission Control: Referrer-Policy: no-referrer + nosniff on all\n  responses (login URL carries the token); JSON bodies over 10 MB\n  rejected before buffering; terminal only tail-follows when already\n  at the bottom; Terminal stays the landing view instead of an\n  arbitrary auto-selected command form; stale WebSocket handlers can''t\n  corrupt a newer run''s state; panel load failures get a cache-busting\n  Retry and panels unmount via microtask (React nested-root warning)\n- Forms: positional-argument gaps block Run instead of silently\n  shifting argv left\n- Panels: scratchpads Markdown links reject protocol-relative //host;\n  todos rows stay disabled until the list has refreshed\n- SqliteStoreBase init flag is volatile (double-checked locking)\n- todos due dates parse invariant ISO-first instead of CurrentCulture\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca0d85da2e0aed6ce73c5668f9073b076b3ae75b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/ca0d85da2e0aed6ce73c5668f9073b076b3ae75b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/5011fc1f6a3b811b0bc7bb817b74e53ae91c020d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/5011fc1f6a3b811b0bc7bb817b74e53ae91c020d","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKDUwMTFmYzFmNmEzYjgxMWIwYmM3YmI4MTdiNzRlNTNhZTkxYzAyMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/488a228f8c2bd9b349380107e77ad019372efeba","sha":"488a228f8c2bd9b349380107e77ad019372efeba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/488a228f8c2bd9b349380107e77ad019372efeba"}],"sha":"5011fc1f6a3b811b0bc7bb817b74e53ae91c020d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/5011fc1f6a3b811b0bc7bb817b74e53ae91c020d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/488a228f8c2bd9b349380107e77ad019372efeba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:33:24Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:33:24Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Robustness and data-loss fixes across MCP, host, env and Mission Control\n\n- MCP server: non-object JSON-RPC input (batch/scalar) gets a -32600\n  error instead of crashing the server; child dev processes no longer\n  inherit the protocol stdin and are killed after a 5-minute timeout\n- CLI host: a module that throws in ConfigureServices is disabled (not\n  fatal); one that throws in ConfigureCommands gets a placeholder\n  `error` command so the branch stays valid and the failure is visible\n- ModelStore.Save writes via temp file + rename so a crash mid-write\n  can''t destroy the document (autosave hits this path constantly)\n- env add without --scope now preserves an existing variable''s scope;\n  env apply --shell cmd emits quoted `set \"NAME=value\"` (with % doubled\n  for batch files) and skips multi-line values it can''t represent\n- Mission Control: /api/run bounded to 2 min / 4 MB output with the\n  process killed on breach; data-protection keys in mc-keys/ are now\n  DPAPI-encrypted at rest on Windows\n- Frontend: sdk.runJson never rejects (backend restarts no longer\n  strand panel busy state); Modeler flushes the debounced autosave\n  before switching models and serializes PUTs (delete drains in-flight\n  saves so a straggler can''t resurrect the file); Scratchpads confirms\n  deletes and discarding unsaved edits, and rejects saves past the\n  Windows command-line size limit with a clear message\n- Declare esbuild as a direct devDependency (was only reachable as\n  vite''s transitive dep, which a vite upgrade would break)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"deeea4e9e13d4922991431cbd2f22c6aa93b78ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/deeea4e9e13d4922991431cbd2f22c6aa93b78ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/488a228f8c2bd9b349380107e77ad019372efeba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/488a228f8c2bd9b349380107e77ad019372efeba","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKDQ4OGEyMjhmOGMyYmQ5YjM0OTM4MDEwN2U3N2FkMDE5MzcyZWZlYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/f14aefdfd79c4b8ddf232bca46fb3b9d0a270a4a","sha":"f14aefdfd79c4b8ddf232bca46fb3b9d0a270a4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/f14aefdfd79c4b8ddf232bca46fb3b9d0a270a4a"}],"sha":"488a228f8c2bd9b349380107e77ad019372efeba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/488a228f8c2bd9b349380107e77ad019372efeba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/f14aefdfd79c4b8ddf232bca46fb3b9d0a270a4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:26:08Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:26:08Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Harden MCP/MC security surfaces; fix argv, stdout and deploy pitfalls\n\n- Mission Control: loopback Origin/Host + JSON Content-Type gate on\n  /api and /ws, active even with --no-auth (blocks drive-by fetch/WS\n  and DNS-rebinding command execution)\n- MCP: new [HideFromMcp] attribute keeps `env apply` and\n  `env list --show-secrets` out of the tool surface so connected\n  agents can''t pull decrypted secrets\n- Module loader warnings now go to stderr so a bad drop-in DLL can''t\n  corrupt the MCP stdio channel or --json output; model export and\n  env path write raw stdout (no 80-col wrap when redirected)\n- devhand.ps1: exit-code checks on pack/uninstall/install (closes the\n  stale-reinstall trap); process cleanup matches DevHand.Cli instead\n  of any dotnet with \"devhand\" in its args\n- MC forms and MCP argv emit --opt=value so values starting with \"-\"\n  parse correctly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"443d6513f9ca665753cf63ead26d706b6b451a51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/443d6513f9ca665753cf63ead26d706b6b451a51"},"url":"https://