/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/ede18366cc8c5dfbee54cd444fda14dec1ecf5cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:01:29Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:01:29Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"0.11.0","tree":{"sha":"be2ca5cf51d3deac1f85b4d24cdffa2e7e2b25f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/be2ca5cf51d3deac1f85b4d24cdffa2e7e2b25f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/ede18366cc8c5dfbee54cd444fda14dec1ecf5cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/ede18366cc8c5dfbee54cd444fda14dec1ecf5cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKGVkZTE4MzY2Y2M4YzVkZmJlZTU0Y2Q0NDRmZGExNGRlYzFlY2Y1Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/cb40a5b4a5c68dacf17626acad02f8462f1a079d","sha":"cb40a5b4a5c68dacf17626acad02f8462f1a079d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/cb40a5b4a5c68dacf17626acad02f8462f1a079d"}],"sha":"ede18366cc8c5dfbee54cd444fda14dec1ecf5cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/ede18366cc8c5dfbee54cd444fda14dec1ecf5cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/cb40a5b4a5c68dacf17626acad02f8462f1a079d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:00:13Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:00:13Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Streamline module integration: shared build props, Toolkit, load context\n\nReduce the friction of adding a DevHand module across build, code, and\ndiscovery:\n\n- Central build props: Directory.Build.props supplies common TFM/nullable\n  and the module conventions (Spectre/DI/Abstractions refs, and the webui\n  panel embed by folder presence). Directory.Packages.props centralizes all\n  package versions (CPM) and the SQLite security pin. Module csprojs shrink\n  to just their extras.\n- Cli.csproj references src\\DevHand.Modules.* by wildcard, so an in-box\n  module needs only a DevHand.slnx entry.\n- New DevHand.Toolkit: SqliteStoreBase + JsonOutputSettings/JsonOutput.\n  Todos, Scratchpads, and Env stores migrate onto the base; the two list\n  commands onto the JSON helpers.\n- CatalogCommand.SupportsJson, detected from a --json flag.\n- IDevModule.ExposeInCatalog / ExposeAsMcpTools replace the hardcoded\n  mc/mcp string exclusions in CatalogBuilder and ToolRegistry.\n- Drop-in modules load in an AssemblyLoadContext with an\n  AssemblyDependencyResolver (+ native libs), deferring shared host\n  assemblies so IDevModule keeps one identity — modules with their own\n  NuGet/native deps now work.\n- dev module new gains --store, --panel, and --in-box.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dd98c18123e28eaee1d0ef1967a7544e98ab2fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/0dd98c18123e28eaee1d0ef1967a7544e98ab2fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/cb40a5b4a5c68dacf17626acad02f8462f1a079d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/cb40a5b4a5c68dacf17626acad02f8462f1a079d","node_id":"C_kwDOTeLy_toAKGNiNDBhNWI0YTVjNjhkYWNmMTc2MjZhY2FkMDJmODQ2MmYxYTA3OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commit/17538d2e78017143a02d5d9363019cd2efc8ed20","sha":"17538d2e78017143a02d5d9363019cd2efc8ed20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/17538d2e78017143a02d5d9363019cd2efc8ed20"}],"sha":"cb40a5b4a5c68dacf17626acad02f8462f1a079d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/cb40a5b4a5c68dacf17626acad02f8462f1a079d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203685274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/17538d2e78017143a02d5d9363019cd2efc8ed20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:30:27Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:30:27Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Author Mission Control panels in JSX (esbuild build step)\n\nPanels are now written in JSX under webui/src/panel.jsx and compiled to the\nembedded webui/panel.js by web/scripts/build-panels.mjs (esbuild, classic-mode\nh() using the host''s React). Wired into npm build + build:panels and\n./devhand.ps1 build/dev. csproj embeds only the generated panel.js (excludes\nwebui/src); the generated file is committed with a \"do not edit\" banner so\ndotnet-from-source still ships a panel without Node.\n\nRewrote the todos and scratchpads panels as real function components with data\nhooks; split the scratchpads Markdown renderer into webui/src/markdown.js.\nDocumented the panel model in CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b0ae7942e98a411c7608f904293694f67733c33","url":"https://api.g