lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/1294dbdcf16bc562b4ac58ddd634d77fb6b9e208/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:28:49Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:28:49Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"0.10.0\n\nAdd `dev mcp` module: an MCP server (JSON-RPC over stdio) that exposes every\ndiscovered command as an MCP tool, auto-generated from the command catalog.\n\nExtract command-tree introspection out of Mission Control into a shared\nDevHand.Catalog library (CatalogBuilder/RecordingConfigurator/models); the\n`Catalog` type is renamed `CommandCatalog`. Mission Control and Mcp both\nconsume it.\n\nAlso: the Todos Mission Control panel description field is now a textarea.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ca5760e658e31ac36fdd5b381ab2476feb7524f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/4ca5760e658e31ac36fdd5b381ab2476feb7524f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/1294dbdcf16bc562b4ac58ddd634d77fb6b9e208","verification":{"payload":null,"reas