.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/7ed6743f62a5ac5711db47e79be41c212373bd86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:02:12Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:02:12Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"0.9.0\n\nAdd module microfrontends in Mission Control + todo descriptions.\n\n- Mission Control gains a runtime UI-extension mechanism: a module that embeds\n  a webui/panel.js is auto-discovered (ModuleWebUi) and served at\n  /modules/<name>/…; the host loads it via a dynamic import() and mounts it into\n  its own React tree (shared React + SDK on window.DevHandMC), no iframe. Catalog\n  advertises hasUi/uiEntry. Convention over contract — works for compiled-in and\n  drop-in modules alike.\n- New POST /api/run bridge runs a `dev` command and returns captured\n  {code, stdout, stderr} for panels to consume.\n- `todos` ships the first panel: a full CRUD microfrontend (webui/panel.js),\n  backed by a new `todos list --json` output mode.\n- `todos` items gain an optional description (--desc), shown in `list` and the\n  panel; existing databases migrate transparently (ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree"