ts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/otisdaley-vg","id":203685274,"login":"otisdaley-vg","node_id":"U_kgDODCP9mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/otisdaley-vg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/commits/0a25e9cc82de1302f0ec18603bae07fccbb28067/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:02:07Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:02:07Z","email":"Otis.Daley@vegnergroup.com","name":"Otis Daley"},"message":"Add PNG/JPEG image export to the Modeler\n\nThe Export dialog now offers PNG and JPEG alongside SQL/Mermaid/JSON.\nImage export is fully client-side: it rebuilds the selected board as a\nself-contained SVG from the model data (reusing geometry + infra meta so\nit matches the live canvas), then rasterizes it via a canvas at 2x. No new\ndependency, no network. The dialog gains a Schema/Infra board toggle\n(defaulting to the active tab), a live preview, Download, and a PNG-only\nCopy image button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae40793a24e3e8e4a6468291c8dbd6ca8a060c89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/trees/ae40793a24e3e8e4a6468291c8dbd6ca8a060c89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/otisdaley-vg/Devhand/git/commits/0a25e9cc82de1302f0ec18603bae07fccbb28067","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten