s://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/2d53cbe77851b2cf4dbd337828fb29a153c1a4cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:41:21Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:41:21Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"message":"feat: paged Chat Message history, oldest-first (ticket 03)\n\nCompletes the chat-thread feature: GET /api/chat/threads/{threadId}/messages\nreturns a Thread''s Messages paged and oldest-first (a conversation is read\nstart to end, not as a leaderboard), reusing ChatThreadService''s existing\nparty-authorization check. All three chat-thread tickets are now done —\nchatservice has real implementation across the board.\n\nCode review found a real test-coverage gap: every seeded scenario fit within\na single page, so pagination itself (as opposed to the size cap) was never\nactually proven to slice correctly — added a genuine multi-page test (size-1\npage over 3 Messages, all three pages requested in turn) before marking this\ndone. Also fixed a wildcard import flagged as a style regression from the\nrest of the file''s explicit-import convention.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36a8583c835f2d54b6fe9599611912dda864271e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/36a8583c835f2d54b6fe9599611912dda864271e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/2d53cbe77851b2cf4dbd337828fb29a153c1a4cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/2d53cbe77851b2cf4dbd337828fb29a153c1a4cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTeqcvNoAKDJkNTNjYmU3Nzg1MWIyY2Y0ZGJkMzM3ODI4ZmIyOWExNTNjMWE0Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/31289a14cd9314a2af73e1deb6a6b6b568c66c02","sha":"31289a14cd9314a2af73e1deb6a6b6b568c66c02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/31289a14cd9314a2af73e1deb6a6b6b568c66c02"}],"sha":"2d53cbe77851b2cf4dbd337828fb29a153c1a4cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/2d53cbe77851b2cf4dbd337828fb29a153c1a4cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/31289a14cd9314a2af73e1deb6a6b6b568c66c02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:32:27Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:32:27Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"message":"feat: send and deliver Chat Messages in real time (ticket 02)\n\nImplements the biggest and riskiest of the three chat-thread tickets:\nPOST /api/chat/threads/{threadId}/messages persists a Message and broadcasts\nit to /topic/chat/threads/{threadId}, delivered to the other party''s\nWebSocket connection in real time. The broadcast is published as an\nin-process event and pushed only after commit (MessageSentWebSocketPublisher,\n@TransactionalEventListener(AFTER_COMMIT)), mirroring BidPlacedRabbitPublisher''s\nexisting reasoning: pushing synchronously mid-transaction would let a\nrecipient observe state a concurrent read couldn''t yet see.\n\nBuilds this codebase''s first WebSocket authentication/authorization pattern\n(ChatWebSocketAuthInterceptor): unlike notificationservice''s deliberately\nopen /ws, chat content is private to exactly two people, so STOMP CONNECT\nrequires a valid Keycloak JWT and each SUBSCRIBE is checked against real\nThread membership, not client-asserted identity. The HTTP handshake into\n/ws stays public (SecurityConfig) since real auth happens per-STOMP-frame\ninstead.\n\nCode review found no correctness bugs, but caught three acceptance criteria\nthe initial test suite only partially exercised (sending as the winning\nbidder rather than just the Seller, an actually-invalid CONNECT token rather\nthan only a missing one, and the specific case ticket 02 calls out — a valid\ntoken that is a genuine party of a *different* Thread). The implementation\nwas already correct; three tests were added to prove it before marking this\nticket done.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80121eead5e06deb2cea2e484bbf59e515f2f9b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/80121eead5e06deb2cea2e484bbf59e515f2f9b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/31289a14cd9314a2af73e1deb6a6b6b568c66c02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/31289a14cd9314a2af73e1deb6a6b6b568c66c02","node_id":"C_kwDOTeqcvNoAKDMxMjg5YTE0Y2Q5MzE0YTJhZjczZTFkZWI2YTZiNmI1NjhjNjZjMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/d9ed5ad2e39c49a83b9c3646705abccfd9418389","sha":"d9ed5ad2e39c49a83b9c3646705abccfd9418389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/d9ed5ad2e39c49a83b9c3646705abccfd9418389"}],"sha":"31289a14cd9314a2af73e1deb6a6b6b568c66c02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/31289a14cd9314a2af73e1deb6a6b6b568c66c02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/d9ed5ad2e39c49a83b9c3646705abccfd9418389/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:16:48Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:16:48Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"message":"feat: build chatservice — Chat Thread creation from deal.created (ticket 01)\n\nImplements the first of three chat-thread tickets: chatservice consumes\ndeal.created off the existing auction.events exchange and persists a Chat\nThread scoped to the Deal''s Seller and winning Bidder, deriving party\nmembership directly from the event payload rather than calling back to\nauctionservice. GET /api/chat/threads/by-deal/{dealId} looks it up,\nKeycloak-authenticated, not-found for non-parties (same rule GetDealApiTest,\nupdateAuction, and cancelAuction already use).\n\nCode review caught a real transaction-boundary bug before commit: catching\nDataIntegrityViolationException inside the @Transactional service method\ndoesn''t work on Postgres — a unique-constraint violation poisons the whole\ntransaction, so returning normally still fails at commit (\"current\ntransaction is aborted\"). Fixed by moving the catch to the non-transactional\nlistener, after the inner transaction has already rolled back cleanly.\nLocked down with a genuine two-thread concurrency test (not just sequential\nredelivery) that observed a real unique-constraint violation and handled it\ncorrectly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a22401c7d426c07cbd1c9da1b5666f1c5a48c463","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/a22401c7d426c07cbd1c9da1b5666f1c5a48c463"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/d9ed5ad2e39c49a83b9c3646705abccfd9418389","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/d9ed5ad2e39c49a83b9c3646705abccfd9418389","node_id":"C_kwDOTeqcvNoAKGQ5ZWQ1YWQyZTM5YzQ5YTgzYjljMzY0NjcwNWFiY2NmZDk0MTgzODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/ff53b17fc158aeb6deffb0ea793eae54d74d45df","sha":"ff53b17fc158aeb6deffb0ea793eae54d74d45df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/ff53b17fc158aeb6deffb0ea793eae54d74d45df"}],"sha":"d9ed5ad2e39c49a83b9c3646705abccfd9418389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/d9ed5ad2e39c49a83b9c3646705abccfd9418389"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/ff53b17fc158aeb6deffb0ea793eae54d74d45df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:16:03Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:16:03Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"message":"docs: record the AI Advisor grilling decisions and retroactive tickets\n\nCONTEXT.md and .scratch/ai-advisor/spec.md capture the decisions from the\ngrilling session that shaped the AI Advisor build (already implemented and\ncommitted separately in 3ec560f). Four ticket files document what that\ncommit actually built, reformatted to match this repo''s established local\nticket template (docs/agents/issue-tracker.md) after a first draft skipped\nit.\n\nCode review against the real implementation caught two real inaccuracies\nbefore commit: ticket 03 claimed an oversized preference returns 422, but\nagentservice has no validation-exception handler so it actually falls through\nto Spring''s default 400 — corrected, with a note on why 400 is the right\ncode here (422 is reserved for business-rule violations, not request-shape\nones). Ticket 02 claimed a stubbed-HTTP-boundary test proves the Groq\nadapter''s JSON/timeout/circuit-breaker behavior, but no such test exists\n(AiAdviceControllerTest only mocks AiAdviceProvider, never exercises\nGroqAdviceProvider) — the ticket now calls this out as a known gap rather\nthan a checked box.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3505c5d9ee02d68710c0fb1ec2220d2bdf25d701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/3505c5d9ee02d68710c0fb1ec2220d2bdf25d701"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/ff53b17fc158aeb6deffb0ea793eae54d74d45df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/ff53b17fc158aeb6deffb0ea793eae54d74d45df","node_id":"C_kwDOTeqcvNoAKGZmNTNiMTdmYzE1OGFlYjZkZWZmYjBlYTc5M2VhZTU0ZDc0ZDQ1ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/46deb3da22a1db6ee6d27ce608ebd27da535db42","sha":"46deb3da22a1db6ee6d27ce608ebd27da535db42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/46deb3da22a1db6ee6d27ce608ebd27da535db42"}],"sha":"ff53b17fc158aeb6deffb0ea793eae54d74d45df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/ff53b17fc158aeb6deffb0ea793eae54d74d45df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/46deb3da22a1db6ee6d27ce608ebd27da535db42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:08:57Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:08:57Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"message":"fix: route /api/bids/mine through the gateway; prove notificationservice end-to-end\n\ngatewayservice was missing a route for GET /api/bids/mine, built in an\nearlier session but never reachable through the gateway — only\n/api/auctions/**, /api/deals/**, and /api/users/** were routed.\n\nnotificationservice''s test module didn''t even compile (referenced a\ntestcontainers-postgresql class this stateless service has no dependency on)\nand had zero real coverage beyond the generated boilerplate context-load\ntest. Removed the dead Postgres testcontainer bean and an orphaned\nspring-boot-starter-security-oauth2-resource-server-test dependency that was\ntransitively pulling real Spring Security onto the test classpath only,\ncausing tests to see a locked-down /ws endpoint that production never has.\nAdded a real round-trip test: a message published to the real RabbitMQ\nexchange reaches a real STOMP-over-WebSocket client, for both bid.placed and\nauction.closed, plus a regression lock proving deal.created deliberately\nstays log-only (Deal data is privacy-gated everywhere else in this\ncodebase; a properly-scoped authenticated broadcast is a future ticket).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"563a1db0b6d0cc65bb95e300e34af3ae5c35d5b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/563a1db0b6d0cc65bb95e300e34af3ae5c35d5b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/46deb3da22a1db6ee6d27ce608ebd27da535db42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/46deb3da22a1db6ee6d27ce608ebd27da535db42","node_id":"C_kwDOTeqcvNoAKDQ2ZGViM2RhMjJhMWRiNmVlNmQyN2NlNjA4ZWJkMjdkYTUzNWRiNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/3ec560f2d787cb23dd839cc7faa380afd090fe08","sha":"3ec560f2d787cb23dd839cc7faa380afd090fe08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/3ec560f2d787cb23dd839cc7faa380afd090fe08"}],"sha":"46deb3da22a1db6ee6d27ce608ebd27da535db42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/46deb3da22a1db6ee6d27ce608ebd27da535db42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.co