ectStateException the new agentservice tests uncovered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09ca58512fcd8a693f1a738ae5f9a5f5eef3989e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/09ca58512fcd8a693f1a738ae5f9a5f5eef3989e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/ced4bbab7b7c5d76a4c3ee043480c12b4f2bb454","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/ced4bbab7b7c5d76a4c3ee043480c12b4f2bb454","node_id":"C_kwDOTeqcvNoAKGNlZDRiYmFiN2I3YzVkNzZhNGMzZWUwNDM0ODBjMTJiNGYyYmI0NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/4087413ecaa52aecfee577a475211089f34abe49","sha":"4087413ecaa52aecfee577a475211089f34abe49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/4087413ecaa52aecfee577a475211089f34abe49"}],"sha":"ced4bbab7b7c5d76a4c3ee043480c12b4f2bb454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/ced4bbab7b7c5d76a4c3ee043480c12b4f2bb454"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/4087413ecaa52aecfee577a475211089f34abe49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T07:24:06Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T07:24:06Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"message":"feat: initialize aiservice and chatservice with Spring Boot\n\n- Added pom.xml for aiservice with dependencies for Spring Boot, WebFlux, and Eureka client.\n- Created AiserviceApplication class as the entry point for aiservice.\n- Configured application.yml for aiservice with server port, application name, and security settings.\n- Added basic test class for aiservice to verify context loading.\n\nfeat: set up chatservice with Spring Boot\n\n- Added pom.xml for chatservice with dependencies for Spring Boot, WebMVC, RabbitMQ, and PostgreSQL.\n- Created ChatserviceApplication class as the entry point for chatservice.\n- Configured application.properties for chatservice with application name.\n- Implemented test classes for chatservice with Testcontainers configuration for PostgreSQL and RabbitMQ.\n\nrefactor: update InternalAuctionController authorization logic\n\n- Simplified authorization logic in InternalAuctionController to check for audience claims.\n\nchore: add Maven wrapper for chatservice\n\n- Included Maven wrapper scripts and properties for chatservice to ensure consistent Maven version usage.\n\nchore: update Keycloak realm configuration\n\n- Removed SERVICE_AGENT role and associated service account user from Keycloak auction realm configuration.\n- Added audience protocol mapper for auctionservice in Keycloak realm configuration.","tree":{"sha":"4c4fd2ba4c083ac56c426d57b2d603580dab1ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/4c4fd2ba4c083ac56c426d57b2d603580dab1ed8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/4087413ecaa52aecfee577a475211089f34abe49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/4087413ecaa52aecfee577a475211089f34abe49","node_id":"C_kwDOTeqcvNoAKDQwODc0MTNlY2FhNTJhZWNmZWU1NzdhNDc1MjExMDg5ZjM0YWJlNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/ca1c1ee61c2a73b7731f30ccfe8c843247b47119","sha":"ca1c1ee61c2a73b7731f30ccfe8c843247b47119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/ca1c1ee61c2a73b7731f30ccfe8c843247b47119"}],"sha":"4087413ecaa52aecfee577a475211089f34abe49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/4087413ecaa52aecfee577a475211089f34abe49"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/commits/ca1c1ee61c2a73b7731f30ccfe8c843247b47119/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T05:14:04Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T05:14:04Z","email":"poyhidalgo@gmail.com","name":"Jepoy"},"message":"feat: Implement Proxy Bidder Reaction Management\n\n- Added ProxyBidderReactionOutcome enum to represent possible outcomes of proxy bidder reactions.\n- Created ProxyBidderReactionRepository for managing reactions with methods to find by proxy bidder ID and outcome.\n- Introduced ProxyBidderReactionRetryWorker to periodically retry pending reactions.\n- Developed ProxyBidderReactionService to handle the logic for reacting to bid events, including retrying failed reactions.\n- Enhanced ProxyBidderRepository with a method to find active proxy bidders by auction ID.\n- Updated ProxyBidderService to include methods for pausing and reactivating proxy bidders.\n- Added InternalPlaceBidRequest DTO for internal bid placement requests.\n- Modified AuctionController to enforce auction closing permissions based on JWT authentication.\n- Implemented GlobalExceptionHandler to manage exceptions, including NotAuctionOwnerException for unauthorized auction closures.\n- Enhanced Bid model with idempotency support via reactionId.\n- Updated AuctionService to handle bid placements with optional idempotency keys and enforce auction ownership during closures.\n- Created PlaceBidApiTest to validate bid placement behavior, including handling simultaneous bids.\n- Updated application.yml configurations for auction and user services to reflect database connection changes.\n- Added service account role for agentservice in Keycloak realm configuration.","tree":{"sha":"95869bfc64f0eb5e893c349334b9169590bb3ecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/95869bfc64f0eb5e893c349334b9169590bb3ecd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/ca1c1ee61c2a73b7731f30ccfe8c843247b47119","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Po