lient` to interact with auction service.\n- Defined `AuctionBidStateResponse` and `AuctionStatus` for auction state representation.\n- Configured OAuth2 client settings in `OAuthClientConfig`.\n- Established security configurations in `SecurityConfig`.\n- Created custom exceptions for proxy bidder operations.\n- Implemented `ProxyBidder` model and repository for database interactions.\n- Developed service layer for proxy bidder operations.\n- Configured application properties in `application.yml`.\n- Added test configurations with Testcontainers for PostgreSQL and RabbitMQ.\n- Implemented basic tests for application context loading.","tree":{"sha":"0d4a22d9e18f719fe40600268dd4bdd6861596e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/0d4a22d9e18f719fe40600268dd4bdd6861596e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/fc7044134c28611dd1cb38fbe4f63fe543cceac6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/com