 exceptions for auction and bid validation.\n- Create GlobalExceptionHandler for centralized exception handling.\n- Define JPA entities for Auction and Bid models with appropriate annotations.\n- Implement repositories for Auction and Bid entities.\n- Create AuctionService for business logic related to auctions and bids.\n- Configure application properties for Spring application name and JWT issuer URI.\n- Set up test configuration with Testcontainers for PostgreSQL and RabbitMQ.\n- Update documentation for Spring Boot and Spring Cloud versions.\n- Refactor user service to align with new exception handling and validation logic.","tree":{"sha":"ad5a5897b0c16ef3b4e9780ebbe36a9e98715166","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/trees/ad5a5897b0c16ef3b4e9780ebbe36a9e98715166"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Polqt/java-microservice/git/commits/b700a003f48b88c88c457913e5bdde8c917288aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80904366?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt","id":80904366,"login":"Polqt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwOTA0MzY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polqt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Polqt/java-microservice/commit/b