"fix(cep): dedupe ViaCEP lookup and add request timeout/abort\n\nA complete CEP triggered both onChange and onBlur, firing two identical\nViaCEP requests. Track the last looked-up CEP so only the first hits the\nnetwork; onBlur stays as a fallback for values that arrive without\nonChange (autofill/paste), and the ref is released on failure to allow a\nretry.\n\nMake fetchAddressByCep abortable: an internal 8s timeout no longer leaves\nthe spinner stuck when ViaCEP hangs, and an external AbortSignal cancels\nsuperseded lookups and cancels on unmount, preventing stale results from\noverwriting newer ones and setState after unmount.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a799ed75f8dbfee9bc6f5ff88d9127278fb712c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucashparis/address-remote/git/trees/2a799ed75f8dbfee9bc6f5ff88d9127278fb712c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucashparis/address-remote/git/commits/f98b7a7d888a3b5eb869478b2c5ea45fb6f5bdc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63165465?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucashparis","id":63165465,"login":"lucashparis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTY1NDY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucashparis/subscriptions","