"https://api.github.com/users/anshv4586/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anshv4586/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anshv4586/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anshv4586/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anshv4586/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anshv4586","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anshverma0/ADS/commit/e28c03787d77aa2810feed4d308624aa67b68ffb","node_id":"C_kwDOTezM7toAKGUyOGMwMzc4N2Q3N2FhMjgxMGZlZWQ0ZDMwODYyNGFhNjdiNjhmZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anshverma0/ADS/commit/02df6c1cc74ad370d3e02dd23d16f7ac84831b39","sha":"02df6c1cc74ad370d3e02dd23d16f7ac84831b39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/02df6c1cc74ad370d3e02dd23d16f7ac84831b39"}],"sha":"e28c03787d77aa2810feed4d308624aa67b68ffb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/e28c03787d77aa2810feed4d308624aa67b68ffb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/02df6c1cc74ad370d3e02dd23d16f7ac84831b39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T06:35:47Z","email":"aksharma@aims.res.in","name":"aksharma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T06:35:47Z","email":"aksharma@aims.res.in","name":"aksharma"},"message":"refactor: consolidate to CTU-13 single dataset, add comparison pipeline\n\n- Remove synthetic scripts and data (anomaly_detector*.py, generate_*.py,\n  network_traffic.log/.pcap, old PNGs) — project now works on CTU-13 only\n- Add compare_datasets.py: 20K-row attack vs normal comparison with Cohen''s d\n  discrimination chart, overlapping histograms, ROC, PR, threshold sweep,\n  confusion matrix — explains why stealthy botnet C&C signals attack despite\n  low byte rates\n- Move all output PNGs into graphs/ folder; update all scripts to write there\n- Rewrite README: quick start, per-script run instructions, results table,\n  Cohen''s d feature discrimination table, updated file structure and architecture\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1ef9b8ae85bde1068b6a4acce9b78201323fbcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/git/trees/c1ef9b8ae85bde1068b6a4acce9b78201323fbcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/git/commits/02df6c1cc74ad370d3e02dd23d16f7ac84831b39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/anshverma0/ADS/commit/02df6c1cc74ad370d3e02dd23d16f7ac84831b39","node_id":"C_kwDOTezM7toAKDAyZGY2YzFjYzc0YWQzNzBkM2UwMmRkMjNkMTZmN2FjODQ4MzFiMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anshverma0/ADS/commit/88f6c69048beb10264a04deccafeff51bb37e685","sha":"88f6c69048beb10264a04deccafeff51bb37e685","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/88f6c69048beb10264a04deccafeff51bb37e685"}],"sha":"02df6c1cc74ad370d3e02dd23d16f7ac84831b39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/02df6c1cc74ad370d3e02dd23d16f7ac84831b39"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/88f6c69048beb10264a04deccafeff51bb37e685/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:50:23Z","email":"aksharma@aims.res.in","name":"aksharma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:50:23Z","email":"aksharma@aims.res.in","name":"aksharma"},"message":"add experiments, paper draft, and IF explainability scripts\n\n- explain_isolation_forest.py: educational walkthrough of IF internals on\n  13-point hand-crafted dataset; shows decision paths, path lengths, and\n  feature split counts per tree\n- run_ctu13_v2.py: all-57-features experiment; documents curse of\n  dimensionality for IF (naive all-features drops F1 by 9.8 points vs\n  10-feature baseline; PR curve shows 100% recall at optimal threshold)\n- PROGRESS.md: full session log — environment setup, codebase map,\n  all experiment results, roadmap to 90/90 precision/recall\n- paper.md: living research paper draft with abstract, methodology,\n  experiment writeups, paper outline, and open research questions\n- PNG outputs for both experiments\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04b1a5aee5439fd5b8b78821e753ae18b4a151d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/git/trees/04b1a5aee5439fd5b8b78821e753ae18b4a151d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/git/commits/88f6c69048beb10264a04deccafeff51bb37e685","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/anshverma0/ADS/commit/88f6c69048beb10264a04deccafeff51bb37e685","node_id":"C_kwDOTezM7toAKDg4ZjZjNjkwNDhiZWIxMDI2NGEwNGRlY2NhZmVmZjUxYmIzN2U2ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anshverma0/ADS/commit/6f103c27abbe55775be887249d5d8ff985fad173","sha":"6f103c27abbe55775be887249d5d8ff985fad173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/6f103c27abbe55775be887249d5d8ff985fad173"}],"sha":"88f6c69048beb10264a04deccafeff51bb37e685","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/88f6c69048beb10264a04deccafeff51bb37e685"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212317454?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrishnash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrishnash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrishnash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrishnash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/akrishnash","id":212317454,"login":"akrishnash","node_id":"U_kgDODKe1Dg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrishnash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrishnash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrishnash/repos","site_admin"