score + frequency rules)\n- anomaly_detector_v2.py: v2 Isolation Forest detector, accepts PCAP and CSV\n- run_ctu13.py: real-world CTU-13 botnet dataset runner with precision/recall report\n- generate_sample_log.py / generate_sample_pcap.py: synthetic data generators\n  with 5 planted anomaly types (traffic spike, port scan, brute force,\n  night activity, data exfiltration)\n- Sample output PNGs included for each detector variant\n- Validated on CTU-13 real botnet data: 55% attack recall, 70% precision,\n  fully unsupervised (no labels used during training)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e756d9ff4b98dd4b3d78a3f2aec012ef96b2a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/git/trees/4e756d9ff4b98dd4b3d78a3f2aec012ef96b2a46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/git/commits/e512341b14a6a260ffe12c4d06cb3be1661a3484","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/anshverma0/ADS/commit/e512341b14a6a260ffe12c4d06cb3be1661a3484","node_id":"C_kwDOTezM7toAKGU1MTIzNDFiMTRhNmEyNjBmZmUxMmM0ZDA2Y2IzYmUxNjYxYTM0ODQ","parents":[],"sha":"e512341b14a6a260ffe12c4d06cb3be1661a3484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits/e512341b14a6a260ffe12c4d06cb3be1661a3484"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/anshverma0/ADS/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=16f99d17adab323a75462ccfcd849a76f611ee95&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A25%3A45.591Z"}');
