/commit/9100614c4e192f673823822b9059addff330e4fa","node_id":"C_kwDOTe6ta9oAKDkxMDA2MTRjNGUxOTJmNjczODIzODIyYjkwNTlhZGRmZjMzMGU0ZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wazifxze/RMC-1KM-ROCKET/commit/f70a970c52a7c317395a63683c45fb0e1be36573","sha":"f70a970c52a7c317395a63683c45fb0e1be36573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wazifxze/RMC-1KM-ROCKET/commits/f70a970c52a7c317395a63683c45fb0e1be36573"}],"sha":"9100614c4e192f673823822b9059addff330e4fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wazifxze/RMC-1KM-ROCKET/commits/9100614c4e192f673823822b9059addff330e4fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235714394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wazifxze","id":235714394,"login":"wazifxze","node_id":"U_kgDODgy3Wg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wazifxze/RMC-1KM-ROCKET/commits/f70a970c52a7c317395a63683c45fb0e1be36573/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T14:11:32Z","email":"m-12225141@moe-dl.edu.my","name":"wazifxze"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T14:11:32Z","email":"m-12225141@moe-dl.edu.my","name":"wazifxze"},"message":"improved\n\nThe update from v1.1 to v1.2 introduces three main improvements that make the system more reliable and keep the logs accurate:Fixed SPI Bus Contention (Hardware Reliability): In v1.1, the LoRa pin was left floating while the SD card initialized, which could cause both devices to talk over SPI simultaneously and lead to initialization failures. V1.2 fixes this by explicitly setting both Chip Select pins high before starting the SPI bus.  Fixed Data-to-Header Mismatch (Log Accuracy): V1.1 wrote 15 data fields to the CSV log file (including GPS coordinates, altitude, and satellite count), but its header only labeled the first 11 fields. V1.2 updates the header string so every logged column has a corresponding title.  Code Maintenance & Readability: Removed temporary developer comments about potential BMI160 compilation errors, cleaned up formatting around the GPS processing loop, and added inline documentation explaining why the SPI CS lines are managed early.","tree":{"sha":"7eab52da78e9fb485e716b9dcb5c98755f67d024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wazifxze/RMC-1KM-ROCKET/git/trees/7eab52da78e9fb485e716b9dcb5c98755f67d024"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wazifxze/RMC-1KM-ROCKET/git/commits/f70a970c52a7c317395a63683c45fb0e1be36573","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235714394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wazifxze","id":235714394,"login":"wazifxze","node_id":"U_kgDODgy3Wg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wazifxze/starr