로그인ADN·사용자명 컬럼 제거\n\n- 유형: EDN 전용 화면이라 항상 ''내선'' → 불필요.\n- 로그인ADN·사용자명: 목록에서 제외(상세/드로어에서 확인).\n노드 컬럼(직전 추가)은 유지.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"2a59e065fe96d314dc11e5c1ffd2da2111b80b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/2a59e065fe96d314dc11e5c1ffd2da2111b80b2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/46a4a4a26e08605078ce9282ba702f81e4d6620f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/46a4a4a26e08605078ce9282ba702f81e4d6620f","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDQ2YTRhNGEyNmUwODYwNTA3OGNlOTI4MmJhNzAyZjgxZTRkNjYyMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/600a474941d5b493882f81eee0e1b94c9101fad3","sha":"600a474941d5b493882f81eee0e1b94c9101fad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/600a474941d5b493882f81eee0e1b94c9101fad3"}],"sha":"46a4a4a26e08605078ce9282ba702f81e4d6620f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/46a4a4a26e08605078ce9282ba702f81e4d6620f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/600a474941d5b493882f81eee0e1b94c9101fad3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:09:56Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:10:45Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"✨feat(ipron): 업무시간 운영자 등록·헤더 정리 + 미디어전달 노드선택 + 내선 노드컬럼\n\n교환기 업무시간 관리 (IeWorktimeList)\n- 운영자 전체모드 등록 버튼 차단 제거 → 드로어에서 테넌트 필수 Select(수신차단 방식).\n  create API 에 actAsTenantFromBody: true.\n- 헤더를 국선관리처럼 정리: 제목 텍스트 제거, 액션 버튼 우측 그룹화, 검색창 추가.\n\n미디어전달관리 (MediaDeliveryList/Form)\n- 전체 노드일 때 그룹 추가가 노드1로 강제되던 버그 수정 → 노드 선택 노출.\n- 아이템 폼 등록 모드 노드 선택(발신DNIS 방식).\n\n내선(DnTable)\n- 내선프로파일 컬럼 앞에 노드 컬럼 추가(nodeName, NODE_ID=0 → \"기본\").\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"b02ecc20b3223408a1b192ae6062e35a6b33cbe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/b02ecc20b3223408a1b192ae6062e35a6b33cbe5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/600a474941d5b493882f81eee0e1b94c9101fad3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/600a474941d5b493882f81eee0e1b94c9101fad3","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDYwMGE0NzQ5NDFkNWI0OTM4ODJmODFlZWUwZTFiOTRjOTEwMWZhZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/bbc1cee8342cf01ff861231ad93b21682f645548","sha":"bbc1cee8342cf01ff861231ad93b21682f645548","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bbc1cee8342cf01ff861231ad93b21682f645548"}],"sha":"600a474941d5b493882f81eee0e1b94c9101fad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/600a474941d5b493882f81eee0e1b94c9101fad3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bbc1cee8342cf01ff861231ad93b21682f645548/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:08:46Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:10:45Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"🔨refactor(ipron): 멘트 화면 정리 — 드로어 간소화·노드 컬럼·공용멘트 노드선택 복원\n\nMentFormDrawer (공유)\n- 테넌트명 필드: 공용멘트(tenantId=0)에서 숨김. 그 외 테넌트는 노출.\n- 업로드일자 DatePicker 제거(서버 insert 시각 사용) — createDate 미전송.\n- 대량등록 ''템플릿 다운로드'' 버튼/핸들러 제거(FE 전용 CSV). 대량등록 모드 자체는 유지.\n\nMentTable (공유)\n- 노드 컬럼 추가(멘트ID 다음): nodeName, NODE_ID=0 → \"기본\" 배지.\n\n공용멘트(MentCommonList)\n- 노드 선택 복원(전역 전용 과잉단순화 되돌림): 노드 드롭다운 + useNodeTenantScope,\n  노드별 조회 병합. 테넌트는 항상 0(공용, 테넌트 드롭다운 없음). 등록 시 nodeId=선택노드.\n\n두 화면 하단 그리드 여백(p-5) + border-t 구분선 표준화.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"e188c469d9cbc832a433df139c11489d9d795d7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/e188c469d9cbc832a433df139c11489d9d795d7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/bbc1cee8342cf01ff861231ad93b21682f645548","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/bbc1cee8342cf01ff861231ad93b21682f645548","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGJiYzFjZWU4MzQyY2YwMWZmODYxMjMxYWQ5M2IyMTY4MmY2NDU1NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/fc48fa093d5655f0d42b3bbde7b73fcd72a89eb1","sha":"fc48fa093d5655f0d42b3bbde7b73fcd72a89eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/fc48fa093d5655f0d42b3bbde7b73fcd72a89eb1"}],"sha":"bbc1cee8342cf01ff861231ad93b21682f645548","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bbc1cee8342cf01ff861231ad93b21682f645548"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/fc48fa093d5655f0d42b3bbde7b73fcd72a89eb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:05:54Z","email":"sm.yang@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"sm.yang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:05:54Z","email":"sm.yang@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"sm.yang"},"message":"✨feat(ipron): IPT 사용자관리·조직도관리 화면 신규 구현\n\n- IPT 조직도관리(IPR20S2056) — 테넌트별 조직 트리, 조직 CRUD 드로어,\n  정렬순서 일괄 변경, 운영자 대행 테넌트 선택기 구현\n- IPT 사용자관리(IPR20S2055) — 사용자 목록 그리드, CRUD 드로어, DN 할당,\n  그룹 이동, 직급·직책 관리, 엑셀 일괄등록(부분성공 207 처리) 구현\n- BFF flow 매핑은 BE 시드 V141·V142 기준, 멘트 콤보는 기존\n  ipron-acd-gdn-ment-options flow 재사용\n- routes.tsx에 pv 소켓 ''ipt-user''/''ipt-org'' 및 lazy 라우트 등록\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2c6f494b4cd2164d4eaa4b736037b7bcbc1d316","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/f2c6f494b4cd2164d4eaa4b736037b7bcbc1d316"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/fc48fa093d5655f0d42b3bbde7b73fcd72a89eb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/fc48fa093d5655f0d42b3bbde7b73fcd72a89eb1","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGZjNDhmYTA5M2Q1NjU1ZjBkNDJiM2JiZGU3YjczZmNkNzJhODllYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/ba8b11b827d348d4b9f407e2f85e7f7ee8ccc3cb","sha":"ba8b11b827d348d4b9f407e2f85e7f7ee8ccc3cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/ba8b11b827d348d4b9f407e2f85e7f7ee8ccc3cb"}],"sha":"fc48fa093d5655f0d42b3bbde7b73fcd72a89eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/fc48fa093d5655f0d42b3bbde7b73fcd72a89eb1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/ba8b11b827d348d4b9f407e2f85e7f7ee8ccc3cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:44:31Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:44:31Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"Merge branch ''master'' of http://100.100.103.5/BT-ADMIN/BT-ADMIN-FE","tree":{"sha":"75e7bc5f7454ebf71a12a8431bc72ad73f968298","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/75e7bc5f7454ebf71a12a8431bc72ad73f968298"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/ba8b11b827d348d4b9f407e2f85e7f7ee8ccc3cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/ba8b11b827d348d4b9f407e2f85e7f7ee8ccc3cb","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGJhOGIxMWI4MjdkMzQ4ZDRiOWY0MDdlMmY4NWU3ZjdlZThjY2MzY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/a4b8cf8775bcb646f6d80c42597e178c0241a067","sha":"a4b8cf8775bcb646f6d80c42597e178c0241a067","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/a4b8cf8775bcb646f6d80c42597e178c0241a067"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/da4165ea66419d370647f7c60af25530e4f3b0e7","sha":"da4165ea66419d370647f7c60af25530e4f3b0e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/da4165ea66419d370647f7c60af25530e4f3b0e7"}],"sha":"ba8b11b827d348d4b9f407e2f85e7f7ee8ccc3cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/ba8b11b827d348d4b9f407e2f85e7f7ee8ccc3cb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/a4b8cf8775bcb646f6d80c42597e178c0241a067/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:42:51Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:42:51Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"📦️chore: process.env 참조 포괄 치환 안전망 추가\n\n[배경]\n- rsbuild define은 명시 키만 치환. 라이브러리가 임의의\n  process.env.X를 참조하면 브라우저에 process가 없어\n  ReferenceError 발생 (react-draggable DRAGGABLE_DEBUG 사례).\n- 키별 개별 치환은 새 사례마다 반복 추가 필요.\n\n[조치]\n- remote 공통 팩토리(tools/rsbuild/remote-config.ts)와 host 설정에\n  포괄 규칙 `''process.env'': ''({})''` 추가 — 미정의 키 접근은 전부\n  undefined로 안전 처리.\n- 기존 DRAGGABLE_DEBUG 개별 치환은 포괄 규칙의 부분집합이라 제거.\n- 치환은 긴 키 우선이므로 APP_VERSION 명시 키, rsbuild 내장\n  NODE_ENV, PUBLIC_* 자동 노출은 영향 없음.","tree":{"sha":"7e95453d0f40e98bcdd4b434c25d0331ad565f2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/7e95453d0f40e98bcdd4b434c25d0331ad565f2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/a4b8cf8775bcb646f6d80c42597e178c0241a067","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":n