ents","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:30:29Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:30:29Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"Merge branch ''feat/scoped-query-keys''\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\ttools/rsbuild/remote-config.ts","tree":{"sha":"827590027cfccdb01ea4010a9883eaa53c937364","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/827590027cfccdb01ea4010a9883eaa53c937364"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/685d39e36d3c41c2a83539a00d1ae8c1fcb03c5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/685d39e36d3c41c2a83539a00d1ae8c1fcb03c5e","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDY4NWQzOWUzNmQzYzQxYzJhODM1MzlhMDBkMWFlOGMxZmNiMDNjNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/9f5e84cf41468226abd2b2182910c91a04e91c14","sha":"9f5e84cf41468226abd2b2182910c91a04e91c14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/9f5e84cf41468226abd2b2182910c91a04e91c14"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/00d4f47db8bb462e95f7e06b46e2288fcdcea66d","sha":"00d4f47db8bb462e95f7e06b46e2288fcdcea66d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/00d4f47db8bb462e95f7e06b46e2288fcdcea66d"}],"sha":"685d39e36d3c41c2a83539a00d1ae8c1fcb03c5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/685d39e36d3c41c2a83539a00d1ae8c1fcb03c5e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/00d4f47db8bb462e95f7e06b46e2288fcdcea66d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:26:47Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:26:47Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"✨feat: query key 앱 스코프 자동 접두 체계 도입\n\n[배경]\n- host 셸이 QueryClient 를 공유해 서로 다른 앱이 같은 queryDef 를 쓰면\n  캐시가 섞여 타 앱 목록이 표시되는 문제 존재(''monitoring'' vel-stt,\n  ''tracking'' fca-ipron 실제 충돌 확인).\n\n[구조]\n- libs/shared-util 에 createScopedQueryKeys 추가 — queryDef 앞에 앱\n  폴더명 접두를 강제하는 createQueryKeys 래퍼.\n- rsbuild 설정(tools/rsbuild/remote-config.ts, host rsbuild.config.ts)이\n  __APP_NAME__ define 을 앱 폴더명으로 주입. 전역 선언 types/defines.d.ts.\n- 앱 11곳에 src/app/shared/queryKeys.ts(createAppQueryKeys) 신설.\n  shared-util 은 MF 공유 싱글턴이라 define 소비는 앱 소스에서만 수행\n  (라이브러리에서 읽으면 공급자 앱 이름이 전 앱에 박혀 무력화됨).\n\n[강제]\n- eslint no-restricted-imports 로 apps 에서 query-key-factory 값 import\n  금지(타입 import 허용, libs 제외). 신규 코드 우회 차단.\n\n[마이그레이션]\n- 전 앱 124개 파일 createQueryKeys 호출을 createAppQueryKeys 로 치환.\n  queryDef 문자열은 유지(런타임 키만 접두 추가).\n- 팩토리 우회 하드코딩 키 리터럴 12곳 팩토리 참조로 정리 — 방치 시 접두\n  적용 후 캐시 무효화 불일치 발생(manager mask-unmask·mask-policy,\n  insight search-condition, ipron tracking·tracking-audit·adn·\n  related-calls).\n- 배포 시 전 캐시 키 변경되나 쿼리 persist 미사용이라 사용자 영향 없음.\n\n[문서·생성기]\n- add-api SKILL, AGENTS.md, DEVELOPER_GUIDE 를 새 패턴으로 갱신하고\n  배열 리터럴 쿼리 키 하드코딩 금지 규칙 명문화.\n- pnpm gen remote 템플릿에 shared/queryKeys.ts 포함 — 신규 remote 자동\n  적용.\n\n[검증]\n- 앱 11곳 tsc --noEmit 통과, 변경 파일 eslint 0 error, 금지 규칙 음성\n  테스트(위반 파일 생성-검출-삭제) 통과.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAA9mFr9akVByzMFrRRsto","tree":{"sha":"92a7451c79c0a5c283ad559c15e535981a3af7bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/92a7451c79c0a5c283ad559c15e535981a3af7bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/00d4f47db8bb462e95f7e06b46e2288fcdcea66d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/00d4f47db8bb462e95f7e06b46e2288fcdcea66d","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDAwZDRmNDdkYjhiYjQ2MmU5NWY3ZTA2YjQ2ZTIyODhmY2RjZWE2NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/0423f7afc262767fac3e0e4f3bfd07cc6b75af34","sha":"0423f7afc262767fac3e0e4f3bfd07cc6b75af34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/0423f7afc262767fac3e0e4f3bfd07cc6b75af34"}],"sha":"00d4f47db8bb462e95f7e06b46e2288fcdcea66d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/00d4f47db8bb462e95f7e06b46e2288fcdcea66d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/9f5e84cf41468226abd2b2182910c91a04e91c14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:23:51Z","email":"sm.yang@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"sm.yang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:23:51Z","email":"sm.yang@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"sm.yang"},"message":"🐛fix: rsbuild 전환 후 캔버스 패널 드래그·리사이즈 불능 수정\n\n- react-grid-layout 내장 react-draggable이 `process.env.DRAGGABLE_DEBUG` 참조.\n- Rsbuild 전환 후 해당 키 미치환으로 raw process 잔존 → 드래그 시작 시\n  ReferenceError(process is not defined)로 드래그·리사이즈 전체 불능.\n- remote 공통 rsbuild define에 `undefined` 치환 추가로 해결.","tree":{"sha":"3dbe0473f9f35691e834ccdcdfd71ab3f7cb283b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/3dbe0473f9f35691e834ccdcdfd71ab3f7cb283b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/9f5e84cf41468226abd2b2182910c91a04e91c14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/9f5e84cf41468226abd2b2182910c91a04e91c14","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDlmNWU4NGNmNDE0NjgyMjZhYmQyYjIxODI5MTBjOTFhMDRlOTFjMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/0423f7afc262767fac3e0e4f3bfd07cc6b75af34","sha":"0423f7afc262767fac3e0e4f3bfd07cc6b75af34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/0423f7afc262767fac3e0e4f3bfd07cc6b75af34"}],"sha":"9f5e84cf41468226abd2b2182910c91a04e91c14","url":"https://