"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:27:26Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:27:26Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"💄design(ipron): 그리드 뱃지·필터 라벨 표준화 2차 — 잔존 위반 정리\n\n- 국선관리(EndpointList) 상태 뱃지 6개 컬럼(국선차단·국선상태·멤버\n  블록/모니터링/등록·등록번호 사용/인증)을 표준 Badge 기반 StatusBadge\n  헬퍼로 전면 교체 — !h-6 높이 고정으로 셀 꽉 참 증상 해소, inline hex\n  제거, 차단 해제=green을 표준 gray로 교정.\n- 로컬 pill 컴포넌트 3종 표준 Badge 기반 재작성: CtiQueueTable StatePill\n  (블록 설정=red 표준 적용), SkillsetTable YnPill, TrackingAuditPage\n  ActionBadge(+액션 filterValueGetter).\n- SearchResultGrid 상태 컬럼 9곳+ rounded-full span pill을 표준 Badge로\n  형태 교체(색 메타는 기존 토큰 유지).\n- AdnTable·AgentAdnTable·AgentMasterTable·AcdGdnMemberGrid·DnTable·\n  ScheduleInfoTable·DodTransList·AclList·MsGroupList·RouteList·\n  RoutePointDialog·SipHeaderManage·SkillAssignStatusModal 커스텀\n  pill/색 텍스트/antd Tag를 표준 Badge로 교체(활성=emerald 등 색 의미 교정).\n- CommonTrunkList 블록 라벨을 ''사용/미사용''에서 ''설정/해제''로 통일\n  (SipTrunkList 1차 확정 정합), PbxWorktimeSlotTable 사용여부\n  filterValueGetter 추가.\n\n기준: .claude/skills/add-grid/SKILL.md 2-2·2-3 (커밋 e0247e50)","tree":{"sha":"2d99e65795d332d607961d87ca6551aa5b392f63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/2d99e65795d332d607961d87ca6551aa5b392f63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/646641878bfb6d540a4befc187d0d4ad55b77839","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/646641878bfb6d540a4befc187d0d4ad55b77839","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDY0NjY0MTg3OGJmYjZkNTQwYTRiZWZjMTg3ZDBkNGFkNTViNzc4Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/cb7b70653813216ddcadbbc3c354feaf2f742938","sha":"cb7b70653813216ddcadbbc3c354feaf2f742938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/cb7b70653813216ddcadbbc3c354