2938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/cb7b70653813216ddcadbbc3c354feaf2f742938"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/b69ed769c31a78f4f007c19a613742fa06eacdb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:24:59Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:24:59Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"💄design(stt): 그리드 뱃지·필터 라벨 표준화 2차 — 잔존 위반 정리\n\n- 화자(rxtxKind) 코드→고객/상담원/통합 매핑 컬럼 6파일(RecogEvaluate·\n  RecogTargetList·RecogTargetSearch·TuningSentence·ConfidenceTraining·\n  SttModelRecogDrawer)에 RXTX_KIND_LABEL 상수화 + filterValueGetter 추가.\n- SttDictionary 사용여부·SttSearch I/O구분 Badge hex 색상을 tailwind\n  토큰(emerald/gray·blue/amber)으로 교체.\n- ConfidenceTraining 신뢰도 Badge에 !h-6 높이 고정·표준 토큰 적용 및\n  가운데 정렬.\n- DnList 시스템그룹(hostName→PA_GROUP_LABEL_BY_CODE) filterValueGetter 추가.\n\n기준: .claude/skills/add-grid/SKILL.md 2-2·2-3 (커밋 e0247e50)","tree":{"sha":"4e9d9412a74b49e54a00a41806f2c4ecbca0df30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/4e9d9412a74b49e54a00a41806f2c4ecbca0df30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/b69ed769c31a78f4f007c19a613742fa06eacdb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/b69ed769c31a78f4f007c19a613742fa06eacdb2","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGI2OWVkNzY5YzMxYTc4ZjRmMDA3YzE5YTYxMzc0MmZhMDZlYWNkYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/9aa0edd0bb7b514d1531ab254e5731b6e6a64a47","sha":"9aa0edd0bb7b514d1531ab254e5731b6e6a64a47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/9aa0edd0bb7b514d1531ab254e5731b6e6a64a47"}],"sha":"b69ed769c31a78f4f007c19a613742fa06eacdb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/b69ed