count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:23:02Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"💄design(manager): 그리드 뱃지·필터 라벨 표준화 2차 — 잔존 위반 정리\n\n- MaskPolicyManagement 상태 컬럼 커스텀 span pill을 표준 Badge(활성\n  emerald/비활성 gray, !h-6 높이 고정)로 교체.\n- 상태(enabled)·룰(ruleType) 컬럼에 filterValueGetter 추가 — 필터 목록에\n  1/0·코드값 대신 라벨 노출.\n\n기준: .claude/skills/add-grid/SKILL.md 2-2·2-3 (커밋 e0247e50)","tree":{"sha":"7ef193b4a47387a17bac411afe0680ad06588f2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/7ef193b4a47387a17bac411afe0680ad06588f2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/bf6937adc64a6ef55d545a378a9c6022fea2c34e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/bf6937adc64a6ef55d545a378a9c6022fea2c34e","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGJmNjkzN2FkYzY0YTZlZjU1ZDU0NWEzNzhhOWM2MDIyZmVhMmMzNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/444db04e3f2da019d5342ef96f932171cba3dabc","sha":"444db04e3f2da019d5342ef96f932171cba3dabc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/444db04e3f2da019d5342ef96f932171cba3dabc"}],"sha":"bf6937adc64a6ef55d545a378a9c6022fea2c34e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bf6937adc64a6ef55d545a378a9c6022fea2c34e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/18f170ace326742d97eea84ad2d59856dfd86aef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:22:36Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:22:36Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"🔨refactor(ipron): 멘트 화면 스코프 드롭다운 정리 (관리 공통화·공용 전역전용)\n\n교환기 멘트 관리 (MentMgmtList)\n- 상단 테넌트/노드 스코프 드롭다운을 DN 화면과 1:1 동일 패턴으로 공통화.\n  \"전체 노드\" 옵션 + swap 버튼 + operatorMode 분기(일반=노드만, 운영자=테넌트↔노드).\n  기본값 전체(테넌트)↔전체(노드).\n- BE 목록 API 가 nodeId 필수라 \"전체 노드\"는 노드별 조회 후 병합(useQueries + dedupe).\n\n교환기 공용멘트 관리 (MentCommonList)\n- 공용멘트는 항상 전역(NODE_ID=0, TENANT_ID=0) — AS-IS 확인. 노드 개념 불필요.\n- 노드 드롭다운/useNodeTenantScope/useQueries 병합 제거 → nodeId=0,tenantId=0 단일 조회.\n- 등록/동기화도 전역 고정(nodeId=0).\n\nBE·API 계층 무변경. ipron 앱 타입체크·eslint 통과.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"f5e9f294165cf15a5fb191db081c7e477b8fab6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/f5e9f294165cf15a5fb191db081c7e477b8fab6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/18f170ace326742d97eea84ad2d59856dfd86aef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/18f170ace326742d97eea84ad2d59856dfd86aef","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDE4ZjE3MGFjZTMyNjc0MmQ5N2VlYTg0YWQyZDU5ODU2ZGZkODZhZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/215ac6b38dad55bc511e50db93178d44595cec5c","sha":"215ac6b38dad55bc511e50db93178d44595cec5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/215ac6b38dad55bc511e50db93178d44595cec5c"}],"sha":"18f170ace326742d97eea84ad2d59856dfd86aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/18f170ace326742d97eea84ad2d59856dfd86aef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175795103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yujeong1012","id":175795103,"login":"yujeong1012","node_id":"U_kgDOCnprnw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c