nManagementContext의 테넌트 상태·조회·검증 로직이 되살아남.\n\n[원인]\nfeature/campaign 브랜치가 9275e879에서 이미 제거했던 부분인데, 병합 시점에\nmaster 쪽 캠페인 CRUD 작업과 충돌하며 테넌트 제거분이 반영되지 않고\nmerge 이전(테넌트 있는) 버전으로 해소됨.\n\n[조치]\n- useCampaignManagementContext.ts를 feature/campaign 브랜치 최종본\n  (tenantIds/setTenantIds/tenantSelectOptions/validateContext 테넌트 체크\n  없는 버전)으로 복원\n- CampaignList.tsx에서 CampaignManagementContextHeader 렌더링과\n  tenantIds 관련 참조 제거, CRUD/삭제 연동 로직은 그대로 유지\n- CampaignScenario.tsx 등 다른 화면은 이미 정상 병합됨 확인, 미변경\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b60ef4fe4a18e48d2f3777ee5335f8de3e9e9de4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/b60ef4fe4a18e48d2f3777ee5335f8de3e9e9de4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/ed6854553c39e229004fbc7a9f4deeb545af098f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175795103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yujeong1012","id":175795103,"login":"yujeong1012","node_id":"U_kgDOCnprnw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/ed6854553c39e229004fbc7a9f4