\n- 실행기간 입력에서 시분초 제거, 일자만 입력받도록 변경\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"091f3bc778a5c38f16e69d99af5b94750487b75c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/091f3bc778a5c38f16e69d99af5b94750487b75c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/2ce13f2647c0dfab53d1889265c501381cf2ac07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175795103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yujeong1012","id":175795103,"login":"yujeong1012","node_id":"U_kgDOCnprnw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yujeong1012","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/2ce13f2647c0dfab53d1889265c501381cf2ac07","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDJjZTEzZjI2NDdjMGRmYWI1M2QxODg5MjY1YzUwMTM4MWNmMmFjMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/e0247e502ccd79811add6dcf682116f5c4c605a1","sha":"e0247e502ccd79811add6dcf682116f5c4c605a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/e0247e502ccd79811add6dcf682116f5c4c605a1"}],"sha":"2ce13f2647c0dfab53d1889265c501381cf2ac07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/2ce13f2647c0dfab53d1889265c501381cf2ac07"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/215ac6b38dad55bc511e50db93178d44595cec5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:41:47Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:41:47Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"💄design(ipron): 회선/미디어 화면 AG-Grid 여백 표준화 + 노드 드롭다운 공통화\n\nAG-Grid 여백 표준화 (add-grid 스킬 5절)\n- 하단 그리드 래퍼에 p-5 패딩 추가(그리드가 박스 테두리에 붙던 문제 해소).\n- 헤더의 border-b 제거 → 헤더 아래 별도 border-t 구분선.\n- 우측 버튼 유무에 따라 헤더 py-3/py-5, 탭 변형은 pr-5.\n- 대상 11화면: Endpoint/Route/Acl/DidTrans/DidRoute/PreNumTrans/DodTrans/\n  MsGroup/MediaDelivery/McsDnis/CallScreen (레퍼런스였던 DodTrans 자체도 미준수라 교정).\n- McsDnis: 카드 ↔ AG-Grid 리스트 뷰토글 신규(useViewMode(''ipron-mcs-dnis'')).\n\n노드 드롭다운 공통화\n- 인라인 커스텀 노드 Select(테두리 div + Network 아이콘 + borderless Select)를\n  공통 ScopeSelect kind=\"node\"(Server 아이콘 표준)로 통일. 9화면.\n- 기존 노드 상태/데이터/onChange 부수효과(선택 초기화 등) 보존, 값 타입만 규약 변환.\n- DodTrans 는 테넌트 ScopeSelect + 노드 swap 순서 로직 그대로 두고 노드 element만 교체.\n- 미사용 import(Network/Select) 정리.\n\n기능·컬럼·비즈니스 로직 변경 없음. 운영자모드/노드변경 등 최근 커밋 로직 보존.\nipron 앱 타입체크 통과.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"b8f99134b46c5e8dda3262172d7373e0683d5167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/b8f99134b46c5e8dda3262172d7373e0683d5167"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/215ac6b38dad55bc511e50db93178d44595cec5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/215ac6b38dad55bc511e50db93178d44595cec5c","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDIxNWFjNmIzOGRhZDU1YmM1MTFlNTBkYjkzMTc4ZDQ0NTk1Y2VjNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/66c1dc8101b8efaafd0dca7143d245a6df497952","sha":"66c1dc8101b8efaafd0dca7143d245a6df497952","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/66c1dc8101b8efaafd0dca7143d245a6df497952"}],"sha":"215ac6b38dad55bc511e50db93178d44595cec5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/215ac6b38dad55bc511e50db93178d44595cec5c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/e0247e502ccd79811add6dcf682116f5c4c605a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:30:10Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:30:10Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"📚docs: add-grid 스킬에 코드값 라벨 표기 기준·필터 통일 소절 추가\n\n- 2-3 소절 신설 — 컬럼 값의 라벨 표기 여부를 \"사용자 어휘 vs 시스템 어휘\"로\n  판정하는 기준 정리(내부 코드·플래그는 라벨, 이름·식별자 등 사용자 데이터는 원본).\n- 라벨 컬럼 표준 세트 규정 — cellRenderer + shadcn Badge(2-2 스타일) +\n  cellStyle 가운데 정렬 + filterValueGetter 필터 라벨 통일. 샘플 코드 포함.\n- 뱃지 불필요한 단순 치환 컬럼은 valueFormatter + filterValueGetter 쌍으로\n  같은 라벨 함수 재사용하도록 명시.\n- 대표 관례 값 라벨·색상 통일 표 추가 — 사용/활성(emerald), 진행 상태\n  (gray/blue/emerald/red), 성공/실패, 차단 설정(red), 배정, 예약(purple).\n  전수조사 결과 화면마다 표기 상이(antd Tag green·hex 색·맨 텍스트 혼재)하여\n  발견 시 교체 대상으로 규정.\n- 2-2 팔레트 의미 조정 — 활성을 blue에서 emerald로 이동.\n- 체크리스트 3항목·frontmatter description 트리거 문구 추가.","tree":{"sha":"6c85caa90bde7e70da39162cf0180474ae1b50b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/6c85caa90bde7e70da39162cf0180474ae1b50b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/e0247e502ccd79811add6dcf682116f5c4c605a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/e0247e502ccd79811add6dcf682116f5c4c605a1","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGUwMjQ3ZTUwMmNjZDc5ODExYWRkNmRjZjY4MjExNmY1YzRjNjA1YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/3c8f27b46a651f106beb31624500b216350e8eef","sha":"3c8f27b46a651f106beb31624500b216350e8eef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/3c8f27b46a651f106beb31624500b216350e8eef"}],"sha":"e0247e502ccd79811add6dcf682116f5c4c605a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/e0247e502ccd79811add6dcf682116f5c4c605a1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/3c8f27b46a651f106beb31624500b216350e8eef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:52:13Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:52:13Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"📚docs: commit 스킬에 줄 시작 `단어:` 패턴 금지 규칙 추가\n\n- conventional-commits-parser가 `토큰: 값` 형태로 시작하는 본문 줄을\n  footer(`Signed-off-by:` 류)로 오인, 앞에 빈 줄이 없으면\n  footer-leading-blank 위반으로 commit-msg hook 실패 확인(실측 사례 명기).\n- 본문 문체 절에 금지 규칙·회피법(괄호 나열, bullet, wrap 조정) 추가.\n- 메시지 제시 전 체크리스트에 동일 점검 항목 추가.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAA9mFr9akVByzMFrRRsto","tree":{"sha":"4ec87706fe13703d23234df325387c5f503b1d91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/4ec87706fe13703d23234df325387c5f503b1d91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/3c8f27b46a651f106beb31624500b216350e8eef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/3c8f27b46a651f106beb31624500b216350e8eef","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDNjOGYyN2I0NmE2NTFmMTA2YmViMzE2MjQ1MDBiMjE2MzUwZThlZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/4e3c4e49de2ab15f3467fdc494bc98ef9df064b4","sha":"4e3c4e49de2ab15f3467fdc494bc98ef9df064b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/c