:null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/66c1dc8101b8efaafd0dca7143d245a6df497952/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:45:46Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:45:46Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"💄design(ipron): 업무시간 테넌트 드롭다운 통일 + IPRON 6화면 카드/리스트 뷰토글\n\n교환기 업무시간 관리\n- 중간의 테넌트 선택 토글 버튼 박스를 공통 ScopeSelect 드롭다운으로 교체\n  (CtiCodeList 와 동일한 운영자모드 파생값 사용: operatorMode/actAsTenantId).\n\nIPRON 리스트 뷰토글 (카드 ↔ AG-Grid 리스트)\n- 업무시간/미디어전달/MS그룹/긴급프로파일/SIP헤더/디바이스기능 프로파일 6화면에\n  ViewModeToggle + useViewMode(''ipron-*'') 추가 (DodTransList 패턴 복제).\n- 리스트 뷰는 useAggridOptions + defaultColDef suppressHeaderMenuButton:true,\n  선택 하이라이트(rowClassRules + redrawRows), 행클릭 선택/더블클릭 수정.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"553ef4ceef16aafa208960f6ea4df9f9b7be2a3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/553ef4ceef16aafa208960f6ea4df9f9b7be2a3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/66c1dc8101b8efaafd0dca7143d245a6df497952","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/66c1dc8101b8efaafd0dca7143d245a6df497952","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDY2YzFkYzgxMDFiOGVmYWFmZDBkY2E3MTQzZDI0NWE2ZGY0OTc5NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/206a5f3b90b6b837fe8e409c401749fd2c185a7d","sha":"206a5f3b90b6b837fe8e409c401749fd2c185a7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/206a5f3b90b6b837fe8e409c401749fd2c185a7d"}],"sha":"66c1dc8101b8efaafd0dca7143d245a6df497952","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/66c1dc8101b8efaafd0dca7143d245a6df497952"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/206a5f3b90b6b837fe8e409c401749fd2c185a7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:44:42Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:44:42Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"🐛fix(ipron): 발신DNIS 등록 노드 변경 + 수신차단 운영자모드 추가/삭제 정합\n\n발신 DNIS 사전변환\n- 등록 Drawer 가 리스트 선택 노드를 고정으로 받아 노드 필드가 잠겼던 문제 수정.\n  등록 모드에서는 노드 Select 를 항상 유지해 선택 후에도 자유 변경 가능.\n  리스트 선택 노드는 기본값으로만 채움. 수정 모드는 기존대로 노드 변경 불가.\n\n수신번호 차단관리 (운영자 모드)\n- 운영자 전체(view-all) 모드에서 추가 버튼을 비활성화하던 로직 제거 → 항상 활성.\n- 추가 폼에 테넌트 필수 Select 추가(전체모드에서만 노출, DnForm 패턴).\n  제출 시 body.tenantId 로 대상 테넌트 지정, apiClient actAsTenantFromBody 로\n  X-Act-As-Tenant 승격 → BFF isSystemAdmin 재검증 후 수용.\n- BE TenantGuard view-all 정합(별도 커밋)과 함께 크로스테넌트 삭제 403 해소.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"efd2ff4872d202072a2bb82104324774521a6bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/efd2ff4872d202072a2bb82104324774521a6bf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/206a5f3b90b6b837fe8e409c401749fd2c185a7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/206a5f3b90b6b837fe8e409c401749fd2c185a7d","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDIwNmE1ZjNiOTBiNmI4MzdmZThlNDA5YzQwMTc0OWZkMmMxODVhN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/22a60b138227b6522d3133c6611eebbd67d4b0d9","sha":"22a60b138227b6522d3133c6611eebbd67d4b0d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/22a60b138227b6522d3133c6611eebbd67d4b0d9"}],"sha":"206a5f3b90b6b837fe8e409c401749fd2c185a7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/206a5f3b90b6b837fe8e409c401749fd2c185a7d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/96bbd7c868820e3aefdf2448019292184a40fdf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:22:55Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:43:12Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🔨refactor: antd v6 폐기 prop 일괄 치환 — 콘솔 deprecation 경고 제거\n\n전 화면 콘솔 전수조사에서 확인된 antd 6.5.1 폐기 prop을 로컬 타입 정의로\n치환 API를 검증한 뒤 일괄 교체. 동작 변화 없음.\n\n- Modal/Drawer destroyOnClose → destroyOnHidden (42건)\n- Modal/Drawer maskClosable → mask.closable (12건)\n- Drawer width → size (70여건 — v6 size는 number|string 허용 확인)\n- Select 계열 dropdownRender → popupRender (18건)\n- Tooltip/Popover overlayStyle → styles.root (6건)\n- Empty imageStyle → styles.image (18건)\n- Divider type → orientation (12건)\n- Popover onOpenChange에 setState 세터 직결 시 개발 빌드 arity 검사로 내부\n  파라미터 경고 발생 → 단일 인자 래핑(manager MenuTree, insight ChipSelect 2곳)\n- 여러 줄 JSX로 grep에 안 걸리던 Drawer width 13곳은 스캔 스크립트로 검출해\n  포함. 비-antd overlayStyle(aoe HelperLines의 svg 지역변수)은 제외.\n- 보류: Input/InputNumber addonAfter → Space.Compact는 마크업 구조 변경이라\n  화면별 디자인 검토 후 별도 진행 예정. 대상 13파일은 aoe(AgentBasicInfo,\n  EvalExecution), insight(WidgetCatalogSettingsForm, ChannelDetailWidget,\n  CtiqStatusWidget, HealthBoardWidget, TimeTrendWidget),\n  ipron(BsrGroupFormDrawer, CtiQueueBulkUpdateModal, CosForm, DidRouteForm),\n  manager(MaskCategoryEditModal, MaskUnmaskReviewDrawer).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAA9mFr9akVByzMFrRRsto","tree":{"sha":"fb46eda541fbddd48c4c3311497cf9e6f90f5206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/fb46eda541fbddd48c4c3311497cf9e6f90f5206"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/96bbd7c868820e3aefdf2448019292184a40fdf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/96bbd7c868820e3aefdf2448019292184a40fdf1","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDk2YmJkN2M4Njg4MjBlM2FlZmRmMjQ0ODAxOTI5MjE4NGE0MGZkZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/2e25ca8543b800dcbe673c8d9fafc210c04248b0","sha":"2e25ca8543b800dcbe673c8d9fafc210c04248b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/2e25ca8543b800dcbe673c8d9fafc210c04248b0"}],"sha":"96bbd7c868820e3aefdf2448019292184a40fdf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/96bbd7c868820e3aefdf2448019292184a40fdf1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/2e25ca8543b800dcbe673c8d9fafc210c04248b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:21:45Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:21:45Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🔨refactor: AG Grid 폐기 selection 옵션 신 API 마이그레이션\n\n- rowSelection 문자열(''single''/''multiple'') → RowSelectionOptions 객체로 전환.\n- suppressRowClickSelection·colDef checkboxSelection/headerCheckboxSelection →\n  rowSelection.enableClickSelection/checkboxes/headerCheckbox로 이관, 수동\n  체크박스 전용 colDef 제거(신 API 자동 선택 컬럼과 중복 방지).\n- 신 API 기본값 차이(checkboxes 기본 true, enableClickSelection 기본 false)로\n  인한 동작 회귀를 명시 플래그로 차단 — 기존 화면 동작 동일 유지.\n- manager 장애이력의 조건부 체크박스(미복구 행만 허용)는 checkboxes 콜백으로\n  이관, headerCheckbox는 기존과 동일하게 미표시.\n- 대상: manager FaultHistoryList, ivr SleeConfigList, aoe KnowledgeFileList,\n  ipron BsrCtiqAssignPanel. 브라우저 재검증 완료(경고 0·체크 동작 확인).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAA9mFr9akVByzMFrRRsto","tree":{"sha":"c005443f29aab04871f238076a07c934b620a526","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/c005443f29aab04871f238076a07c934b620a526"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/2e25ca8543b800dcbe673c8d9fafc210c04248b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/2e25ca8543b800dcbe673c8d9fafc210c04248b0","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDJlMjVjYTg1NDNiODAwZGNiZTY3M2M4ZDlmYWZjMjEwYzA0MjQ4YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/0453418dcf00576850439458baf98cfe7fc50b14","sha":"0453418dcf00576850439458baf98cfe7fc50b14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/0453418dcf00576850439458baf98cfe7fc50b14"}],"sha":"2e25ca8543b800dcbe673c8d9fafc210c04248b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/2e25ca8543b800dcbe673c8d9fafc210c04248b0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/0453418dcf00576850439458baf98cfe7fc50b14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:20:11Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:20:11Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix: 콘솔 전수조사 발견 React·antd Form 정합성 오류 일괄 수정\n\n- manager 권한 목록 중복 key: BE /permission-auth-list 응답의 authKey 중복이\n  원인 — getAuthList에서 uniqBy 방어. 원천 중복 제거는 BE 전달 예정.\n- insight 대시보드 위젯명 칩 중복 key: 같은 이름 위젯이 허용되는 데이터라\n  이름+인덱스 복합 key로 교체.\n- stt CallStatusList: 축약 Fragment(<>)에 key 미부여 → Fragment key 지정.\n- ipron cti-queue: 닫힌 오버레이 mount 시 resetFields() 호출로 useForm 미연결\n  경고 → Drawer·Modal에 forceRender 추가.\n- ipron 단말 이력: controlled Form.Item 내부 Select defaultValue 제거 →\n  Form initialValues로 이전.\n- aoe 모델 생성: 렌더 중 form.getFieldsValue() 호출이 미연결 경고 유발 →\n  Form.useWatch 구독으로 교체.\n- fca 슬롯 통계: Select 옵션 value null 경고 → ''ALL'' sentinel 도입, 조회·엑셀\n  파라미터 변환부에서 null 복원(의미 유지).\n- AG Grid destroyed API 호출(error #26): 실출처는 공용 AggridRowDataSidebar의\n  selectionChanged 리스너(스택 캡처로 확정) → isDestroyed 가드. fca\n  ModelIntentList·BotVersionList 핸들러에도 동일 가드.\n- 부수: cti-queue 2파일·SlotStatistics·ModelIntentList에 antd 폐기 prop 치환\n  일부 포함(파일 단위 스테이징 사정).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAA9mFr9akVByzMFrRRsto","tree":{"sha":"f9bcd58863e921aa62ca2cc379f2cba2d6f7e683","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/f9bcd58863e921aa62ca2cc379f2cba2d6f7e683"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/0453418dcf00576850439458baf98cfe7fc50b14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/0453418dcf00576850439458baf98cfe7fc50b14","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDA0NTM0MThkY2YwMDU3Njg1MDQzOTQ1OGJhZjk4Y2ZlN2ZjNTBiMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/bb1d4f6d831106910085ef09b6783c87fbd07c4b","sha":"bb1d4f6d831106910085ef09b6783c87fbd07c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bb1d4f6d831106910085ef09b6783c87fbd07c4b"}],"sha":"0453418dcf00576850439458baf98cfe7fc50b14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/0453418dcf00576850439458baf98cfe7fc50b14"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bb1d4f6d831106910085ef09b6783c87fbd07c4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:19:20Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:19:20Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix: MF shared에서 recharts 제외 — ipron 콜 추적 청크 로드 오류 수정\n\n[증상]\n/ipron/tracking 첫 진입(콜드 캐시) 시 victory-vendor/d3-shape 벤더 청크에서\nTypeError(Cannot read properties of undefined, reading ''call'') 발생.\n\n[원인]\nrecharts가 MF shared(loaded-first)로 전 remote에 공유되며 벤더 청크 모듈\n그래프가 공유 스코프와 얽혀 모듈 팩토리 미등록 상태로 require됨.\n\n[조치]\nexcludedLibraries에 recharts 추가 — 각 앱 self-bundle로 격리(echarts 인스턴스\n불일치 제외 선례와 동일 정책). 콜드 로드 재검증 완료.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAA9mFr9akVByzMFrRRsto","tree":{"sha":"9055c1d5755b0516ab13fc3c7e04602e93f43212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/9055c1d5755b0516ab13fc3c7e04602e93f43212"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/bb1d4f6d831106910085ef09b6783c87fbd07c4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/bb1d4f6d831106910085ef09b6783c87fbd07c4b","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGJiMWQ0ZjZkODMxMTA2OTEwMDg1ZWYwOWI2NzgzYzg3ZmJkMDdjNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/5d8811dbbc4efcc1c0ccce7335a1fe03802360ea","sha":"5d8811dbbc4efcc1c0ccce7335a1fe03802360ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/5d8811dbbc4efcc1c0ccce7335a1fe03802360ea"}],"sha":"bb1d4f6d831106910085ef09b6783c87fbd07c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bb1d4f6d831106910085ef09b6783c87fbd07c4b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/b13ff89df980ed6d6b6aa004791caa66b2dfb27a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:15:43Z","email":"bt1@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"bridgetec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:15:43Z","email":"bt1@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"bridgetec"},"message":"Merge branch ''master'' into feature/campaign","tree":{"sha":"335c5394f14e6438fc31c9ab4c60b4424b3b14ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/335c5394f14e6438fc31c9ab4c60b4424b3b14ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/b13ff89df980ed6d6b6aa004791caa66b2dfb27a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer