769a94cac5cd808279b1ca9443","sha":"9b24293e893706769a94cac5cd808279b1ca9443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/9b24293e893706769a94cac5cd808279b1ca9443"}],"sha":"29d2ec75d071e9617f5099ed50912c7cd62b3968","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/29d2ec75d071e9617f5099ed50912c7cd62b3968"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/9b24293e893706769a94cac5cd808279b1ca9443/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:08:16Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:08:16Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"📚docs: API 핵심 규칙에 참조 무결성 판정 BE 위임 항목 추가\n\n- 핵심 규칙 7번 신설: 삭제·변경 전 가능 여부 사전조회 판정 패턴\n  금지, 서버 409/400 message 표시로 대응. 폼 수준 즉시 검증만 허용.\n- 정본은 워크스페이스 AGENTS.md \"검증 책임 분리\" — 단독 clone\n  세션에서도 요지가 읽히도록 요약 포함.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAA9mFr9akVByzMFrRRsto","tree":{"sha":"e85108214f11af7e5f63d897676c82aede73875f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/e85108214f11af7e5f63d897676c82aede73875f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/9b24293e893706769a94cac5cd808279b1ca9443","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/9b24293e893706769a94cac5cd808279b1ca9443","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDliMjQyOTNlODkzNzA2NzY5YTk0Y2FjNWNkODA4Mjc5YjFjYTk0NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/bf9754564ecc1fd50d5c641bbc8a67a25cb7626b","sha":"bf9754564ecc1fd50d5c641bbc8a67a25cb7626b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bf9754564ecc1fd50d5c641bbc8a67a25cb7626b"}],"sha":"9b24293e893706769a94cac5cd808279b1ca9443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/9b24293e893706769a94cac5cd808279b1ca9443"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bf9754564ecc1fd50d5c641bbc8a67a25cb7626b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:51:04Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:51:04Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix(ipron): 국선 삭제 사전검증을 BE 판정으로 위임 + 진입 무한루프 해소\n\n[증상]\n국선관리 진입 직후 \"Maximum update depth exceeded\" 오류\n(EndpointList.tsx 227행 setTenantOptions 무한 setState).\n\n[원인]\nhandleDelete 의 try 블록 안 논리식(`||`)이 React Compiler 미지원 조합\n→ 컴포넌트 전체 memoization bailout → useGetNodeTenants 로딩 중 기본값\n`[]` 참조가 렌더마다 새로 생성되어 tenantOptions effect 무한 재실행.\n\n[조치]\n- 삭제 전 멤버·인증번호 존재 사전조회(try/catch) 제거 — 판정은 BE\n  deleteEndpoint(409)로 일원화. 우회·경합 문제 해소.\n- 삭제 뮤테이션에 onError 추가, 서버 message 를 토스트 표시(extractMsg\n  헬퍼, ipron 기존 패턴).\n- try/catch 제거로 Compiler bailout 해소 → 무한루프 소멸\n  (babel 변환으로 CompileSuccess·memo 캐시 생성 확인).\n\n[연관]\nBE(BT-ADMIN-BE) 국선 삭제 409 거부 커밋과 세트 배포 필요 — FE 단독\n배포 시 하위 존재 국선이 연쇄 삭제됨(구 BE 는 차단 없음).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAA9mFr9akVByzMFrRRsto","tree":{"sha":"cc3696daa6e9b747eb2e5889e3f2757553394559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/cc3696daa6e9b747eb2e5889e3f2757553394559"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/bf9754564ecc1fd50d5c641bbc8a67a25cb7626b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/bf9754564ecc1fd50d5c641bbc8a67a25cb7626b","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGJmOTc1NDU2NGVjYzFmZDUwZDVjNjQxYmJjOGE2N2EyNWNiNzYyNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/117dff9222e03719896483213039bbc778dbeb17","sha":"117dff9222e03719896483213039bbc778dbeb17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/117dff9222e03719896483213039bbc778dbeb17"}],"sha":"bf9754564ecc1fd50d5c641bbc8a67a25cb7626b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/bf9754564ecc1fd50d5c641bbc8a67a25cb7626b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/117dff9222e03719896483213039bbc778dbeb17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T07:29:22Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T07:29:22Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix: antd 6.5 DOM 클래스 변경으로 무효화된 커스텀 selector 수정\n\n[원인]\n- antd 6.0.0 → 6.5.1 업그레이드로 내부 DOM 클래스 개편.\n- Tabs(6.5.0): content-holder/content/tabpane 구조가\n  body-holder/body/content로 변경.\n- Checkbox(6.3.0): 내부 -inner 노드 제거, 박스 스타일이\n  .ant-checkbox 본체로 이동.\n- Alert: message 영역이 section/title 구조로 개편.\n- Collapse: 내용 영역 -content-box가 -body로 변경.\n- 기존 커스텀 selector가 대상을 잃어 탭 영역 높이 붕괴,\n  체크박스 커스텀 스타일·여백·글자 크기 조정 소실 발생.\n\n[조치]\n- aoe DataProviderDb: Tabs 높이 체인 selector 3종 신규 클래스로 치환.\n- insight Step3FieldMapping: 동일 패턴 치환.\n- ipron AgentMasterFormDrawer: 드로어 폼 탭 padding selector 치환.\n- manager WorkHistoryDetailDrawer: 탭 최소 높이 적용 대상을\n  wrapper(.ant-tabs-body)로 치환.\n- manager PermissionSelector: 어두운 헤더 체크박스 스타일을\n  .ant-checkbox 기준으로 재작성(체크마크는 ::after).\n- manager PageVariantManagement: 깨진 지정 안내 Alert 글자 크기\n  selector를 .ant-alert-title로 치환.\n- aoe workflow.css: 속성 패널 Collapse 내용 여백 selector를\n  .ant-collapse-body로 치환.\n- src 전체 ant-* 클래스 토큰 전수 추출 후 설치된 6.5.1 소스와\n  대조 검증 완료 — 그 외 사용 클래스는 전부 존재 확인.","tree":{"sha":"b160016f0a201b941617f96a91d8557e2d0673ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/b160016f0a201b941617f96a91d8557e2d0673ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/117dff9222e03719896483213039bbc778dbeb17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/117dff9222e03719896483213039bbc778dbeb17","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDExN2RmZjkyMjJlMDM3MTk4OTY0ODMyMTMwMzliYmM3NzhkYmViMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/7655acd9fbf04132c2f898698b162875e86bc469","sha":"7655acd9fbf04132c2f898698b162875e86bc469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/7655acd9fbf04132c2f898698b162875e86bc469"}],"sha":"117dff9222e03719896483213039bbc778dbeb17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/117dff9222e03719896483213039bbc778dbeb17"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/7655acd9fbf04132c2f898698b162875e86bc469/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:19:43Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:19:43Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix: 드롭다운 메뉴에서 antd 확인 모달 열 때 스택 오버플로 수정\n\n[증상]\n카드형 목록(봇 목록·모델 목록 등)의 더보기 메뉴에서 삭제 클릭 시\nUncaught RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded 발생.\n\n[원인]\nRadix DropdownMenu 기본 modal=true의 포커스 트랩(handleFocusOut)이\n닫힘 애니메이션 동안에도 유지된 채 antd Modal.confirm 포커스 트랩\n(syncFocus)과 서로 포커스를 뺏는 동기 무한 루프 형성. 빌드 체계 전환\n커밋(17c23d63)에 동반된 antd 6.0.0→6.5.1·radix 일괄 마이너 업그레이드\n이후 발현.\n\n[조치]\n- 공통 shadcn dropdown-menu 래퍼의 Root에 modal=false 기본 적용,\n  포커스 트랩 자체를 제거해 루프 성립 차단. 사용처 prop으로 override 가능.\n- 브라우저 재현 검증: 신규 로드 후 더보기 → 삭제 → 취소 전체 사이클에서\n  오류 0건 확인(수정 전 동일 시나리오 5회 발생).\n- 부수 효과: 메뉴 열림 중 배경 스크롤 잠금·aria-hidden 미적용(영향 미미).","tree":{"sha":"45ef53151e9c9ae98239bb1c662a025ff421bf41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/45ef53151e9c9ae98239bb1c662a025ff421bf41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/7655acd9fbf04132c2f898698b162875e86bc469","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/7655acd9fbf04132c2f898698b162875e86bc469","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDc2NTVhY2Q5ZmJmMDQxMzJjMmY4OTg2OThiMTYyODc1ZTg2YmM0Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/5174aa152c8351f6f87c4b690eeae6d5182af9d4","sha":"5174aa152c8351f6f87c4b690eeae6d5182af9d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/5174aa152c8351f6f87c4b690eeae6d5182af9d4"}],"sha":"7655acd9fbf04132c2f898698b162875e86bc469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/7655acd9fbf04132c2f898698b162875e86bc469"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/5174aa152c8351f6f87c4b690eeae6d5182af9d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:02:27Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:02:27Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix: MF 공유에 shared-util 누락으로 remote발 토스트 미표시 수정\n\n[증상]\nremote 화면에서 toast 호출 시 화면에 토스트가 표시되지 않음.\n\n[원인]\ntools/mf/shared-config.ts의 워크스페이스 lib 공유 등록이 ''@/shared-store''\n뿐이라 ''@/shared-util''은 remote마다 자기 복사본으로 번들됨. 토스트는\nshared-util의 useToastStore(zustand)에 push하는데, remote는 자기 인스턴스에\npush하고 host ToastProvider는 host 인스턴스를 구독해 서로 어긋남.\n\n[조치]\n''@/shared-util''을 ''@/shared-store''와 동일 정책(singleton·strictVersion·\nversion 명시·consumeOnly 시 import:false)으로 공유 등록. 두 lib 등록을\n루프로 통합. host·remote·custom 모두 createSharedConfig 경유라 일괄 반영.","tree":{"sha":"157a0eb202eafa3b645d7564f785580d495a8072","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/157a0eb202eafa3b645d7564f785580d495a8072"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/5174aa152c8351f6f87c4b690eeae6d5182af9d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/5174aa152c8351f6f87c4b690eeae6d5182af9d4","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDUxNzRhYTE1MmM4MzUxZjZmODdjNGI2OTBlZWFlNmQ1MTgyYWY5ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/c8519a50b3b8650909de71f7efe4028e0db3cf94","sha":"c8519a50b3b8650909de71f7efe4028e0db3cf94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/c8519a50b3b8650909de71f7efe4028e0db3cf94"}],"sha":"5174aa152c8351f6f87c4b690eeae6d5182af9d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/5174aa152c8351f6f87c4b690eeae6d5182af9d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/c8519a50b3b8650909de71f7efe4028e0db3cf94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:48:35Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:48:35Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"💄design: 메뉴 패널 운영자 배지를 아이콘화하고 툴팁 정비\n\n[배지 개편 — apps/host]\n- OperatorOnlyBadge: \"운영자 전용\" 텍스트 필 → ShieldCheck 아이콘(앰버,\n  size-5.5). TenantChip 운영자 모드와 동일한 방패 컨셉으로 통일.\n- OperatorAwareBadge: \"운영자 모드\" 텍스트 필 → FolderSync 아이콘(보라,\n  size-5.5). 테넌트 범위 전환 의미 표현.\n- 텍스트 필 배지는 OperatorOnly/OperatorAwareTextBadge로 분리 보존,\n  PanelDetailSplit 우측 상세 프리뷰 타이틀 옆에 표시.\n- 네이티브 title 속성 → 공통 shadcn Tooltip으로 교체(우측 표시·검정 배경·\n  소형 텍스트·2줄 구성). 메뉴패널이 z-900이라 툴팁에 z-1100 지정\n  (기본 z-50이면 패널 뒤에 가려짐).\n\n[의존성]\n- lucide-react 0.525.0 → 1.25.0 업그레이드. 전체 9개 앱 tsc 통과,\n  pnpm-lock의 ag-grid-enterprise 패치 정보 보존 확인.","tree":{"sha":"037715689b28c0b0b113b151d8c401228cbf1663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/037715689b28c0b0b113b151d8c401228cbf1663"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/c8519a50b3b8650909de71f7efe4028e0db3cf94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/