tps://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/2ce7481ad676bc937624c2a15980960f01e15c1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:39:01Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:39:01Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix(host): 운영자 모드 중 테넌트 전환 시 모드가 되살아나는 문제 수정\n\n[증상]\n운영자 모드에서 테넌트 전환 시 로컬 미러(exitOperator)만 해제하고 서버\n해제 API 를 호출하지 않음. switch-tenant 가 operatorMode 클레임을\n보존하므로 리로드 후 /me 미러링으로 운영자 모드가 다시 켜짐.\n\n[조치]\n- handleTenantSelect: 운영자 모드일 때 exitOperatorMutation.mutateAsync()\n  로 서버 해제 완료 후 switchTenant 진행. 리로드는 switchTenant 성공\n  시에만 수행.\n- 해제 실패 시 전환 중단(Log.warn 기록, 에러 토스트는 onError 담당).\n- exitOperatorMutation 훅 레벨 onSuccess 의 리로드 제거 — 콜사이트\n  책임으로 분리(단독 해제는 즉시, 전환 경유는 switchTenant 완료 후).","tree":{"sha":"66b91aded760d355badfa96a33f312ebe19bfd83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/66b91aded760d355badfa96a33f312ebe19bfd83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/2ce7481ad676bc937624c2a15980960f01e15c1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/2ce7481ad676bc937624c2a15980960f01e15c1c","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDJjZTc0ODFhZDY3NmJjOTM3NjI0YzJhMTU5ODA5NjBmMDFlMTVjMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/d0d44949147d04d3641718349773a0174a03f763","sha":"d0d44949147d04d3641718349773a0174a03f763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d0d44949147d04d3641718349773a0174a03f763"}],"sha":"2ce7481ad676bc937624c2a15980960f01e15c1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/2ce7481ad676bc937624c2a15980960f01e15c1c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d0d44949147d04d3641718349773a0174a03f763/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T01:58:36Z","email":"akdrhtn@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"박상민"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T01:58:36Z","email":"akdrhtn@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"박상민"},"message":"✨feat(manager): 장애 이력 화면 신규 (AS-IS IPR60S5010 이관)\n\n- 시스템 > 장애관리 > 장애 이력 라우트(fault/history) 및 화면 추가.\n- 요약 스탯 3종(장애 발생 건수·미복구·미복구 Critical) — 조회 기간 연동,\n  Critical 색상·배경 강조, 숫자 폰트 크기 통일.\n- 목록: 서버 페이징 + 필터(기간/미복구/등급/오류코드 부분검색), 고정폭\n  컬럼(flex:0 명시) + 메시지 flex·툴팁, 미복구 행만 체크 가능.\n- 상세 드로어: 발생 정보 + 같은 장애 Key 이벤트 시퀀스 + 메모 저장.\n- 강제복구 모달: 다건 일괄 요청, 복구시각 기본 현재, 사유 필수,\n  건별 성공/실패 결과 표시.\n- API 계층: BFF flow(manager-fault-history-*) 경유. add-api 규약 준수 —\n  useGet* 네이밍, params/queryOptions 시그니처, 캐시 무효화는 호출\n  컴포넌트 mutationOptions.onSuccess 에서 처리.","tree":{"sha":"a9116af8255d992cb539a240aa0ebfc591703558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/a9116af8255d992cb539a240aa0ebfc591703558"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/d0d44949147d04d3641718349773a0174a03f763","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/d0d44949147d04d3641718349773a0174a03f763","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGQwZDQ0OTQ5MTQ3ZDA0ZDM2NDE3MTgzNDk3NzNhMDE3NGEwM2Y3NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/623625f08b888f2af38ab13d34485f0e97ed6163","sha":"623625f08b888f2af38ab13d34485f0e97ed6163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/623625f08b888f2af38ab13d34485f0e97ed6163"}],"sha":"d0d44949147d04d3641718349773a0174a03f763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d0d44949147d04d3641718349773a0174a03f763"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/b1d31a9cddaac7a42153a00337a75ae7bd5df849/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T00:39:47Z","email":"bt1@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"br