·패턴수·액션). 선택강조 rowClassRules+redrawRows,\n행클릭=마스터선택/더블클릭=수정. 발신라우트·국선 패턴 동일. 카드형·하단\n패턴 그리드·노드/테넌트 필터·검색·CRUD 전부 유지.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"46f4fe0c6d9ca70760b56763746572bb407d59aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/46f4fe0c6d9ca70760b56763746572bb407d59aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/623625f08b888f2af38ab13d34485f0e97ed6163","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/623625f08b888f2af38ab13d34485f0e97ed6163","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDYyMzYyNWYwOGI4ODhmMmFmMzhhYjEzZDM0NDg1ZjBlOTdlZDYxNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/d4afce32cba0338d430ded2715641d9723d9c4df","sha":"d4afce32cba0338d430ded2715641d9723d9c4df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d4afce32cba0338d430ded2715641d9723d9c4df"}],"sha":"623625f08b888f2af38ab13d34485f0e97ed6163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/623625f08b888f2af38ab13d34485f0e97ed6163"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d4afce32cba0338d430ded2715641d9723d9c4df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:36:17Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:36:17Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"Merge branch ''master'' of http://100.100.103.5/BT-ADMIN/BT-ADMIN-FE","tree":{"sha":"787a01a12155c8bda7c2c15710559bebdcfbe162","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/787a01a12155c8bda7c2c15710559bebdcfbe162"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/d4afce32cba0338d430ded2715641d9723d9c4df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/d4afce32cba0338d430ded2715641d9723d9c4df","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGQ0YWZjZTMyY2JhMDMzOGQ0MzBkZWQyNzE1NjQxZDk3MjNkOWM0ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/448db2cf1376286aa0af410b6147254189961936","sha":"448db2cf1376286aa0af410b6147254189961936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/448db2cf1376286aa0af410b6147254189961936"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/41655775cf2550c1d43feddf6db4e47fe151fdad","sha":"41655775cf2550c1d43feddf6db4e47fe151fdad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/41655775cf2550c1d43feddf6db4e47fe151fdad"}],"sha":"d4afce32cba0338d430ded2715641d9723d9c4df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d4afce32cba0338d430ded2715641d9723d9c4df"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/448db2cf1376286aa0af410b6147254189961936/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:35:38Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:35:38Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"💄design(ipron): 국선 리스트 AG-Grid화 + 하단그리드 여백 + DID라우트 폼 아코디언화\n\n- EndpointList: 리스트형(VIEW_MODE.LIST)을 일반 table → AG-Grid 로 교체\n  (발신라우트 RouteList 패턴). ColDef<Endpoint>, 선택강조 rowClassRules+redrawRows,\n  행클릭=카드선택/더블클릭=상세, 액션 Dropdown. 하단 멤버/인증번호 그리드에\n  좌우 여백(px-4) 추가. 커스텀 정렬 상수 제거(AG-Grid 내장 대체).\n- RouteList: 하단 배정국선 그리드 래퍼에 px-5 좌우 여백(상단 액션바와 정렬).\n- DidRouteForm: 3단계 Steps 위저드 → EndpointForm 아코디언 패턴(FormSection\n  4섹션 기본정보/부가설정/라우팅/블록 + 진행바 + 요약패널 + 미입력배지 +\n  검증실패 자동펼침). 저장 payload·validation 규칙은 diff 로 미변경 확인.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"7bdf991b1d0e45f29224af777d3c8a34adc16881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/7bdf991b1d0e45f29224af777d3c8a34adc16881"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/448db2cf1376286aa0af410b6147254189961936","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/448db2cf1376286aa0af410b6147254189961936","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDQ0OGRiMmNmMTM3NjI4NmFhMGFmNDEwYjYxNDcyNTQxODk5NjE5MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423","sha":"212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423"}],"sha":"448db2cf1376286aa0af410b6147254189961936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/448db2cf1376286aa0af410b6147254189961936"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/41655775cf2550c1d43feddf6db4e47fe151fdad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:20:16Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:21:38Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"✨feat(host): TenantChip 전환 진행 표시 및 TanStack Query 계층 도입\n\n[구조]\n- useAuthQueries에 useSwitchTenant·useEnterOperator·useExitOperator\n  뮤테이션 훅 추가(MutationHookOptions 규약).\n- TenantChip의 authApi 직접 호출 제거, 훅 경유로 전환.\n- 3벌 중복이던 try/catch 에러 분기를 공통 handleAuthError로 통합.\n  UNAUTHENTICATED는 공통 처리, 액션별 코드 메시지는 맵으로 주입.\n\n[동작]\n- isPending 기반 진행 표시 추가: 칩 아이콘을 Loader2 스피너로 교체,\n  버튼 disabled + opacity·cursor-wait 적용.\n- 진행 중 재클릭 가드(isBusy)로 중복 요청 차단.\n- 성공·실패 흐름 의미는 기존과 동일(실패 시 로컬 상태 유지,\n  성공 시 스토어 미러 + 리로드).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CVH7z6itZY7i5tjq7u5RCg","tree":{"sha":"f5de5c9ac0c3fda4dff76c2f72201d0523077652","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/f5de5c9ac0c3fda4dff76c2f72201d0523077652"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/41655775cf2550c1d43feddf6db4e47fe151fdad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/41655775cf2550c1d43feddf6db4e47fe151fdad","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDQxNjU1Nzc1Y2YyNTUwYzFkNDNmZWRkZjZkYjRlNDdmZTE1MWZkYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/23c7db4b1309b0d067b3f6c434b5f96556a881d4","sha":"23c7db4b1309b0d067b3f6c434b5f96556a881d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/23c7db4b1309b0d067b3f6c434b5f96556a881d4"}],"sha":"41655775cf2550c1d43feddf6db4e47fe151fdad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/41655775cf2550c1d43feddf6db4e47fe151fdad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/23c7db4b1309b0d067b3f6c434b5f96556a881d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:14:42Z","email":"won5972@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"원선영"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:14:42Z","email":"won5972@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"원선영"},"message":"✨feat(ivr): 노드 선택 UI 통일 + 시나리오/미디어 관리 화면 개편\n\n[노드 선택 UI 통일]\n- IvrEndpointList/IvrDnGroupList/HaGroupList/ExtAdaptorList: 노드 탭바를\n  노드 선택 셀렉트박스로 전환(DnisList 패턴 통일)\n- ExtAdaptorList: 시스템 카드 슬라이더에 헤더 추가, 하단 어댑터/Watcher\n  2탭을 add-grid 표준(TabButton)으로 정비, 시스템 카드 스타일을\n  IvrMedia/IvrDnGroupList와 통일\n- IvrAinDnis: 테넌트 탭바 제거, 운영자모드에서만 ScopeSelect 노출\n  (hideAll — 백엔드가 tenantId 필수라 전체 조회 불가), 그리드 테넌트\n  컬럼도 운영자모드에서만 노출\n\n[IVR 미디어 관리 개편]\n- IvrMedia: 하단 Media Server/TTS/STT 3탭 구조 제거. TTS/STT Master는\n  시스템과 무관한 전역 마스터라 상단 버튼으로 분리해 TtsManageDrawer/\n  SttManageDrawer(신규) 안에서 조회·등록·수정·삭제하도록 개편\n- MediaServerPanel: 편집/삭제 버튼을 상세 카드에서 상단 헤더로 이동,\n  등록된 Media Server가 있을 때만 노출\n\n[시나리오 화면 디자인 개편]\n- SleeConfigList: 카테고리 목록 로드 시 첫 행 자동 선택 추가. 환경파일/\n  카테고리/속성 3분할 폭을 가변 비율로 조정, SectionHeader 공통 패턴\n  적용해 라벨·아이콘·폰트 크기 통일\n- ScenarioDeploySidebar: 배포 버전/적용 서버/대상 시스템 섹션에\n  SectionHeader 패턴 적용, 배포 실행 버튼을 Drawer footer로 이동\n- ScenarioVersionSheet: 시나리오 파일/문서 업로드를 드래그앤드롭 카드\n  (FileUploadField)로 교체, 파일 크기와 다운로드/제거 액션 표시","tree":{"sha":"1c940102315c82cc629026b184513efc75aaf53f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/1c940102315c82cc629026b184513efc75aaf53f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/23c7db4b1309b0d067b3f6c434b5f96556a881d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/23c7db4b1309b0d067b3f6c434b5f96556a881d4","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDIzYzdkYjRiMTMwOWIwZDA2N2IzZjZjNDM0YjVmOTY1NTZhODgxZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423","sha":"212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423"}],"sha":"23c7db4b1309b0d067b3f6c434b5f96556a881d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/23c7db4b1309b0d067b3f6c434b5f96556a881d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:31:28Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:32:58Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix: 그리드 컬럼 헤더 드래그 시 컬럼 사라지는 동작 차단\n\n[증상]\n컬럼 헤더를 그리드 바깥 영역으로 끌어 놓으면 해당 컬럼이 그대로 숨겨짐.\nAG-Grid 기본 동작(suppressDragLeaveHidesColumns 기본값 false)이나,\n사용자가 순서를 바꾸려다 실수로 컬럼을 유실하는 사례 발생.\n\n[조치]\n공통 훅 useAggridOptions 의 gridOptions 에 suppressDragLeaveHidesColumns\n활성. 전 앱 그리드에 일괄 적용됨.\n컬럼 이동·재정렬은 기존대로 허용되며, 드래그 이탈 시 원위치 복귀만 달라짐.","tree":{"sha":"2f9fc4d116bf52c38a5232b1fea46e29eb9c351e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/2f9fc4d116bf52c38a5232b1fea46e29eb9c351e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDIxMmFiMTc0OTJlNzIyZWFlMzBiNmQ3MmM4ZTNmNDcxMTE0NTU0MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/12850973a9200a2a760428b51696066e14b31206","sha":"12850973a9200a2a760428b51696066e14b31206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/12850973a9200a2a760428b51696066e14b31206"}],"sha":"212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/212ab17492e722eae30b6d72c8e3f47111455423"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/12850973a9200a2a760428b51696066e14b31206/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:54:45Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:54:45Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"✨feat(host): 운영자 모드 enter/exit 를 서버 API + reload 로 전환\n\n운영자 모드(operatorMode)를 브라우저 sessionStorage 토글에서 서버 권위(토큰\n클레임)로 승격하는 작업의 FE 절반. 새 탭에서 풀리던 문제와 감사 부재 해소.\nactAsTenantId(대행 대상)는 이번 범위 아님 — 계속 FE 헤더로 보낸다.\n\n- authApi 에 enterOperator/exitOperator (POST /api/auth/operator/enter, exit).\n  switchTenant 규약 모방.\n- TenantChip 의 enter/exit 를 순수 로컬 토글에서 서버 API 호출 + 성공 후\n  window.location.reload() 로 전환. 실패 시 로컬 상태 유지 + toast.\n  exit 는 withOperatorTabCleanup 순서 보존 위해 sync 콜백 안에서 promise discard.\n- useOperatorScopeStore 에 setOperatorMode 액션 추가(서버 미러). 기존 인터페이스\n  40개 소비처 불변.\n- SharedInfoProvider 가 /me 응답의 operatorMode 로 setOperatorMode 호출 → 새 탭·\n  reload 후 서버 상태 동기화.\n- apiClient 에서 X-View-All-Tenants 자동 주입 제거(view-all 은 서버가 토큰\n  operatorMode 로 판정). X-Act-As-Tenant 및 actAsTenantFromBody 승격은 유지.\n- auth types UserInfoResponse 에 operatorMode 추가.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"4f67cba2ab725d325a35d67d2a530f18573fcdb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/4f67cba2ab725d325a35d67d2a530f18573fcdb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/12850973a9200a2a760428b51696066e14b31206","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/12850973a9200a2a760428b51696066e14b31206","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDEyODUwOTczYTkyMDBhMmE3NjA0MjhiNTE2OTYwNjZlMTRiMzEyMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/f89765a9c85465f4986b7f0d7450887d5939037a","sha":"f89765a9c85465f4986b7f0d7450887d5939037a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/f89765a9c85465f4986b7f0d7450887d5939037a"}],"sha":"12850973a9200a2a760428b51696066e14b31206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/12850973a9200a2a760428b51696066e14b31206"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/f89765a9c85465f4986b7f0d7450887d5939037a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:34:38Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:35:59Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"💄design: ag-Grid 테마 적용\n\n[조치 1] useAggridOptions themeQuartz 파라미터 재매핑\n- 셀: 본문 12px, 회색 계열 글자색, 좌우 여백 12px 고정\n- 행: 높이 38px, 구분선은 옅은 회색 1px, hover 는 아주 옅은 회색\n- 선택행: 브랜드 남색 5퍼센트 틴트\n- 헤더: 옅은 회색 배경, 12px semibold, 하단 경계선만 유지\n- 세로 구분선 전면 제거 — 일반 컬럼(columnBorder)과 좌측 고정 컬럼\n  (pinnedColumnBorder) 양쪽. 체크박스·행번호 컬럼은 pinned 라 전자만으로는\n  선이 남았음\n- 바깥 테두리(wrapperBorder) 제거\n- 행번호 컬럼 기본 노출 해제(rowNumbers false). 필요 화면에서 개별 override\n\n[조치 2] tokens.css 에 상태바 좌우 여백 override 추가\n- ag-Grid 상태바 기본 좌우 padding 은 grid-size 곱하기 4 = spacing 6 기준 24px\n- 본문 셀 여백(12px)보다 넓어 페이지 버튼이 안쪽으로 밀려 보임\n- 좌우 padding 전용 테마 파라미터가 없어 공용 CSS 로 12px 지정\n\n[영향]\n공통 훅·공용 CSS 라 host 경유 전 remote 와 insight·campaign standalone 에 적용.\n기존 대비 본문 13px에서 12px, 행 높이 고정.","tree":{"sha":"30372b943184000462255dbc35d8450d50c9fdf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/30372b943184000462255dbc35d8450d50c9fdf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/f89765a9c85465f4986b7f0d7450887d5939037a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/f89765a9c85465f4986b7f0d7450887d5939037a","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGY4OTc2NWE5Yzg1NDY1ZjQ5ODZiN2YwZDc0NTA4ODdkNTkzOTAzN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/17a4facd4f09650a9e1bbf6272bca620eec12b33","sha":"17a4facd4f09650a9e1bbf6272bca620eec12b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/17a4facd4f09650a9e1bbf6272bca620eec12b33"}],"sha":"f89765a9c85465f4986b7f0d7450887d5939037a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/f89765a9c85465f4986b7f0d7450887d5939037a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/7280cf156470098092aff005e044c33f6e0b700e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:21:35Z","email":"bt1@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"bridgetec"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:21:35Z","email":"bt1@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"bridgetec"},"message":"Merge branch 