hojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/11917146985748789cf8ad04d5d6d7d7d79783db","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDExOTE3MTQ2OTg1NzQ4Nzg5Y2Y4YWQwNGQ1ZDZkN2Q3ZDc5NzgzZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8","sha":"d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8"}],"sha":"11917146985748789cf8ad04d5d6d7d7d79783db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/11917146985748789cf8ad04d5d6d7d7d79783db"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/f81c5945c8d11348041fb1c4e550f17ed847d88a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:47:24Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:48:55Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix: 토스트 접힘 카드 남은 시간 링이 이전 알림 타이머를 이어가는 문제 수정\n\n[증상]\n토스트를 연속 발행하면 새 알림 카드의 남은 시간 링이 처음부터 감기지 않고\n최초 카드의 진행 상태를 그대로 이어감. 링이 이미 소진된 상태로 표시되기도 함.\n자동 닫힘 시각 자체는 항목별로 정상.\n\n[원인]\nToastProvider 접힘(활성 1장) 분기의 ToastCard에 key 미지정. 활성 항목이\n바뀌어도 React가 동일 인스턴스를 재사용해 마운트 1회성 elapsedAtMountRef가\n갱신되지 않고, circle의 animation 선언값도 동일해 CSS 애니메이션이\n재시작되지 않음.\n\n[조치]\n접힘 분기 ToastCard에 key={active.id} 부여. 항목 교체 시 리마운트되어\n각 항목의 remaining 기준으로 링이 재계산됨. 위아래 넘김 시 중간 마운트\n보정 로직도 의도대로 동작. 펼침 목록은 기존에 key 지정돼 있어 변경 없음.","tree":{"sha":"4d6b9c34d038d5ee027096ceddd7296406dfe4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/4d6b9c34d038d5ee027096ceddd7296406dfe4aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/f81c5945c8d11348041fb1c4e550f17ed847d88a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/f81c5945c8d11348041fb1c4e550f17ed847d88a","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGY4MWM1OTQ1YzhkMTEzNDgwNDFmYjFjNGU1NTBmMTdlZDg0N2Q4OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8","sha":"d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8"}],"sha":"f81c5945c8d11348041fb1c4e550f17ed847d88a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/f81c5945c8d11348041fb1c4e550f17ed847d88a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:43:45Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:43:45Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"Merge branch ''master'' of http://100.100.103.5/BT-ADMIN/BT-ADMIN-FE","tree":{"sha":"5523d6af212acfff81a6e97d2c283ff3b8f1f892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/5523d6af212acfff81a6e97d2c283ff3b8f1f892"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGQ1NDMxM2YyMDI5NmUwMWVlNDk2ZGExOGRmNDRiYzllMWM1OGZhZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/715d8a9367f92b9d167b62d9cb595fa4ebed1d47","sha":"715d8a9367f92b9d167b62d9cb595fa4ebed1d47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/715d8a9367f92b9d167b62d9cb595fa4ebed1d47"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/58c1ee8c0e96afefae6d634c4c013ff0e0add32c","sha":"58c1ee8c0e96afefae6d634c4c013ff0e0add32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/58c1ee8c0e96afefae6d634c4c013ff0e0add32c"}],"sha":"d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/d54313f20296e01ee496da18df44bc9e1c58fae8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/715d8a9367f92b9d167b62d9cb595fa4ebed1d47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:42:35Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:42:35Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"🐛fix(ipron): 운영자 전체모드에서 TENANT_OWNED 등록 403 수정\n\n운영자 \"전체(view-all)\" 모드에서 등록 폼의 테넌트 필드로 로그인 테넌트가\n아닌 B 를 골라 저장하면, TENANT_OWNED 엔티티(내선·COS·프로파일 등)가 403 을\n냈다. view-all 이면 apiClient 가 X-View-All-Tenants 만 보내고 X-Act-As-Tenant 를\n안 보내 백엔드 active 가 로그인 테넌트로 폴백 → TenantGuard 가 폼 tenantId(B)와\n불일치로 거부. 폼 payload tenantId 와 요청 스코프 헤더가 분리된 게 원인.\n\napiClient ApiRequestConfig 에 actAsTenantFromBody 플래그 추가. create mutation 이\n지정하면 view-all 에서도 body top-level tenantId 를 X-Act-As-Tenant 로 승격\n(\"폼에서 고른 테넌트 = 그 요청의 작업 대상\"). BFF 가 isSystemAdmin 재검증 후\n수용하므로 안전. TRANSPORT 무관, 조회 스코프도 불변.\n\n배선한 create api 7종: dn/adn/cos/accessProfile/devfuncProfile/callScreen/dnProfile.\nupdate·delete·batch·노드스코프(dod/did)·하위리소스는 미대상(근거는 문서 참조).\n\nadd-form 스킬에 \"멀티테넌트 등록 폼\" 절 추가 — 이후 화면이 이 규칙을 따르게.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"8495a401c37876bf317ac24b9d5412dc0c9563e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/8495a401c37876bf317ac24b9d5412dc0c9563e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/715d8a9367f92b9d167b62d9cb595fa4ebed1d47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/715d8a9367f92b9d167b62d9cb595fa4ebed1d47","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDcxNWQ4YTkzNjdmOTJiOWQxNjdiNjJkOWNiNTk1ZmE0ZWJlZDFkNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/1f58ec54d6035e8152d8e2e4cc21fa5ffd0d5851","sha":"1f58ec54d6035e8152d8e2e4cc21fa5ffd0d5851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/1f58ec54d6035e8152d8e2e4cc21fa5ffd0d5851"}],"sha":"715d8a9367f92b9d167b62d9cb595fa4ebed1d47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/715d8a9367f92b9d167b62d9cb595fa4ebed1d47"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/58c1ee8c0e96afefae6d634c4c013ff0e0add32c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:26:58Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:26:58Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix: host 수정 시 insight·campaign 재빌드되는 교차 HMR 제거\n\n[증상]\napps/host 하위 파일 저장 시 insight·campaign dev 서버가 함께 재빌드·HMR 발생.\n\n[원인]\nTailwind v4 global.css의 광역 @source 스캔(apps·libs 전체)이 PostCSS 빌드\n의존성으로 등록되어 rspack watcher가 apps 전체를 감시. global.css를 import하던\ninsight(styles.css)·campaign(StandaloneApp)이 이 감시를 통째로 상속.\n\n[조치]\n- 토큰·shadcn base·공용 컴포넌트 층을 tokens.css로 분리. global.css는 tailwind\n  진입 + 광역 @source만 남김(host preEntry 전용).\n- insight·campaign은 tokens.css + 자체 @source(자기 src·libs)로 Tailwind 단위 구성.\n- campaign standalone 전용 CSS 신설, StandaloneApp의 global.css import 대체.\n\n[검증]\n- host CSS 산출물 SHA256 변경 전후 동일 — 전 remote 유틸리티 대리 생성 회귀 없음.\n- insight·campaign 유틸리티 실사용 손실 0건(사라진 셀렉터는 전부 타 앱 전용).\n- dev 서버 실측: host 저장 시 insight·campaign CPU 델타 0초, libs 저장 시 각각\n  2.58초·1.81초 반응 — 교차 의존만 제거되고 공유 의존은 유지.\n- CSS 산출물 insight 277KB→169KB, campaign 267KB→110KB 축소.","tree":{"sha":"f57f481197a595f702c857f19085ad337830e778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/f57f481197a595f702c857f19085ad337830e778"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/58c1ee8c0e96afefae6d634c4c013ff0e0add32c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/58c1ee8c0e96afefae6d634c4c013ff0e0add32c","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDU4YzFlZThjMGU5NmFmZWZhZTZkNjM0YzRjMDEzZmYwZTBhZGQzMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/495bebe9a055d0f16a05d9a6eee6fb8fd4f3f74c","sha":"495bebe9a055d0f16a05d9a6eee6fb8fd4f3f74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/495bebe9a055d0f16a05d9a6eee6fb8fd4f3f74c"}],"sha":"58c1ee8c0e96afefae6d634c4c013ff0e0add32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/58c1ee8c0e96afefae6d634c4c013ff0e0add32c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/495bebe9a055d0f16a05d9a6eee6fb8fd4f3f74c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:26:15Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:26:15Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"🐛fix(host): antd App cssVar 경고 해소 — component={false} 제거\n\n[증상]\n콘솔에 \"[antd: App] When using cssVar, ensure component is assigned a\nvalid React component string.\" 경고 발생.\n\n[원인]\nantd v6는 cssVar 모드 기본 활성 — App 컴포넌트가 CSS 변수 스코프\n클래스를 자기 래퍼 DOM 노드에 붙여 전파하는데, Layout의\ncomponent={false}가 래퍼 노드 생성을 막아 붙일 노드가 없음.\n\n[조치]\ncomponent={false} → className=\"contents\"로 교체. 래퍼 div를 유지해\ncssVar 스코프 클래스가 붙을 노드를 제공하되 display:contents로\n레이아웃 박스를 제거해 h-screen 체인 유지.\n\n[검증]\n- host 타입검사(tsc --noEmit) 통과.\n- 브라우저 확인: 로그인 → Layout 마운트 시 경고 미발생, 헤더·탭\n  스트립·메뉴 패널·페이지 본문 렌더 정상, 콘솔 error·warn 0건.","tree":{"sha":"1e17d4d4f20ad6ff58fa853a86d403df8e02092d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/1e17d4d4f20ad6ff58fa853a86d403df8e02092d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/495bebe9a055d0f16a05d9a6eee6fb8fd4f3f74c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/495bebe9a055d0f16a05d9a6eee6fb8fd4f3f74c","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDQ5NWJlYmU5YTA1NWQwZjE2YTA1ZDlhNmVlZTZmYjhmZDRmM2Y3NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/6b461f6354ba1ec743560bdbca5dbff54c9a097b","sha":"6b461f6354ba1ec743560bdbca5dbff54c9a097b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/6b461f6354ba1ec743560bdbca5dbff54c9a097b"}],"sha":"495bebe9a055d0f16a05d9a6eee6fb8fd4f3f74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/495bebe9a055d0f16a05d9a6eee6fb8fd4f3f74c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/6b461f6354ba1ec743560bdbca5dbff54c9a097b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:17:31Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:18:12Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"✨feat(host): 로그인 성공 시 열린 탭 목록·히스토리 장부 초기화\n\n[배경]\n- 탭 스토어(useOpenTabsStore)는 sessionStorage persist라 로그아웃·세션\n  만료 후에도 잔존. 같은 브라우저 탭에서 다른 사용자가 로그인하면 이전\n  사용자의 탭 목록을 그대로 승계하는 문제.\n- 로그아웃 경로가 다수(버튼·WS 강제 로그아웃·401·가드 리다이렉트)라\n  각 경로 처리 대신 진입점인 로그인 성공 시점에 무조건 초기화하는 방식\n  채택.\n\n[조치]\n- Login.tsx: 로그인 성공 onSuccess에서 탭 스토어 reset() +\n  clearTabHistoryKeyLedger() 호출 후 메인 이동.\n- useTabSync.ts: 히스토리 칸→탭 장부(tab-history-key-ledger) 삭제 헬퍼\n  clearTabHistoryKeyLedger 추가. reset으로 탭 id가 1부터 재발급되므로\n  옛 장부 잔존 시 오매핑 위험 → 세트로 삭제.\n- 장부 sessionStorage catch 3곳(load·save·clear)에 Log.warn 추가 —\n  무음 삼킴 제거.\n\n[검증]\n- host 타입검사(tsc --noEmit) 통과.\n- /login은 Layout 밖 라우트라 keep-alive 캐시는 로그인 화면에서 트리째\n  언마운트 소멸 → 탭 id 재발급과 캐시 충돌 없음 확인.","tree":{"sha":"c56ba18362fb40c446eb594bbd477f1987dd816d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/c56ba18362fb40c446eb594bbd477f1987dd816d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/c