os/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/4db08171249e83c221006fc9f8f790834a260a7a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/8abc5e1725f7de7affe66bf1c31b2afb074a165e","sha":"8abc5e1725f7de7affe66bf1c31b2afb074a165e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/8abc5e1725f7de7affe66bf1c31b2afb074a165e"}],"sha":"1f58ec54d6035e8152d8e2e4cc21fa5ffd0d5851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/1f58ec54d6035e8152d8e2e4cc21fa5ffd0d5851"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/4db08171249e83c221006fc9f8f790834a260a7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:02:14Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:02:14Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"💄design(ipron): 발신라우트 카드/리스트(AG-Grid) 토글 + 등록폼 아코디언 개편\n\nRouteList — 카드/리스트 뷰 토글 추가(useViewMode(''ipron-route'')).\n리스트형은 AG-Grid(useAggridOptions + ColDef<Route>): 라우트명·노드·분배방식·\nANI유형·ANI번호·배정국선·상태·액션 컬럼. 상태 배지는 add-grid 표준\n(shadcn Badge + Record 색상맵). getRouteStatusInfo 가 정상 시 null 이라\n그리드에선 ''정상''(emerald) 명시. 선택 행 강조는 rowClassRules + redrawRows.\n기존 카드 슬라이더/노드 필터/검색/배정국선 그리드/RoutePointDialog 유지.\n\nRouteForm — 2단계 위저드 제거, 국선 폼과 동일한 커스텀 아코디언(FormSection)\n4섹션(기본정보/발신번호 설정/호 처리·우회/업무시간) + 진행바 + 요약 패널 +\n미입력 배지 + 검증 실패 시 섹션 자동 펼침. 저장 payload·검증 규칙은\ndiff 로 미변경 확인. Col span 차등(숫자4·스위치4·짧은셀렉트5·일반6·긴텍스트8).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"de0fbfb7ac5cc745b12e077a8bf975eea9c96af1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/de0fbfb7ac5cc745b12e077a8bf975eea9c96af1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/4db08171249e83c221006fc9f8f790834a260a7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/4db08171249e83c221006fc9f8f790834a260a7a","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDRkYjA4MTcxMjQ5ZTgzYzIyMTAwNmZjOWY4Zjc5MDgzNGEyNjBhN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/b63ea8a56ddd1e51dafdc50150d8546b6f92b938","sha":"b63ea8a56ddd1e51dafdc50150d8546b6f92b938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/b63ea8a56ddd1e51dafdc50150d8546b6f92b938"}],"sha":"4db08171249e83c221006fc9f8f790834a260a7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/4db08171249e83c221006fc9f8f790834a260a7a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/b63ea8a56ddd1e51dafdc50150d8546b6f92b938/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:01:22Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:01:22Z","email":"jyb@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"백재열"},"message":"🐛fix(ipron): 국선 전송유형 3개로 축소 + SIP 프로파일 2행 앞으로\n\n전송유형(TRANSPORT_OPTIONS)에서 WS·DTLS(8) / WSS·DTLS(16) 제거.\nAS-IS IPR20S1010.jsp:474-477 이 공통코드를 splice(0,3) 으로 잘라 UDP/TCP/TLS\n3개만 콤보에 넣는다. 8/16 은 WebRTC 전송 방식이라 국선 대상이 아니며\nTB_IE_ENDPOINT 에 8/16 을 쓰는 행이 0건임을 DB 로 확인. TRANSPORT_LABELS 는\n과거 데이터 표시를 위해 5개 유지.\n\nSIP 프로파일 필드를 기본정보 2행 맨 앞으로 이동(사용자 요청).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBBgfZkyqent35dmn6zHbk","tree":{"sha":"304810cfd306dde4887842b61fb55c3a40cbbedd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/304810cfd306dde4887842b61fb55c3a40cbbedd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/b63ea8a56ddd1e51dafdc50150d8546b6f92b938","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/b63ea8a56ddd1e51dafdc50150d8546b6f92b938","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGI2M2VhOGE1NmRkZDFlNTFkYWZkYzUwMTUwZDg1NDZiNmY5MmI5Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/3a3a45465a36696ddc7ef695a905945507471e5b","sha":"3a3a45465a36696ddc7ef695a905945507471e5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/3a3a45465a36696ddc7ef695a905945507471e5b"}],"sha":"b63ea8a56ddd1e51dafdc50150d8546b6f92b938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/b63ea8a56ddd1e51dafdc50150d8546b6f92b938"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/8abc5e1725f7de7affe66bf1c31b2afb074a165e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T03:51:51Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T03:54:00Z","email":"hojaee@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"이호재"},"message":"✨feat: react-toastify 제거, 자체 토스트 스택 구현으로 대체\n\n[구현]\n- shared-util에 toastStore(zustand) 신설, toast API를 자체 구현으로 재작성.\n  기존 호출부 시그니처(success/error/info/warning/warn, autoClose·toastId) 유지로\n  전 앱 호출부 무수정 전환.\n- toastId 중복 방지(같은 id 활성 중 재발행 무시), autoClose: false 수동 닫기 지원.\n- shared-ui에 ToastProvider 신설 — 좌하단 스택 UI. 접힘(최신 1장 + 위아래 넘김 +\n  카운터)·펼치기(전체 세로 목록 + 스크롤) 2모드, 모두 지우기 제공.\n- hover 시 전체 타이머 일시정지, 펼침 목록은 최신 도착 시 하단 근처에서만 자동 스크롤.\n- 펼침 최대높이는 헤더 높이·chromeCollapsed·chromeless 인식해 화면에 맞춤\n  (headerHeight prop).\n- 남은 시간 진행 링은 SVG stroke-dashoffset CSS 애니메이션 — JS tick 없이 60fps,\n  일시정지·재개는 animation-play-state로 처리.\n\n[적용]\n- host app.tsx·campaign StandaloneApp에 ToastProvider 마운트, ToastContainer 제거.\n- react-toastify 의존성 제거(pnpm remove, ag-grid 패치 보존 확인),\n  toastify.scss 삭제.\n\n[문서]\n- AGENTS.md·DEVELOPER_GUIDE 토스트 절에 자체 구현·옵션·standalone 셸 마운트 규칙 반영.\n- chromeless 절의 toast 동작 근거를 자체 구현 기준으로 정정(AGENTS.md·스킬).","tree":{"sha":"a864c648c620ae103e367d2ed9618da98e0f6c80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/a864c648c620ae103e367d2ed9618da98e0f6c80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/8abc5e1725f7de7affe66bf1c31b2afb074a165e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/8abc5e1725f7de7affe66bf1c31b2afb074a165e","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKDhhYmM1ZTE3MjVmN2RlN2FmZmU2NmJmMWMzMWIyYWZiMDc0YTE2NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/55cd79784e9195a77d72b26745148447e604831f","sha":"55cd79784e9195a77d72b26745148447e604831f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/55cd79784e9195a77d72b26745148447e604831f"}],"sha":"8abc5e1725f7de7affe66bf1c31b2afb074a165e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/8abc5e1725f7de7affe66bf1c31b2afb074a165e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177302158?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kimtaekeum","id":177302158,"login":"kimtaekeum","node_id":"U_kgDOCpFqjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/55cd79784e9195a77d72b26745148447e604831f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T02:41:36Z","email":"verd2000@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"김태금"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T02:41:36Z","email":"verd2000@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"김태금"},"message":"🐛fix(taskboard): 구역 미배정 위젯이 기본그룹 선택값을 못 받는 문제 수정\n\n[증상]\n전광판 실행 시 구역(섹션)을 지정한 위젯은 정상 동작하나, 구역 미배정\n위젯에 기본그룹을 배정하면 WS 요청·수신 데이터는 정상인데 화면에 값이\n표시되지 않음.\n\n[원인]\nrenderWidget의 effectiveSelection 삼항 조건이 `widget.sectionKey &&`로\n시작해, sectionKey가 없는 위젯은 `__etc`(기본그룹) 폴백을 타지 못하고\nselection(= URL s 파라미터의 첫 번째 구역 뷰그룹)을 사용.\nWS 구독은 전 섹션 union(mergedDbQuerySelections)이라 데이터는 내려오지만,\n표시값 계산용 selectionIdsByHashKey에는 기본그룹 id가 없어 0 처리됨.\n\n[조치]\nsectionSelections 존재 여부를 바깥 조건으로 옮기고, sectionKey가 없으면\n`__etc` → selection 순으로 폴백하도록 변경.\n동일 로직을 쓰던 RollingDisplay(롤링 재생)에도 같은 규칙 적용.","tree":{"sha":"7d76c52018a679a70262863b8baddd9c30690412","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/7d76c52018a679a70262863b8baddd9c30690412"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/55cd79784e9195a77d72b26745148447e604831f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177302158?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kimtaekeum","id":177302158,"login":"kimtaekeum","node_id":"U_kgDOCpFqjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum","user_view_t