387d","sha":"3ae6457ea2078b1a0ea68d9f6f8a70021f82387d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/3ae6457ea2078b1a0ea68d9f6f8a70021f82387d"}],"sha":"345e7aec70e7b9a30d129f2b4d6755cb1c07b98c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/345e7aec70e7b9a30d129f2b4d6755cb1c07b98c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177302158?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kimtaekeum","id":177302158,"login":"kimtaekeum","node_id":"U_kgDOCpFqjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commits/b7b835eee91aa77abbbebb7df7ea40db7fc82095/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T11:40:23Z","email":"verd2000@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"김태금"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T11:40:23Z","email":"verd2000@bridgetec.co.kr","name":"김태금"},"message":"🐛fix(taskboard): 계산식 변수 추가 무반응·배경 목록 미갱신 수정 + 시계 AM/PM 지원\n\n[계산식 변수 무반응]\n- 증상: 계산식 위젯 변수 추가 버튼 간헐 무반응, 좌측 Redis 드래그 바인딩\n  실패(서버 환경에서 더 잦음).\n- 원인: 위젯 id를 widget-{Date.now()}(밀리초)로 생성 — 빠른 연속 추가 시\n  같은 ms로 id 충돌. selectedWidgetIds가 calc 없는 다른 위젯을 가리켜\n  addCalcOperand가 조용히 무시됨.\n- 조치: 위젯 id 생성 3곳(드롭·복사·다중복제)을 createUUID로 교체해 고유\n  보장(비 secure context에서도 동작). addCalcOperand도 calc 누락 시\n  초기화 후 추가하도록 방어.\n\n[배경 목록 미갱신]\n- 증상: task-bg 배경 추가/삭제 후 새로고침해야 리스트 반영.\n- 원인: 목록 쿼리키는 getBgList({tenantIds})인데 invalidate 대상은\n  getBgList()(끝이 undefined)라 prefix 불일치로 무효화 실패.\n- 조치: params 무관 base 키 getBgList._def로 무효화(추가·삭제·자동생성 3곳).\n\n[시계 AM/PM]\n- 커스텀 시계 토큰 hh12·ampm(AM/PM)·apk(오전/오후) 추가, AMPM 프리셋 상수.\n- TaskCreate 시계 포맷 UI에 24시간/오전·오후 프리셋 버튼 + 토큰 안내 확장.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfc0c2717fcded20006b9528a3ef6b418467df64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/trees/dfc0c2717fcded20006b9528a3ef6b418467df64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/git/commits/b7b835eee91aa77abbbebb7df7ea40db7fc82095","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177302158?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kimtaekeum","id":177302158,"login":"kimtaekeum","node_id":"U_kgDOCpFqjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimtaekeum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leehojae91/BT-ADMIN-FE/commit/b7b835eee91aa77abbbebb7df7ea40db7fc82095","node_id":"C_kwDOTe8YbdoAKGI3YjgzNWVlZTkxYWE3N2FiYmJlYmI3ZGY3ZWE0MGRiN2ZjODIwOTU","parents":[{"