ithub.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/commits/40b4cda9dbe59f87525021ed963bf1afe8f2a258/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T11:13:41Z","email":"nancyalex151225@gmail.com","name":"Nancy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T11:13:41Z","email":"nancyalex151225@gmail.com","name":"Nancy"},"message":"﻿Add Express backend and migrate off Netlify functions\n\nIntroduce a standalone `server/` npm package (Express app with routes for\ngenerate/image/health, OpenAI client, validation, logging, security headers,\nrate limiting) plus a Dockerfile and .dockerignore for deployment.\n\nThe Netlify functions this replaces (netlify/functions/generate.js,\nnetlify/functions/image.js) and netlify.toml are removed; the Vite dev server\nnow proxies to the backend instead. Frontend is updated to match, including a\nnew ImageViewer page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4aaeff07bdcb27ebb5d451e98cde60e73593928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/git/trees/e4aaeff07bdcb27ebb5d451e98cde60e73593928"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/git/commits/40b4cda9dbe59f87525021ed963bf1afe8f2a258","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142387076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nancy1277/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nancy1277/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nancy1277/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nancy1277/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nancy1277","id":142387076,"login":"nancy1277","node_id":"U_kgDOCHynhA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nancy1277/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nancy1277/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nancy1