tps://api.github.com/users/trueinf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/trueinf","id":144107929,"login":"trueinf","node_id":"U_kgDOCJbpmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/commits/396f91832e8490772eae919fa8dbdcf50f847b82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:46:35Z","email":"trueinfolabs@gmail.com","name":"trueinf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:46:35Z","email":"trueinfolabs@gmail.com","name":"trueinf"},"message":"Add Netlify functions so content/image generation works in production\n\nThe OpenAI proxy was a Vite dev-server middleware (dev only). Add Netlify\nserverless functions mapped to the same paths the app already calls:\n- netlify/functions/generate.js  -> /api/generate (chat completions)\n- netlify/functions/image.js     -> /api/image    (gpt-image-1)\n- netlify.toml: build (dist), /api/* redirects to functions, SPA fallback\n\nBoth read OPENAI_API_KEY from the Netlify environment; the key is never sent to\nthe client. No app code changes needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32e19ae3aadb2bf64d71dfda3e67831740de5ad8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/git/trees/32e19ae3aadb2bf64d71dfda3e67831740de5ad8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/git/commits/396f91832e8490772eae919fa8dbdcf50f847b82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144107929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/trueinf","id":144107929,"login":"trueinf","node_id":"U_kgDOCJbpmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/trueinf/levisthereadline/commit/396f91832e8490772eae919fa8dbdcf50f847b82","node_id":"C_kwDOTe9IHtoAKDM5NmY5MTgzMmU4NDkwNzcyZWFlOTE5ZmE4ZGJkY2Y1MGY4NDdiODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/trueinf/levisthereadline/commit/6e739dc6e411fd969650c2fc34f64ed225e1bee4","sha":"6e739dc6e411fd969650c2fc34f64ed225e1bee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/commits/6e739dc6e411fd969650c2fc34f64ed225e1bee4"}],"sha":"396f91832e8490772eae919fa8dbdcf50f847b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/commits/396f91832e8490772eae919fa8dbdcf50f847b82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144107929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/trueinf","id":144107929,"login":"trueinf","node_id":"U_kgDOCJbpmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/commits/6e739dc6e411fd969650c2fc34f64ed225e1bee4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:35:54Z","email":"trueinfolabs@gmail.com","name":"trueinf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:35:54Z","email":"trueinfolabs@gmail.com","name":"trueinf"},"message":"Add OpenAI content + image generation, campaign builder, and workspace polish\n\nTurn the prototype into a working content studio while keeping the existing\nThreadline demo intact.\n\nGeneration (OpenAI, key stays server-side)\n- Dev-server proxy in vite.config.ts forwards /api/generate (chat) and\n  /api/image (gpt-image-1) using OPENAI_API_KEY from a git-ignored .env.\n- src/api.ts client + src/generation.ts prompt builders (grounded, translate).\n\nCampaign builder\n- \"Create campaign\" is a stepped wizard (Details -> Channels -> Review) with\n  real marketing channels (Instagram, Facebook, SEO, Email, TikTok, Google Ads,\n  X, YouTube), audience + tone.\n- Per-campaign workspace generates on-brand copy per channel/slot (generate all,\n  per-channel, per-slot regenerate, copy), persisted on the campaign.\n\nContent package flow (Create tab)\n- Two-step flow: editable Configure (campaign/market/product/locale/channels/\n  objective) -> Generate -> Review & publish, with image-left / content-right\n  output layout and a Publish confirmation modal.\n\nImages\n- ImageStudio generates on-brand visuals; each opens full-page in ImageViewer\n  with download; thumbnails reopen.\n\nTranslate\n- \"Translate to English\" toggle on both create flows (cached, EN pills).\n\nPortfolio\n- All four portfolio campaigns open the full 11-tab workspace; header + Overview\n  snapshot/metrics are driven per campaign (workspaceCampaigns).\n\nPolish\n- Responsive page width, stepper/form styling, icon set, publish/success modal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87cbf260152a8413f162809ea70fa12884f5e9cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/git/trees/87cbf260152a8413f162809ea70fa12884f5e9cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trueinf/levisthereadline/git/commits/6e739dc6e411fd969650c2fc34f64ed225e1bee4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144107929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/trueinf","id":144107929,"login":"trueinf","node_id":"U_kgDOCJbpmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trueinf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/trueinf/levisthereadline/commit/6e739dc6e411fd969650c2fc34f64ed225e1bee4","node_id":"C_kwDOTe9IHtoAKDZlNzM5ZGM2ZTQxMWZkOTY5NjUwYzJmYzM0ZjY0ZWQyMjVlMWJlZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/trueinf/levisthereadline/commit/5c75ca27ec090e7