users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filipohano/studentapp/commits/38813a1cd55408fe739b374d9e76cf3420de049e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:24:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:24:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Gjør startsaldo obligatorisk ved første innlogging\n\nNye brukere må nå svare på \"Hvor mye har du på konto nå?\" på en egen\nskjerm før resten av appen åpner seg, i stedet for at startsaldo bare\nvar en valgfri innstilling under Profil. Lagres fortsatt i Supabase\nAuth sin user_metadata (ingen ny tabell/migrasjon nødvendig).","tree":{"sha":"7058c21a6530801ed0844c2b2942a2e1e35d35db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filipohano/studentapp/git/trees/7058c21a6530801ed0844c2b2942a2e1e35d35db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filipohano/studentapp/git/commits/38813a1cd55408fe739b374d9e76cf3420de049e","verification":{"payload":"tree 7058c21a6530801ed0844c2b2942a2e1e35d35db\nparent 214985de849bc4e9378250e7d607f74753000a06\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784805890 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784805890 +0000\n\nGjør startsaldo obligatorisk ved første innlogging\n\nNye brukere må nå svare på \"Hvor mye har du på konto nå?\" på en egen\nskjerm før resten av appen åpner seg, i stedet for at startsaldo bare\nvar en valgfri innstilling under Profil. Lagres fortsatt i Supabase\nAuth sin user_metadata (ingen ny tabell/migrasjon nødvendig).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGD6PkXR\nbTJo8TTx96hGDxk/zf/Q42mgYgYn/KvVt0LM+GkEMGy89Sgc1Rt49/LSFN5F0mddZox428x0Gg7E\nPg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-23T11:24:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/filipohano/studentapp/commit/38813a1cd55408fe739b374d9e76cf3420de049e","node_id":"C_kwDOTfF6g9oAKDM4ODEzYTFjZDU1NDA4ZmU3MzliMzc0ZDllNzZjZjM0MjBkZTA0OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/filipohano/studentapp/commit/214985de849bc4e9378250e7d607f74753000a06","sha":"214985de849bc4e9378250e7d607f74753000a06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filipohano/studentapp/commits/214985de849bc4e9378250e7d607f74753000a06"}],"sha":"38813a1cd55408fe739b374d9e76cf3420de049e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filipohano/studentapp/commits/38813a1cd55408fe739b374d9e76cf3420de049e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filipohano/studentapp/commits/214985de849bc4e9378250e7d607f74753000a06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:57:15Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:57:15Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Riktig løpende saldo, Sparing-kategori, fiks stale data på faner\n\n- \"Saldo\" var bare denne månedens inntekt minus utgift og ga et\n  misvisende tall. Regner nå en faktisk løpende saldo: valgfri\n  startsaldo (settes under Profil) + nettosum av ALLE registrerte\n  transaksjoner, ikke bare denne måneden.\n- Ny delt \"Sparing\"-kategori (gjenbruker eksisterende budsjett-\n  system - ingen ny skjerm trengs, sett bare et sparemål som budsjett)\n- Fikset at Oversikt- og Transaksjoner-fanene ikke oppdaterte seg når\n  man la til en transaksjon og navigerte tilbake (manglet refresh ved\n  fokus) - påvirket også riktigheten av saldoen\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gx6YRAuoV4xobjXhnjV9L1","tree":{"sha":"c4fe8d581e29bbe8d3cbaf6d358216c56c8bca64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filipohano/studentapp/git/trees/c4fe8d581e29bbe8d3cbaf6d358216c56c8bca64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filipohano/studentapp/git/commits/214985de849bc4e9378250e7d607f74753000a06","verification":{"payload":"tree c4fe8d581e29bbe8d3cbaf6d358216c56c8bca64\nparent 4aedd653f5c0a8fa424bcce884e93968195e9e03\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784804235 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784804235 +0000\n\nRiktig løpende saldo, Sparing-kategori, fiks stale data på faner\n\n- \"Saldo\" var bare denne månedens inntekt minus utgift og ga et\n  misvisende tall. Regner nå en faktisk løpende saldo: valgfri\n  startsaldo (settes under Profil) + nettosum av ALLE registrerte\n  transaksjoner, ikke bare denne måneden.\n- Ny delt \"Sparing\"-kategori (gjenbruker eksisterende budsjett-\n  system - ingen ny skjerm trengs, sett bare et sparemål som budsjett)\n- Fikset at Oversikt- og Transaksjoner-fanene ikke oppdaterte seg når\n  man la til en transaksjon og navigerte tilbake (manglet refresh ved\n  fokus) - påvirket også riktigheten av saldoen\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gx6YRAuoV4xobjXhnjV9L1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAYlLOAc\nUlcKCpcdDyQdWEYNFeBW7qscGfBHjm4RTpbkQTx5CmFGATUyvbwCwHaF4ue2aTO0Xinxz6Cmtk7O\niwo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-23T10:57:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent