ry page ends with the inline subscribe card, the footer links it, and\n  email links (confirm/manage/unsubscribe) open the in-page dialog.\n- A \"Weekly digest\" button in the home header next to \"Start reading\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQjnbyD2UmCPQunA9GhCbA","tree":{"sha":"60f2c0be1ba799a555758bcea6a8e273b6681dec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/trees/60f2c0be1ba799a555758bcea6a8e273b6681dec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/141200febc6ffe6833b28165576660af6537e1ef","verification":{"payload":"tree 60f2c0be1ba799a555758bcea6a8e273b6681dec\nparent 1ddef8fc5a0bd71540219ff2cc18e04bf76e0a99\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790440439 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790440439 +0200\n\nWeekly digest goes live in the book\n\n- newsletter_api set: the floating bar shows \"newsletter\" instead of \"share\",\n  every page ends with the inline subscribe card, the footer links it, and\n  email links (confirm/manage/unsubscribe) open the in-page dialog.\n- A \"Weekly digest\" button in the home header next to \"Start reading\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQjnbyD2UmCPQunA9GhCbA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEQPTyZ+eoVdhgsLIrkaKwp/kcWjINApLs6/zsBO3aQlm41ynkAyfBuUrpgVmcJOQU\nHN7b5XdZ9CzsOPAqM+8g0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T16:34:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5249932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/followers",