oleksiyp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/commits/1ddef8fc5a0bd71540219ff2cc18e04bf76e0a99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T12:37:01Z","email":"oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com","name":"Oleksiy Pylypenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T12:37:01Z","email":"oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com","name":"Oleksiy Pylypenko"},"message":"Weekly digest UI, inline in the book (off until the API is live)\n\n- Subscribe card at the end of every page, topics as chapter chips (the\n  chapter''s own topic pre-selected on chapter pages), honeypot, no navigation.\n- \"newsletter\" replaces \"share\" in the floating action bar; sharing stays in\n  the footer and the installed app''s header.\n- Email links (confirm / manage / unsubscribe) land on the book as\n  #newsletter=<action>&t=<token>; the head script moves the token into memory\n  and strips the fragment before analytics loads; the dialog does the rest.\n- Everything is gated on site.newsletter_api, empty for now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQjnbyD2UmCPQunA9GhCbA","tree":{"sha":"53f6518def009e4323c53f44e6deeb3295f0b3ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/trees/53f6518def009e4323c53f44e6deeb3295f0b3ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/1ddef8fc5a0bd71540219ff2cc18e04bf76e0a99","verification":{"payload":"tree 53f6518def009e4323c53f44e6deeb3295f0b3ff\nparent 84da1fd73f9db684cd916a54ee02af32506b6359\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790426221 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790426221 +0200\n\nWeekly digest UI, inline in the book (off until the API is live)\n\n- Subscribe card at the end of every page, topics as chapter chips (the\n  chapter''s own topic pre-selected on chapter pages), honeypot, no navigation.\n- \"newsletter\" replaces \"share\" in the floating action bar; sharing stays in\n  the footer and the installed app''s header.\n- Email links (confirm / manage / unsubscribe) land on the book as\n  #newsletter=<action>&t=<token>; the head script moves the token into memory\n  and strips the fragment before analytics loads; the dialog does the rest.\n- Everything is gated on site.newsletter_api, empty for now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQjnbyD2UmCPQunA9GhCbA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMsZPModZ2CcSdidnoPNyW1uEHGytlBZIRYjF41E8W0P2fglaIpTAVxifvLHJOQNu5\nt2YGtmyJ2SWaeU1i35UgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T12:37:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5249932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oleksiyp","id":5249932,"login":"oleksiyp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDk5MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/subscript