o"},"message":"Share button in the header of the installed app\n\nAn installed web app has no browser toolbar, and the floating action bar only\nappears after scrolling, so the first screen had no way to share. Show a Share\nbutton next to \"Start reading\" (and beside the title on chapter pages) only in\nstandalone mode; it uses the existing native share sheet / copy-link fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQjnbyD2UmCPQunA9GhCbA","tree":{"sha":"f17032ed2798e0baad55e196722042b16faa4810","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/trees/f17032ed2798e0baad55e196722042b16faa4810"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/84da1fd73f9db684cd916a54ee02af32506b6359","verification":{"payload":"tree f17032ed2798e0baad55e196722042b16faa4810\nparent ea10b753d60f34c0d59f5ef1d0a8ce15c89d76b5\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790422982 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790422982 +0200\n\nShare button in the header of the installed app\n\nAn installed web app has no browser toolbar, and the floating action bar only\nappears after scrolling, so the first screen had no way to share. Show a Share\nbutton next to \"Start reading\" (and beside the title on chapter pages) only in\nstandalone mode; it uses the existing native share sheet / copy-link fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQjnbyD2UmCPQunA9GhCbA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIHpraonOBmq5vM4ugmrrxf3f7AUGnbeNrBaXQXiM3MK/qAfJQAlTW2Nsf8QsqFWS8\n2nkQGjcpYfZeyVS9YwSQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T11:43:05Z"}},"committer":{"av