ypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790418457 +0200\n\nTidy the home page below the book header\n\nHide the README''s title, tagline and licence line on the site''s home page:\nthe hero and the footer already carry all three, and the indented,\njustified licence line read as clutter. GitHub still shows them.\nCap the hero width on wide screens so book and text stay together.\n\nAlso add a palette shootout page to cover-lab for the chosen cover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDHk3l55aPfa1LFOJsBYK1OTx7MdUWN3B6G6vQpc2v1ArM66oXrlYxUwUesHea8E8Z\n7GWN1oh46JUc3sDNYoaww=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T10:27:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5249932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oleksiyp","id":5249932,"login":"oleksiyp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDk5MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oleksiyp/arch-book/commit/ed81092d74d23b89157a3ca035e983cad85857ed","node_id":"C_kwDOTfhwgdoAKGVkODEwOTJkNzRkMjNiO