one tilt, and opens its cover on tap to a title page with a\n\"Start reading\" link. Chapter pages get a compact version that links home.\n\nThe cover is exported once from cover-lab to assets/cover/wrap.svg, the full\nprint wrap with text converted to outlines; each face is a crop of it.\ncover-lab holds the generative cover proposals and the export script and is\nexcluded from the Jekyll build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f13d0bd14e502f58e0bcfde8c45428e4dc1f2f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/trees/f13d0bd14e502f58e0bcfde8c45428e4dc1f2f3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/a5cce1ef8a5afc788b42c88679674b61f07c8a72","verification":{"payload":"tree f13d0bd14e502f58e0bcfde8c45428e4dc1f2f3e\nparent 8a242d1c36c21353c236fa49fd1097950bc21354\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790417246 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1790417246 +0200\n\nReplace the header with an interactive 3D book cover\n\nThe home page header is now the book itself: a CSS-3D paperback of the chosen\ncover (Emergence, seed 1) that spins in, sways when idle, turns under drag,\nswipe or phone tilt, and opens its cover on tap to a title page with a\n\"Start reading\" link. Chapter pages get a compact version that links home.\n\nThe cover is exported once from cover-lab to assets/cover/wrap.svg, the full\nprint wrap with text converted to outlines; each face is a crop of it.\ncover-lab holds the generative cover proposals and the export script and is\nexcluded from the Jekyll build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFsbD3Q4pq0XNhxYPgteWcmxKgllqToWttJupXUQ6EbLSsLnHzZYCVEeHMQ34FtyHm\nca1T