ail.com","name":"Oleksiy Pylypenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T17:47:10Z","email":"oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com","name":"Oleksiy Pylypenko"},"message":"Global book counters: seconds/visits/uniques/completes, with daily buckets\n\nstats/book/ rolls up whole-book reading: seconds and visits count any\nactive time on the page including front matter (daily buckets too),\nuniques once per device, completes once per device when 80% of chapters\nare read on the full-book page. Rules extended for stats/book and\ndaily/$date/book.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFfzGfmBW","tree":{"sha":"66066a3ffdeca17046c49da6fdfa1a3840fd87e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/trees/66066a3ffdeca17046c49da6fdfa1a3840fd87e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/06f416ee6925cc4a27ce7a5bd804c5190805c998","verification":{"payload":"tree 66066a3ffdeca17046c49da6fdfa1a3840fd87e2\nparent 4fa0b00684c5616e775757da0bd92ec91095bb61\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785606430 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785606430 +0200\n\nGlobal book counters: seconds/visits/uniques/completes, with daily buckets\n\nstats/book/ rolls up whole-book reading: seconds and visits count any\nactive time on the page including front matter (daily buckets too),\nuniques once per device, completes once per device when 80% of chapters\nare read on the full-book page. Rules extended for stats/book and\ndaily/$date/book.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFfzGfmBW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJfrQCCvLTlisB6deW2tgOrvwK3Hi6g91eMqqW4nfvdspdkG08