y.pylypenko@gmail.com","name":"Oleksiy Pylypenko"},"message":"Redesign reading marks: right-edge rails, earned chapter checkmarks, reset\n\nSections no longer get checkmarks — a read section renders as a quiet\ngreen rail segment hugging the right screen edge, spanning the section''s\nextent (document-positioned, recomputed on resize and after mermaid\nlayout). Chapter headings and the ToC show a checkmark only when every\nnumbered section of the chapter is read (Kata/References don''t gate).\nFooter gains Reset Reading Progress with a two-tap confirm that clears\nthe device''s local read-state. Stats counters unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFfzGfmBW","tree":{"sha":"c15137ee7fa4d1136f57b735a00e9ab0c4bd654a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/trees/c15137ee7fa4d1136f57b735a00e9ab0c4bd654a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/524199750f0e7645e414a83a7e1b1e5748867a8e","verification":{"payload":"tree c15137ee7fa4d1136f57b735a00e9ab0c4bd654a\nparent 155c01cbab441dd3e369873ece2c9ae56223b537\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785604391 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785604391 +0200\n\nRedesign reading marks: right-edge rails, earned chapter checkmarks, reset\n\nSections no longer get checkmarks — a read section renders as a quiet\ngreen rail segment hugging the right screen edge, spanning the section''s\nextent (document-positioned, recomputed on resize and after mermaid\nlayout). Chapter headings and the ToC show a checkmark only when every\nnumbered section of the chapter is read (Kata/References don''t gate).\nFooter gains Reset Reading Progress with a two-tap confirm that clears\nthe device''s local read-state. Stats counters unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFf