penko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:55:02Z","email":"oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com","name":"Oleksiy Pylypenko"},"message":"Anonymous per-section reading stats + local progress checkmarks (option C)\n\nThe RTDB gains a stats/ subtree of pure aggregate counters — seconds,\nvisits, uniques per chapter and section, completes per chapter —\nwritten as atomic increments with no per-reader rows and no identifiers\ntransmitted. Uniqueness is deduped by a local ''book-read'' map that\nnever leaves the device and doubles as a feature: completed chapters\nget ToC checkmarks and a ''you have read N of 15'' line. Runs without\ncookies and independently of the consent banner; banner text updated\nfor transparency. firebase.rules.json documents the validation rules\n(bounded monotonic increments, fixed counter names).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFfzGfmBW","tree":{"sha":"cd5efe18dcb810c030123aafd6d2338055030a60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/trees/cd5efe18dcb810c030123aafd6d2338055030a60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/2a4cdb5eb8fb79458a1411bff85519581111f6e9","verification":{"payload":"tree cd5efe18dcb810c030123aafd6d2338055030a60\nparent 831e47e65adc192ae2da2234faeb1d445d94b81c\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785603302 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785603302 +0200\n\nAnonymous per-section reading stats + local progress checkmarks (option C)\n\nThe RTDB gains a stats/ subtree of pure aggregate counters — seconds,\nvisits, uniques per chapter and section, completes per chapter —\nwritten as atomic increments with no per-reader rows and no identifiers\ntransmitted. Uniqueness is deduped by a local ''book-read'' map that\nnever leaves the device and doubles as a feature: completed chapters\nget ToC checkmarks and a ''you have read N of 15'' line. Runs without\ncookies and independently of the consent banner; banner text updated\nfor transparency. firebase.rules.json documents the validation rules\n(bounded monotonic increments, fixed counter names).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFfzGfmBW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBtox/LNrSXYH4guIhVJsPcnm/rVMRay9sfok9giAFL/fM6gPz/9y3Rb9fTjyfOKwf\n87QxcWAdhi0jPzSpL/sQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T16:55:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5249932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oleksiyp","id":5249932,"login":"oleksiyp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDk5MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oleksiyp/arch-book/commit/2a4cdb5eb8fb79458a1411bff85519581111f6e9","node_id":"C_kwDOTfhwgdoAKDJhNGNkYjVlYjhmYjc5NDU4YTE0MTFiZmY4NTUxOTU4MTExMWY2ZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oleksiyp/arch-book/commit/831e47e65adc192ae2da2234faeb1d445d94b81c","sha":"831e47e65adc192ae2da2234faeb