p/arch-book/git/trees/9e3f8d153c3a7064fe389bdfb3af7cdef3fef139"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/3d60e34a88ba5773a986327221733f3d4ab7df4c","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e3f8d153c3a7064fe389bdfb3af7cdef3fef139\nparent 1a333361bbe8363a33da35b6df65af1c81d4c157\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785091787 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785091787 +0200\n\nFix analytics consent gate: opt-out means track unless denied\n\nGA only loaded when cookieconsent_status was exactly ''allow'', but in\nopt-out mode the Approve button sets ''dismiss'' and silent visitors have\nno cookie — so virtually nobody was tracked. Gate on !== ''deny'' to match\nthe banner''s declared opt-out semantics; drop duplicated config keys.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFfzGfmBW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQF/uZCIOL65keLPdqxxSeZKg+if9VhoZVuC7La9he/H8P7aopX7TOLo651Y550vkOK\ncnL0tT6ppR7/Cwz96dOwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T18:49:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5249932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oleksiyp","id":5249932,"login":"oleksiyp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDk5MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiyp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ole