ksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com","name":"Oleksiy Pylypenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T18:43:56Z","email":"oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com","name":"Oleksiy Pylypenko"},"message":"Detect unbranded in-app WebViews for the lifted action bar\n\nReddit''s iOS browser doesn''t put its name in the UA. Detect the WebView\nitself instead: iOS UAs without a Safari/ token (excluding installed\nPWAs via navigator.standalone) and Android UAs with the wv token.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFfzGfmBW","tree":{"sha":"848ff7e2a43704c8fde5a6f58d0aff8de01b012e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/trees/848ff7e2a43704c8fde5a6f58d0aff8de01b012e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oleksiyp/arch-book/git/commits/1a333361bbe8363a33da35b6df65af1c81d4c157","verification":{"payload":"tree 848ff7e2a43704c8fde5a6f58d0aff8de01b012e\nparent 3cac7d5886facd93f529e868c1797ce630a39fe3\nauthor Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785091436 +0200\ncommitter Oleksiy Pylypenko <oleksiy.pylypenko@gmail.com> 1785091436 +0200\n\nDetect unbranded in-app WebViews for the lifted action bar\n\nReddit''s iOS browser doesn''t put its name in the UA. Detect the WebView\nitself instead: iOS UAs without a Safari/ token (excluding installed\nPWAs via navigator.standalone) and Android UAs with the wv token.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RWtstNCh9hzRhTFfzGfmBW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6rSgkkt3JsnjVIJ2MehcZm+90D\nn4xvSahKxQa0CWZ70AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIkLSMbcLMbbIWT5imwHA5SiEhLMMxpV3sEsuCffLFYuH/MgI3dB541cI/KBQMCRdU\nZj9guz0TlhLEXJ/PXWJAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T18:43:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co