vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/commits/9295a755f21a1a3523136c5f997221a2631269eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:30:27Z","email":"gugaime@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:30:27Z","email":"gugaime@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo"},"message":"refactor(api)!: replace investigation stack with inspection orchestrator\n\nVideo Harness v0.2.0 pivota para uma camada fina de orquestração sobre\nStream Lens (inspeção) e Stream Mock (clone/serve), em vez de duplicar\nanálise de vídeo localmente.\n\n- Remove módulos de investigation, record, experiment, ABR, agents,\n  stream-tools e evals (~40k linhas), junto com docs e UI relacionados\n- Novo servidor Fastify enxuto: /health, /v1/services e rotas\n  /v1/inspections que repassam para o Lens\n- Auth com Clerk JWT (@clerk/backend) com dev-mode aberto quando\n  CLERK_SECRET_KEY não está configurada\n- .env.example, compose, Dockerfile e Makefile atualizados para o novo\n  layout de serviços; docs/ARCHITECTURE.md documenta o pivot","tree":{"sha":"a7ac3aae8bd8a78428b69bc42d4342fe154cc4c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/a7ac3aae8bd8a78428b69bc42d4342fe154cc4c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/9295a755f21a1a3523136c5f997221a2631269eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17186525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/followers","following_u