":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T00:21:27Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"message":"feat(record): support DASH VOD with ABR controls\n\n- Add DashVodMaterializer for static clear fMP4 MPDs (SegmentTemplate with timeline or duration); rejects dynamic, DRM, SegmentBase and byte ranges.\n- Add ProtocolRecordingMaterializer dispatching by recording.protocol in the worker; intake and contract accept `protocol: hls | dash`, HLS stays default.\n- Rewrite local index.mpd with registered init/segments and estimate ladder size before downloading; over-budget recordings fail definitively with STREAM_RESPONSE_TOO_LARGE and no retry.\n- Serve playback via fixed URLs: /streams/fixed/index.m3u8|index.mpd resolve the most recent created/active run; the opaque token route is kept.\n- Add /streams/fixed-1080/index.mpd control serving a derived MPD with only the highest-bitrate 1920x1080 video representation plus audio.\n- Add UI playback modes: Normal, Force ABR (Good -> constrained -> recovery) and 1080p control, with profile presets in the API client.\n- Redesign the recording page as a dashboard: state chip, KPI cards, shaping stepper, SVG bandwidth-vs-representation and latency charts, request journal timeline and activity feed.\n- Update docs: api.md, phase-record-dash-vod (active), START-HERE, PROJECT-STATUS and UI-GUIDE.","tree":{"sha":"2c3c63a1f75a58fe66c8c3ab6ae58747774c99db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/2c3c63a1f75a58fe66c8c3ab6ae58747774c99db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/fb8aba63a0d32fc87283e6548160f5332060bac5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17186525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api