/users/gugaio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/commits/cecda55ea3ae5e0cee11588f3a62959dc66086db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T10:44:12Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T10:44:12Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"message":"feat(record): add HLS VOD recording with ABR playback\n\n- Add record HLS VOD module (domain/application/adapters) with provenance README.\n- Materialize clear MPEG-TS HLS VOD; reject DRM, fMP4, byte-range, live.\n- Add durable recording worker with lease/heartbeat and ready/failed states.\n- Serve preregistered playback runs via deterministic network shaper.\n- Journal delivery requests to prove representation selection.\n- Add DASH forensics: MPD parser, fMP4/ISOBMFF inspection, reported context,\n  and 4K->FullHD boundary analysis.\n- Add recording/playback/streams API routes, SSE streaming, Record page,\n  recording page, and DASH forensics report card.\n- Add migrations 006-009, config, evals tsconfig, and doc updates.","tree":{"sha":"324d19af6293ad2acbb22cd18c39cfe58f0d0c30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/324d19af6293ad2acbb22cd18c39cfe58f0d0c30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/cecda55ea3ae5e0cee11588f3a62959dc66086db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17186525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/followers","following_url":"https://a