/api.github.com/users/gugaio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/commits/95bf5c65f7ef50e7ba4a410298583b3d5e3a3087/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T19:09:58Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T19:09:58Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"message":"feat(lab): sandboxed shell environment for AI-driven media diagnostics\n\n- New lab service: isolated Fastify over Unix socket, no network, read-only fs, resource-limited, drops to uid 10001\n- Pi AI auto-runs freezedetect via FFmpeg when problem mentions freeze/congelamento\n- Lead Investigator gets shell_exec tool for on-demand FFmpeg/FFprobe/MediaInfo measurements\n- FilesystemLabWorkspace materializes URL-free HLS view (index.m3u8 + segments + case.json) before AI\n- HttpMediaSampleCollector \"full\" mode downloads all segments; byte budget throws limitations instead of errors\n- Shell runs persisted to investigation_shell_runs table for auditability\n- compose.yml: lab container wired with socket volume, worker gets LAB_* env vars\n- Dockerfile: adds bash, jq, python3, file to runtime image","tree":{"sha":"b72a2d933c680277f5a2fd01935a5343d274c656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/b72a2d933c680277f5a2fd01935a5343d274c656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/95bf5c65f7ef50e7ba4a410298583b3d5e3a3087","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17186525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/followers","following_url"