ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/commits/8d2406cb0fcc2a1f58077721ca3d9326dd0a63d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T17:12:50Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T17:12:50Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"message":"feat(pi): integrate Pi AI agents, localhost SSRF alias, and rich investigation UI\n\n- feat(pi): PiInvestigationAI adapter with 3 specialists + Lead Investigator; InvestigationAI port; tolerant boundary for non-finite confidence and malformed findings with retry; per-agent safe logging\n- feat(ssrf): SafeHttpClient accepts requestedAliasHostname for restricted localhost bypass; Compose maps localhost -> host.docker.internal via extra_hosts\n- feat(hls): beginning/middle/end segment sampling per playlist; direct media playlist support without master manifest\n- feat(ui): CaseHero, InvestigationFeed, InvestigationReport, agents.tsx with personas, avatars, severity badges, and confidence ring\n- feat(config): VIDEO_HARNESS_AI_* variables, STREAM_LOCALHOST_ALIAS, media sample limits raised to 20 MiB\n- docs: update phases 2/3, SSRF alias decision, project status, development guide\n- deps: add @earendil-works/pi-agent-core and @earendil-works/pi-ai","tree":{"sha":"a0def7dc2bc4b90a3aa9e263132521aff6811ce9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/a0def7dc2bc4b90a3aa9e263132521aff6811ce9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/8d2406cb0fcc2a1f58077721ca3d9326dd0a63d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17186525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu