gugaio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/commits/0a612194b36cbce9c56f4d808958f73215528e43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:14:42Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T00:14:42Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"message":"feat(media): add bounded sampling and ffprobe\n\n- MediaSampleCollector + HttpMediaSampleCollector — coleta init segment e primeiro segmento de midia de variantes HLS, com limite total de 16MB, ignorando byte ranges e encryption\n- FfprobeMediaProbe — spawna ffprobe com -show_packets, -show_streams, -show_format, extrai codec, timestamps PTS/DTS, duracao, resolucao, frame rate; com timeout e limite de output\n- hls-manifest.ts — parsing de segments (#EXTINF URLs), init segments (#EXT-X-MAP), encryption (#EXT-X-KEY) com estrutura tipada\n- Pipeline opcional: se mediaCollector + mediaProbe injetados, coleta + probe apos manifestos, erros de probe viram limitations sem quebrar o pipeline\n- EvidenceBundleV2.mediaSamples[] com probe, sourceManifestLogicalKey, sequence, declaredDuration\n- buildManifestEvidence computa AV_INITIAL_TIMESTAMP_OFFSET (warning se > 100ms) e inclui findings por sample probeado\n- generatedBy evolui para deterministic-media-v1 quando amostras sao coletadas\n- 3 novos arquivos de teste, worker DI com media opcional","tree":{"sha":"6daa67be9d4c560db6d4a596f6e9ab490b2cd4a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/6daa67be9d4c560db6d4a596f6e9ab490b2cd4a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/0a612194b36cbce9c56f4d808958f73215528e43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"comm