:49:17Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"message":"refactor(collector): rename port and unify manifest types\n\n- StreamEvidenceCollector → ManifestCollector (port), HttpManifestCollector (adapter)\n- CollectedManifest / CollectedManifestEvidence → Manifest / ManifestCollection\n- Manifest.artifact opcional carrega id, storageKey e sizeBytes — elimina PromotedManifest separado\n- buildManifestEvidence recebe ManifestCollection em vez de dois argumentos\n- collectManifestEvidence → collect, removido sufixo redundante\n- Worker DI, testes e docs atualizados","tree":{"sha":"2840fa5ea1f2cf941dab62ba9710ad72e3616c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/2840fa5ea1f2cf941dab62ba9710ad72e3616c86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/91e015c7731240fdede56b6371775bc2466e613e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17186525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugaio","id":17186525,"login":"gugaio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTg2NTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gugaio/videoharness/commit/91e015c7731240fdede56b6371775bc2466e613e","