t\n- selectHlsManifestSample — seleciona variante de maior bandwidth + audio rendition vinculada para investigacao limitada\n- collectManifestEvidence — coleta root manifest + ate 2 derivados (variant + audio rendition) com protecao SSRF em cada requisicao\n- buildManifestEvidence — constroi EvidenceBundleV2 com HLS variants/renditions/selection completos\n- buildManifestReport — gera report com findings por manifesto coletado, substituindo funcoes inline\n- Pipeline em lote: promove N artifacts via artifact store, registra batch com todas as logical keys\n- EvidenceBundleV2.hls — schema com variants, renditions, selection rule e indices referenciados\n- 3 novos arquivos de teste (hls-manifest, collector, run-investigation multi-manifest)","tree":{"sha":"3862e9fafc9d0bf6b5e34db1948cc91b006d428d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/3862e9fafc9d0bf6b5e34db1948cc91b006d428d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/8ceb0aa2a11b8866badfe2a7d55d029a6a0a315f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17186525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugaio","id":17186525,"login":"gugaio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTg2NTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://ap