ype":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/commits/33920e5c934c82519abe272348731aed5a247f35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:35:12Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:35:12Z","email":"gustavo.barros@jurus.com.br","name":"Gustavo Barros"},"message":"feat(stream-tools): add deterministic manifest collection\n\n- SafeHttpClient — DNS antecipado, filtro de IPs privados, requester pinado por endereço, limite de redirects, timeout e max bytes\n- inspectManifest — detecção determinística de HLS (#EXTM3U) e DASH (<MPD) sem LLM\n- ManifestEvidenceCollector — adapter que compõe HTTP seguro + inspeção no application core\n- FilesystemArtifactStore — salva bytes em disco com diretório isolado por investigation, retorna storageKey, protege path traversal\n- EvidenceBundle versionado (schema v1) com source, manifest, observations e limitations\n- Pipeline real no worker: validate → collectManifest → recordEvidence → analyze → synthesize → complete\n- classifyFailure com mapeamento de StreamCollectionErrorCode para retryabilidade\n- Schema do report evoluído para discriminatedUnion (placeholder vs manifest), evidence incluída no report\n- UI exibe findings, observações, limitações e confidence level\n- 5 novos arquivos de teste (SafeHttpClient, manifest, artifact store), 5 novos ports/domain","tree":{"sha":"250cdf9c33be7f864633f4ae8ce1a707b805f06f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/trees/250cdf9c33be7f864633f4ae8ce1a707b805f06f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gugaio/videoharness/git/commits/33920e5c934c82519abe272348731aed5a247f35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17186525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugaio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.git