"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/26e8e2d0faac719a8d7104ded915c8b501f61e55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T14:31:26Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T14:31:26Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Show a real message instead of \"{}\" for 5xx auth errors on login/signup\n\nsupabase-js labels 5xx auth responses AuthRetryableFetchError and sets\n.message to JSON.stringify(the raw Response object), which serializes\nto the literal text \"{}\" — that''s what users saw on screen instead of\nan actual error, e.g. during the ongoing \"Error sending confirmation\nemail\" signup failure. friendlyErrorMessage now catches any auth error\nwith status >= 500 before it reaches the string-matching fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f9af2a849d1cc2f82f166d7b83086b36c43019b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/3f9af2a849d1cc2f82f166d7b83086b36c43019b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/26e8e2d0faac719a8d7104ded915c8b501f61e55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/26e8e2d0faac719a8d7104ded915c8b501f61e55","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDI2ZThlMmQwZmFhYzcxOWE4ZDcxMDRkZWQ5MTVjOGI1MDFmNjFlNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/f49abe22bb254b2fe078613986442c940320e7a4","sha":"f49abe22bb254b2fe078613986442c940320e7a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/f49abe22bb254b2fe078613986442c940320e7a4"}],"sha":"26e8e2d0faac719a8d7104ded915c8b501f61e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/26e8e2d0faac719a8d7104ded915c8b501f61e55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/f49abe22bb254b2fe078613986442c940320e7a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:57:28Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:57:28Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Consolidate MFA challenge into a single gate to fix back-button bug\n\n/login and /admin-login each did their own inline AAL check and rendered\ntheir own MfaChallengeStep after password sign-in, duplicating exactly\nwhat MandatoryMfaGate already does for every session at \"/\". Two separate\nimplementations of the same gate could disagree about what to show —\nreported as: after logging in, pressing the browser Back button (which\nreturns to /login''s history entry) could land on a stray authenticator\ncode screen. Both login pages now just authenticate and hand off to \"/\",\nand /login and /admin-login redirect away immediately if a session already\nexists, so there''s exactly one place in the app that ever asks for an MFA\ncode.","tree":{"sha":"e6b86cf8298e67379024edac7bda47272413b2f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/e6b86cf8298e67379024edac7bda47272413b2f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/f49abe22bb254b2fe078613986442c940320e7a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/f49abe22bb254b2fe078613986442c940320e7a4","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGY0OWFiZTIyYmIyNTRiMmZlMDc4NjEzOTg2NDQyYzk0MDMyMGU3YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/654e85eccb5f1023dafedda6db398262e28d4a05","sha":"654e85eccb5f1023dafedda6db398262e28d4a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/654e85eccb5f1023dafedda6db398262e28d4a05"}],"sha":"f49abe22bb254b2fe078613986442c940320e7a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/f49abe22bb254b2fe078613986442c940320e7a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/654e85eccb5f1023dafedda6db398262e28d4a05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:40:08Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:40:08Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Make authenticator-app 2FA mandatory for every account, not just staff\n\nRegular users were defaulting into an app-layer email code at login with\nTOTP as an optional upgrade — backwards from the intended design where an\nauthenticator app is the required baseline (matching staff) and email code\nis only a fallback for someone who already enrolled TOTP but doesn''t have\ntheir device. MandatoryMfaGate now wraps all of AppShell unconditionally,\nMfaChallengeStep is self-contained with an opt-in allowEmailFallback prop,\nlogin.tsx no longer has its own email-OTP branch, and two-factor-section.tsx\ndrops the now-impossible enroll/disable states.","tree":{"sha":"49473f50c321958466fc7fca4364662f61f1559a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/49473f50c321958466fc7fca4364662f61f1559a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/654e85eccb5f1023dafedda6db398262e28d4a05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/654e85eccb5f1023dafedda6db398262e28d4a05","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDY1NGU4NWVjY2I1ZjEwMjNkYWZlZGRhNmRiMzk4MjYyZTI4ZDRhMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/822697b63f17ac74d6e698a74be072b3a7550c56","sha":"822697b63f17ac74d6e698a74be072b3a7550c56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/822697b63f17ac74d6e698a74be072b3a7550c56"}],"sha":"654e85eccb5f1023dafedda6db398262e28d4a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/654e85eccb5f1023dafedda6db398262e28d4a05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/822697b63f17ac74d6e698a74be072b3a7550c56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:41:58Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:41:58Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Replace flat week/month toggle with a real day/hour/week/day drill-down\n\nThe previous week/month toggle was two flat, fixed-window views -- it\ncouldn''t answer \"what does a specific day look like\" since a week/month\nview just averages across a wider window. Replaces it with an actual\ndrill-down: By day shows hour-of-day buckets, By week shows day-of-week\nbuckets, By month shows day-of-month buckets -- one level finer than the\nperiod itself, plus prev/next/Today navigation (capped so you can''t\nbrowse into the future) to pick which specific day/week/month to view.\n\nNew shared web/src/lib/trend-periods.ts (with unit tests covering all\nthree granularities, boundary dates, and empty-bucket filling) plus a\nreusable PeriodNav control, both used by Admin Analytics and Lister\nAnalytics. The bookings/revenue queries now fetch only the currently-\nviewed period''s rows instead of a fixed 12-week/12-month window, since\nthe view is browsable rather than static. AI Insights now receives the\nactual selected period so its commentary matches what''s on screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64d97b03624d91d84de0afc8c7bed9850df32502","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/64d97b03624d91d84de0afc8c7bed9850df32502"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/822697b63f17ac74d6e698a74be072b3a7550c56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/822697b63f17ac74d6e698a74be072b3a7550c56","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDgyMjY5N2I2M2YxN2FjNzRkNmU2OThhNzRiZTA3MmIzYTc1NTBjNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9c58b93c312e33fd89fcf3546a60e3e973a91983","sha":"9c58b93c312e33fd89fcf3546a60e3e973a91983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9c58b93c312e33fd89fcf3546a60e3e973a91983"}],"sha":"822697b63f17ac74d6e698a74be072b3a7550c56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/822697b63f17ac74d6e698a74be072b3a7550c56"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9c58b93c312e33fd89fcf3546a60e3e973a91983/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:31:42Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:31:42Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add week/month toggle to bookings/revenue trend charts (spot peak months)\n\nThe trend line charts were hardcoded to weekly buckets over a fixed\n12-week window, so there was no way to see month-over-month or seasonal\npatterns -- only whether one week within the last ~3 months was busier\nthan another. Widens the underlying query to a 12-month window (kept\nseparate from the existing 12-week query that still feeds top\nmodels/locations/dispute rate/funnel, which are deliberately scoped to\nrecent activity) and adds a By week / By month toggle on both Admin\nAnalytics and Lister Analytics revenue/bookings charts. AI Insights now\nreceives both granularities so it can call out an actual peak month, not\njust a peak week.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3dacce6ce9f7883cc84de1fe1748182e123101f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/e3dacce6ce9f7883cc84de1fe1748182e123101f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/9c58b93c312e33fd89fcf3546a60e3e973a91983","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9c58b93c312e33fd89fcf3546a60e3e973a91983","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDljNThiOTNjMzEyZTMzZmQ4OWZjZjM1NDZhNjBlM2U5NzNhOTE5ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9670bd92f394639d3e096e8759126e7a060c2f88","sha":"9670bd92f394639d3e096e8759126e7a060c2f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9670bd92f394639d3e096e8759126e7a060c2f88"}],"sha":"9c58b93c312e33fd89fcf3546a60e3e973a91983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9c58b93c312e33fd89fcf3546a60e3e973a91983"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9670bd92f394639d3e096e8759126e7a060c2f88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:55:07Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:55:07Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add AI-generated analytics insights via Google Gemini (free tier)\n\nAnthropic''s Claude API has no free tier, so this uses Google Gemini''s\nfree tier instead -- a deliberate provider choice for a capstone project\nwith no budget. New generate-ai-insights edge function turns the\nalready-computed analytics numbers (bookings/revenue trend, top\nmodels/locations, dispute rate, per-vehicle occupancy) into a short list\nof natural-language insights, on top of the existing rule-based\nsuggestion cards on both Admin Analytics and Lister Analytics.\n\nConfirmed live against the actual API key before picking a model:\ngemini-2.5-flash and gemini-2.0-flash both fail for this key (404 \"no\nlonger available to new users\" / 429 zero free quota) -- landed on\ngemini-3.5-flash, the current stable flash model with real free-tier\nquota.\n\nOn-demand via a button (not auto-loaded on page view) since the free\ntier is rate-limited and shared across every admin/lister using the\napp; backed by a 20s per-user cooldown (request_ai_insights_cooldown(),\n065_ai_insights_cooldown.sql) reusing the existing enforce_cooldown()\npattern from 032_rate_limiting.sql.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bae7f41d57ef8ac2618d73460b1ed96aca0b69b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/bae7f41d57ef8ac2618d73460b1ed96aca0b69b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/9670bd92f394639d3e096e8759126e7a060c2f88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9670bd92f394639d3e096e8759126e7a060c2f88","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDk2NzBiZDkyZjM5NDYzOWQzZTA5NmU4NzU5MTI2ZTdhMDYwYzJmODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/634c0a6fdc281055ab77c120400954f15d078b57","sha":"634c0a6fdc281055ab77c120400954f15d078b57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/634c0a6fdc281055ab77c120400954f15d078b57"}],"sha":"9670bd92f394639d3e096e8759126e7a060c2f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9670bd92f394639d3e096e8759126e7a060c2f88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/634c0a6fdc281055ab77c120400954f15d078b57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:26:24Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:26:24Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Route-based code splitting: 880KB single bundle -> 292KB main + per-route chunks\n\nApp.tsx eagerly imported all ~30 route components, so every user downloaded\nthe entire app on first load regardless of role -- a renter''s browser\nfetched the full admin dashboard/analytics/audit surface, and vice versa\nfor staff hitting /admin-login. Confirmed by today''s code-consistency audit\nas the one real, actionable gap (everything else checked out clean).\n\nConverted every route to React.lazy() wrapped in a single top-level\nSuspense boundary. Since these route files use named exports (not\n`export default`, which React.lazy() requires), added a small `named()`\nhelper that remaps the dynamic import''s named export into the {default}\nshape lazy() expects, rather than touching 30 route files just to add a\ndefault export.\n\nMain bundle: 880KB (gzip 234KB) -> 292KB (gzip 91KB), rest split into\n2-18KB per-route chunks loaded on demand. The \"chunks larger than 500kB\"\nVite build warning is gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4c3fad2daa9ea409eae9ca99aafd64af075b547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/a4c3fad2daa9ea409eae9ca99aafd64af075b547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/634c0a6fdc281055ab77c120400954f15d078b57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/634c0a6fdc281055ab77c120400954f15d078b57","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDYzNGMwYTZmZGMyODEwNTVhYjc3YzEyMDQwMDk1NGYxNWQwNzhiNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/5203f6f97f633445bc0ee6a4af4c842f3fcc2769","sha":"5203f6f97f633445bc0ee6a4af4c842f3fcc2769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5203f6f97f633445bc0ee6a4af4c842f3fcc2769"}],"sha":"634c0a6fdc281055ab77c120400954f15d078b57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/634c0a6fdc281055ab77c120400954f15d078b57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5203f6f97f633445bc0ee6a4af4c842f3fcc2769/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:22:37Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:22:37Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Patch 3 dependency vulnerabilities (react-router CSRF bypass, nanoid, postcss)\n\nnpm audit surfaced these while working in web/ this session — all three\nfixes land within existing semver ranges (no major bumps), applied via\nnpm audit fix. Highest severity: GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2, a react-router RSC\nMode CSRF bypass allowing action execution before the expected 400\nresponse, affecting the 7.12.0-7.18.1 range already in use.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a83571b15a8b5f98c52c8d794cc04f1f97cb642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/0a83571b15a8b5f98c52c8d794cc04f1f97cb642"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/5203f6f97f633445bc0ee6a4af4c842f3fcc2769","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/5203f6f97f633445bc0ee6a4af4c842f3fcc2769","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDUyMDNmNmY5N2Y2MzM0NDViYzBlZTZhNGFmNGM4NDJmM2ZjYzI3Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/4d23e85c376d4c201d8671a185e47b514d6d214a","sha":"4d23e85c376d4c201d8671a185e47b514d6d214a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/4d23e85c376d4c201d8671a185e47b514d6d214a"}],"sha":"5203f6f97f633445bc0ee6a4af4c842f3fcc2769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5203f6f97f633445bc0ee6a4af4c842f3fcc2769"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/4d23e85c376d4c201d8671a185e47b514d6d214a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:15:28Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:15:28Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add shadcn/ui as a pilot on Admin Settings, with a per-section lock\n\nSets up shadcn/ui (Radix + Tailwind) properly integrated with the app''s\nexisting design tokens rather than its generic default theme: the CLI''s\ninjected color/radius tokens are aliased onto the app''s own --color-*\nvariables so new components inherit the real brand teal and glass look\nand follow the same [data-theme] dark-mode switching, instead of looking\nlike a bolted-on separate UI kit. Also fixes a real path-alias resolution\ngap (root tsconfig.json didn''t expose the @/* mapping declared in the\nreferenced tsconfig.app.json, so the CLI was about to keep writing files\ninto a literal \"@/\" folder) and drops the unused Geist font import to\nkeep the system-ui-only, no-external-fonts decision intact.\n\nFirst real page on it: Platform Settings now groups business rules into\nfour sections (Payments & Commission, Booking Rules & Timing, Trust &\nSafety, Login Security), each independently locked behind a shadcn Switch\nand auto-relocking after a save — a misclick in one section can no longer\nsilently change a live business rule, per panel feedback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e7fd325bb50b69bd14644d78d4fb07279b2a8a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/3e7fd325bb50b69bd14644d78d4fb07279b2a8a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/4d23e85c376d4c201d8671a185e47b514d6d214a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/4d23e85c376d4c201d8671a185e47b514d6d214a","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDRkMjNlODVjMzc2ZDRjMjAxZDg2NzFhMTg1ZTQ3YjUxNGQ2ZDIxNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/73ed683a1437fae520f94568fdd2bdeefbf44f8d","sha":"73ed683a1437fae520f94568fdd2bdeefbf44f8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/73ed683a1437fae520f94568fdd2bdeefbf44f8d"}],"sha":"4d23e85c376d4c201d8671a185e47b514d6d214a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/4d23e85c376d4c201d8671a185e47b514d6d214a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/73ed683a1437fae520f94568fdd2bdeefbf44f8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:54:21Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:54:21Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add missing back/cancel controls: camera capture, MFA challenge, email-code screen\n\nApp-wide audit per panel feedback (\"back button also needed... always\").\nMost dialogs already had this via the shared ConfirmDialog component\n(click-outside + Never mind), but three real gaps existed: the live\ncamera view in Get Verified had no way to cancel once opened, and both\nMFA challenge screens (authenticator code and the mandatory email code)\nhad no way back to the sign-in step if e.g. the wrong account was used.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c59756b73924bbc0cd84980db762f7ebe9beda9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/c59756b73924bbc0cd84980db762f7ebe9beda9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/73ed683a1437fae520f94568fdd2bdeefbf44f8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/73ed683a1437fae520f94568fdd2bdeefbf44f8d","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDczZWQ2ODNhMTQzN2ZhZTUyMGY5NDU2OGZkZDJiZGVlZmJmNDRmOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/db16e064e426b9ae62812fad80df7f1c3731bd41","sha":"db16e064e426b9ae62812fad80df7f1c3731bd41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/db16e064e426b9ae62812fad80df7f1c3731bd41"}],"sha":"73ed683a1437fae520f94568fdd2bdeefbf44f8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/73ed683a1437fae520f94568fdd2bdeefbf44f8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/db16e064e426b9ae62812fad80df7f1c3731bd41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:49:37Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:49:37Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Terms page, real Forgot-Password back button, visible scrollbars, and an admin-editable car body type catalog\n\nPanel/live-testing feedback round: Terms of Service was referenced on\nsignup but never actually existed as a page; Forgot Password had no\nexplicit back affordance; notification/inquiry/chat lists gave no visual\nsignal they were scrollable; and password show/hide used mismatched emoji\nicons instead of the app''s lucide-react iconography.\n\nAlso converts vehicles.car_models.body_type from a fixed 9-value CHECK\nconstraint into an admin-editable car_body_types catalog\n(066_car_body_type_catalog.sql), matching how brands/models already work\nvia Admin > Car Catalog, so a new body type no longer requires a migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a8f268a663bf1ec3b29c8aef6300d60104c6290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/3a8f268a663bf1ec3b29c8aef6300d60104c6290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/db16e064e426b9ae62812fad80df7f1c3731bd41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/db16e064e426b9ae62812fad80df7f1c3731bd41","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGRiMTZlMDY0ZTQyNmI5YWU2MjgxMmZhZDgwZGY3ZjFjMzczMWJkNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/640f9668dabdba533a369dceb658d9e5fc5e9c79","sha":"640f9668dabdba533a369dceb658d9e5fc5e9c79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/640f9668dabdba533a369dceb658d9e5fc5e9c79"}],"sha":"db16e064e426b9ae62812fad80df7f1c3731bd41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/db16e064e426b9ae62812fad80df7f1c3731bd41"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/640f9668dabdba533a369dceb658d9e5fc5e9c79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:34:01Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:34:01Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Let TOTP users fall back to the mandatory email code at login\n\nPreviously, enrolling an authenticator app made it the only way in --\nlosing the device meant resetting 2FA entirely via a backup code just to\nlog in. Adds a \"Use email code instead\" option on the TOTP challenge\nscreen for regular users, reusing the same request_email_otp() baseline\nevery account already has. Staff (/admin-login) intentionally keep\nauthenticator-only, since email OTP is an app-layer check that never\ngrants the real aal2 session 034_mandatory_mfa_for_staff.sql requires.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b89f628315437d4192b9f295b9a44b31c609d992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/b89f628315437d4192b9f295b9a44b31c609d992"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/640f9668dabdba533a369dceb658d9e5fc5e9c79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/640f9668dabdba533a369dceb658d9e5fc5e9c79","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDY0MGY5NjY4ZGFiZGJhNTMzYTM2OWRjZWI2NThkOWU1ZmM1ZTljNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/8a7bd7497f6ab43ee4e592d9a5969156bae841ea","sha":"8a7bd7497f6ab43ee4e592d9a5969156bae841ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/8a7bd7497f6ab43ee4e592d9a5969156bae841ea"}],"sha":"640f9668dabdba533a369dceb658d9e5fc5e9c79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/640f9668dabdba533a369dceb658d9e5fc5e9c79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/8a7bd7497f6ab43ee4e592d9a5969156bae841ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:08:22Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:08:22Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Separate admin login, mandatory 2FA from signup, and admin-assisted MFA recovery\n\nAddresses live-testing panel feedback: /admin-login is now a distinct staff\nentry point from the consumer /login; every account gets mandatory 6-digit\nemailed 2FA at login from the moment it''s created (065_email_otp.sql), with\na working resend-code control, instead of 2FA being opt-in with no resend\npath; and admins can now reset a user''s stuck TOTP enrollment (Reset 2FA in\nAdmin Users) when someone is locked out of their authenticator with no\nbackup codes, since there was previously no way back in for them at all.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdc42f6d14ac0adc74235df8b64598b1d0b43a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/bdc42f6d14ac0adc74235df8b64598b1d0b43a66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/8a7bd7497f6ab43ee4e592d9a5969156bae841ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"htt