ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/3343aa30a26ca5e7dd5c6a9764ced2bc7cd82d9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:28:01Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:28:01Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix webhook event names to match PayMongo''s actual event list\n\nWeb search results suggested refund.updated and payout.paid/failed,\nbut the real event names in this account''s dashboard are different:\npayment.refund.updated (refund events live under Payment, not a\nseparate Refund category), and transfer.outward.successful/failed\nfor disbursements specifically (a \"Payout\" category also exists but\nmeans PayMongo settling funds INTO the merchant''s own bank account —\nthe opposite direction from sending money out to a vehicle owner).\nConfirmed by looking at the actual webhook event checkbox list in the\nPayMongo dashboard, not assumed from docs/search.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"823546851aec093d385036a8119eb4dbc6a9361c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/823546851aec093d385036a8119eb4dbc6a9361c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/3343aa30a26ca5e7dd5c6a9764ced2bc7cd82d9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/3343aa30a26ca5e7dd5c6a9764ced2bc7cd82d9a","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDMzNDNhYTMwYTI2Y2E1ZTdkZDVjNmE5NzY0Y2VkMmJjN2NkODJkOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/b5795a7b7dca887f855531b6822a436030dff703","sha":"b5795a7b7dca887f855531b6822a436030dff703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/b5795a7b7dca887f855531b6822a436030dff703"}],"sha":"3343aa30a26ca5e7dd5c6a9764ced2bc7cd82d9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/3343aa30a26ca5e7dd5c6a9764ced2bc7cd82d9a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/b5795a7b7dca887f855531b6822a436030dff703/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:45:57Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:45:57Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Automate GCash owner payouts via PayMongo Disbursements (v2)\n\nOwner payouts were 100% manual: admin sends money via their own GCash/\nbank app outside the system, then clicks Mark as Sent to record it.\nPayMongo confirmed Disbursements are available on this account with\nno special approval needed, so this wires up real automation for the\nsafe/common case.\n\nScoped to GCash only, deliberately: owner bank details are free-text\ntoday (bank_name typed by hand, never validated against PayMongo''s\nreal institution list), so auto-matching them risks a misdirected\ntransfer. GCash is a single fixed institution, so it doesn''t have\nthat problem. Bank-transfer payouts keep the existing manual\nmark_payout_sent() flow untouched -- same automate-the-safe-case\npattern already used for deposit and cancellation refunds.\n\nNew process-payout Edge Function calls PayMongo''s v2/batch_transfers\nAPI (a different, newer product than the v1 Checkout/Refunds APIs\nalready integrated): looks up GCash''s provider_code live from\nPayMongo''s own receiving-institutions list (never hardcoded), enforces\nInstaPay''s real ₱50,000 per-transaction cap with a clear error +\nmanual fallback above that, and uses a generated Idempotency-Key per\nPayMongo''s go-live checklist so a retried request can''t double-send\nmoney. Tracks all three IDs their reconciliation guidance calls for\n(transfer id, our reference_number, the bank rail''s\nprovider_reference_number). Webhook handler''s payout.paid/payout.failed\nfield extraction is written defensively and flagged for live\nverification, since PayMongo''s docs didn''t expose the exact v2\nwebhook payload shape.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2924cf059420306a17a54c099938a1d0197f8c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/e2924cf059420306a17a54c099938a1d0197f8c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/b5795a7b7dca887f855531b6822a436030dff703","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/b5795a7b7dca887f855531b6822a436030dff703","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGI1Nzk1YTdiN2RjYTg4N2Y4NTU1MzFiNjgyMmE0MzYwMzBkZmY3MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/fa6c75561fb512dd6260fadec2d7c672e5289837","sha":"fa6c75561fb512dd6260fadec2d7c672e5289837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/fa6c75561fb512dd6260fadec2d7c672e5289837"}],"sha":"b5795a7b7dca887f855531b6822a436030dff703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/b5795a7b7dca887f855531b6822a436030dff703"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/fa6c75561fb512dd6260fadec2d7c672e5289837/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T05:45:49Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T05:45:49Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Automate cancellation refunds via PayMongo (real gap fix)\n\ncancel_booking() already correctly computed and inserted an owed\n''refund'' payments row for cancelled bookings, but nothing in the\nsystem ever processed it -- process-refund was hard-scoped to\ncompleted-booking deposit refunds only, and Admin Send Payments never\nqueried general cancellation refund rows at all. A cancelled\nrenter/owner had no path to actually get their money back.\n\nprocess-refund now auto-detects deposit vs cancellation refunds from\nthe booking''s status and refunds against the original downpayment\ncharge either way. A cancellation refund whose amount exceeds that\nsingle charge (booking was fully_paid, balance was a separate charge)\nreturns a clear error rather than silently mis-processing -- admin\nuses the new manual \"Mark Sent Manually\" fallback for that edge case,\nsame automate-the-common-case-keep-a-manual-escape-hatch pattern this\ncodebase already uses for deposits/payouts. confirm_deposit_refund_result\ngeneralized to confirm_refund_result since the same PayMongo webhook\nevent confirms both refund kinds identically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb587e2550375f6968adddf6d5099d698cb1c596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/bb587e2550375f6968adddf6d5099d698cb1c596"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/fa6c75561fb512dd6260fadec2d7c672e5289837","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/fa6c75561fb512dd6260fadec2d7c672e5289837","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGZhNmM3NTU2MWZiNTEyZGQ2MjYwZmFkZWMyZDdjNjcyZTUyODk4Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/2a4e8e76dcb499a900a9c23c68ffcec744213124","sha":"2a4e8e76dcb499a900a9c23c68ffcec744213124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/2a4e8e76dcb499a900a9c23c68ffcec744213124"}],"sha":"fa6c75561fb512dd6260fadec2d7c672e5289837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/fa6c75561fb512dd6260fadec2d7c672e5289837"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/2a4e8e76dcb499a900a9c23c68ffcec744213124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T05:26:00Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T05:26:00Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add printable booking invoices with sequential invoice numbers\n\nA capstone panelist asked for a proper itemized billing breakdown per\nbooking. All the underlying pricing/payment data already existed\n(request_booking''s base_price/commission/total_price math,\nconfirm_downpayment_paid/confirm_balance_paid''s payment rows,\ncancel_booking''s persisted refund row) -- this surfaces it as a\nprintable invoice view rather than a generated PDF file, reachable\nfrom My Bookings and Bookings Received once a downpayment is\nreceived (the moment a booking becomes a real transaction, not just\na request). Invoice numbers are a real Postgres sequence\n(INV-2026-000123 style), assigned in confirm_downpayment_paid() and\nbackfilled for bookings already paid before this migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b19c65d655666cb67d2db43ba493bf905801bad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/b19c65d655666cb67d2db43ba493bf905801bad1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/2a4e8e76dcb499a900a9c23c68ffcec744213124","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/2a4e8e76dcb499a900a9c23c68ffcec744213124","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDJhNGU4ZTc2ZGNiNDk5YTkwMGE5YzIzYzY4ZmZjZWM3NDQyMTMxMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/770e01715b8d7de2926d3ac68327fa45ab48ecf9","sha":"770e01715b8d7de2926d3ac68327fa45ab48ecf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/770e01715b8d7de2926d3ac68327fa45ab48ecf9"}],"sha":"2a4e8e76dcb499a900a9c23c68ffcec744213124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/2a4e8e76dcb499a900a9c23c68ffcec744213124"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/770e01715b8d7de2926d3ac68327fa45ab48ecf9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:04:31Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T13:04:31Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add driver''s license QR field, confirmation dialogs, and QR-specific consent\n\nQR code field: PH digital driver''s licenses carry a QR code encoding a\nportal.lto.gov.ph verification URL (confirmed against a real sample).\nThe server now decodes it (SHA-256 hash reuse check + local pixel\ndecode via jpeg-js/pngjs/jsqr, no external calls) and shows the raw\ndecoded link to admin -- deliberately not auto-fetching that URL\nserver-side, since that would mean scraping a live government site\nwith unknown terms of service, which isn''t being treated as\npre-cleared. New required upload field, gated behind a dedicated\nforced-read consent modal (5s minimum) separate from the blanket\nverification consent checkbox, since this is more sensitive/specific\ndata than the other documents.\n\nConfirmation dialogs: Approve (verification + vehicle), Accept/Confirm\nHandover/Confirm Return (bookings-received), and Pay\nDownpayment/Balance previously fired immediately on click with no\n\"are you sure\" -- the only actions in these flows without one, while\nevery reject/decline/cancel action already had one. Closes that gap\nusing the existing ConfirmDialog component.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e38b94c18d4b73254540e6c651effc2493837174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/e38b94c18d4b73254540e6c651effc2493837174"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/770e01715b8d7de2926d3ac68327fa45ab48ecf9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/770e01715b8d7de2926d3ac68327fa45ab48ecf9","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDc3MGUwMTcxNWI4ZDdkZTI5MjZkM2FjNjgzMjdmYTQ1YWI0OGVjZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/03e5d5bf5803c4c1d2a46861ff924ace4d763a63","sha":"03e5d5bf5803c4c1d2a46861ff924ace4d763a63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/03e5d5bf5803c4c1d2a46861ff924ace4d763a63"}],"sha":"770e01715b8d7de2926d3ac68327fa45ab48ecf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/770e01715b8d7de2926d3ac68327fa45ab48ecf9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/03e5d5bf5803c4c1d2a46861ff924ace4d763a63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T05:38:48Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T05:38:48Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add OCR-assisted document review + anti-forgery signals\n\nAdmin review of license/secondary-ID and ORCR documents has been fully\nmanual: an admin eyeballs a name on a document against a name on file,\nwith no automated assist and no defense against a reused or edited\ndocument image. Adds a new ocr-name-check Edge Function (Google Cloud\nVision TEXT_DETECTION), triggered async via pg_net the same way\nnotify_user() already calls send-email, that fuzzy-matches the\ndocument name against the verified profile name, cross-checks the\nORCR''s OCR''d plate/expiry against the listing, flags exact-duplicate\ndocument reuse (SHA-256), and flags suspicious file metadata (EXIF).\nAlso adds a soft frame-motion heuristic on live selfie capture to flag\na likely static-photo replay.\n\nEvery signal renders as an admin-facing badge only -- never an\nauto-approve/reject. This raises the cost of casual/lazy document\nfraud and cuts admin triage time; it does not catch a competent,\ninternally-consistent forgery, and isn''t meant to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d71ea12adb98318024a0b1b9f788908c7f1c775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/0d71ea12adb98318024a0b1b9f788908c7f1c775"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/03e5d5bf5803c4c1d2a46861ff924ace4d763a63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/03e5d5bf5803c4c1d2a46861ff924ace4d763a63","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDAzZTVkNWJmNTgwM2M0YzFkMmE0Njg2MWZmOTI0YWNlNGQ3NjNhNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/3f0d5052aec52b4ddcad29c8951bb58660d14fe7","sha":"3f0d5052aec52b4ddcad29c8951bb58660d14fe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/3f0d5052aec52b4ddcad29c8951bb58660d14fe7"}],"sha":"03e5d5bf5803c4c1d2a46861ff924ace4d763a63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/03e5d5bf5803c4c1d2a46861ff924ace4d763a63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/3f0d5052aec52b4ddcad29c8951bb58660d14fe7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T04:10:35Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T04:10:35Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Admin Users vehicles-owned subsection + ORCR expiry reminder cron\n\nAdmins reviewing a user''s identity documents can now see that user''s\nvehicle listings inline (status + expiry, deep-linking into Admin\nVehicles) instead of switching pages and re-searching by name.\n\nAlso adds a daily cron that proactively notifies owners before their\nOR/CR registration expires, reusing existing notify_user()/pg_cron/\nplatform_settings infrastructure rather than leaving it display-only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b804b0af4b80daa5336a2e632b61706353488f74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/b804b0af4b80daa5336a2e632b61706353488f74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/3f0d5052aec52b4ddcad29c8951bb58660d14fe7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/3f0d5052aec52b4ddcad29c8951bb58660d14fe7","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDNmMGQ1MDUyYWVjNTJiNGRkY2FkMjljODk1MWJiNTg2NjBkMTRmZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/38b3b65db7752e09988c3e832f4ef7d1efe28884","sha":"38b3b65db7752e09988c3e832f4ef7d1efe28884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/38b3b65db7752e09988c3e832f4ef7d1efe28884"}],"sha":"3f0d5052aec52b4ddcad29c8951bb58660d14fe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/3f0d5052aec52b4ddcad29c8951bb58660d14fe7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/38b3b65db7752e09988c3e832f4ef7d1efe28884/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:12:54Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:12:54Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add MFA backup recovery codes (\"what if the authenticator is down\")\n\nReal technical constraint worth recording: a custom recovery-code table\ncan''t act as a substitute TOTP challenge -- the aal2 claim on a session''s\nJWT is minted only by Supabase''s own GoTrue service on a real factor\nchallenge succeeding, and mfa_allow_low_aal is false on this project (self-\nunenroll requires already being aal2, so a locked-out user can''t remove\ntheir own lost factor either -- a chicken-and-egg problem). So a code\ndoesn''t complete the aal2 challenge directly: a valid code lets the new\nverify-recovery-code Edge Function (service_role/Admin API, not the user''s\nown under-privileged aal1 session) delete the lost factor entirely, landing\nthe user back on the same enrollment screen a brand-new staff account sees.\n\n10 single-use codes, generated only while already at aal2 (matches GitHub/\nGoogle''s pattern -- you prepare for losing access while you still have it),\nhashed with a per-user salt, wired into Profile''s Two-Factor section\n(generate/display once), MandatoryMfaGate (staff challenge screen), and\nlogin.tsx''s MFA step (regular users'' optional 2FA).\n\nReal bug caught by actually testing rather than assuming: pgcrypto lives in\nthe `extensions` schema on this project (Supabase''s default), not `public`\n-- gen_random_bytes()/digest() were invisible to a function scoped to\n`search_path = public`, so code generation failed outright on first real\ncall. Fixed by qualifying both calls explicitly. Verified fully end-to-end\nafter the fix: enrolled a real TOTP factor (computed a valid code from the\nraw secret to reach genuine aal2), generated codes, then simulated a lost\nauthenticator from a fresh aal1-only session -- confirmed the factor was\nactually deleted, a reused code correctly fails, and an invalid code\ncorrectly fails.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77526de1d7bcb8d58a20e357b574a5a7c48c33f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/77526de1d7bcb8d58a20e357b574a5a7c48c33f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/38b3b65db7752e09988c3e832f4ef7d1efe28884","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/38b3b65db7752e09988c3e832f4ef7d1efe28884","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDM4YjNiNjVkYjc3NTJlMDk5ODhjM2U4MzJmNGVmN2QxZWZlMjg4ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a3dbf0816d6a0491aac0476366f73316fc1e032f","sha":"a3dbf0816d6a0491aac0476366f73316fc1e032f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a3dbf0816d6a0491aac0476366f73316fc1e032f"}],"sha":"38b3b65db7752e09988c3e832f4ef7d1efe28884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/38b3b65db7752e09988c3e832f4ef7d1efe28884"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a3dbf0816d6a0491aac0476366f73316fc1e032f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:11:47Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:11:47Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add clickable contact info for booking counterparts (name + phone only)\n\nReal design decision, not just a UI addition: profiles_select_booking_counterpart\n(002) already let a renter/owner read each other''s full row (name/phone/\naddress/birthday) the moment ANY booking existed, no status gate -- and\nbookings-received.tsx was already using that unconditionally, showing a\nrenter''s address and birthday inline on a still-pending request that might\nget rejected. New get_booking_counterpart_contact() RPC is deliberately\nnarrower on both axes: only name+phone (address isn''t needed -- the\nvehicle''s pickup_location already covers the handoff; birthday was never\nrelevant here), and only once the owner has actually accepted\n(status past pending_owner/owner_rejected/expired).\n\nNew ContactInfoButton wraps Avatar with a click-to-reveal popover, wired\ninto both My Bookings and Bookings Received. bookings-received.tsx''s\nover-broad inline address/birthday display is removed in the same change,\nnot left alongside the new narrower path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"211c56e1fed2eddf0a4f4161372f1a45146509b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/211c56e1fed2eddf0a4f4161372f1a45146509b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/a3dbf0816d6a0491aac0476366f73316fc1e032f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a3dbf0816d6a0491aac0476366f73316fc1e032f","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGEzZGJmMDgxNmQ2YTA0OTFhYWMwNDc2MzY2ZjczMzE2ZmMxZTAzMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/19539c94bab6cabfbbcca87127858c294a85f879","sha":"19539c94bab6cabfbbcca87127858c294a85f879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/19539c94bab6cabfbbcca87127858c294a85f879"}],"sha":"a3dbf0816d6a0491aac0476366f73316fc1e032f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a3dbf0816d6a0491aac0476366f73316fc1e032f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/19539c94bab6cabfbbcca87127858c294a85f879/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:11:23Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:11:23Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix Admin Users: show verification submission for any status, not just pending\n\nopenUser() only fetched the verification_submissions row when\nverified_status === ''pending'' -- for anyone already verified or rejected,\nadmin had no way to see what was originally submitted (documents, ID\nnumbers, selfies) at all. Now fetched and shown regardless of status, with\nApprove/Reject actions still gated to pending only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0988fd3e023e66717dae18cb0a5e6c4df29b6400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/0988fd3e023e66717dae18cb0a5e6c4df29b6400"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/19539c94bab6cabfbbcca87127858c294a85f879","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/19539c94bab6cabfbbcca87127858c294a85f879","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDE5NTM5Yzk0YmFiNmNhYmZiYmNjYTg3MTI3ODU4YzI5NGE4NWY4Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/aa1757e10d5e2a657d3bc346e5a1ade7eb9bc510","sha":"aa1757e10d5e2a657d3bc346e5a1ade7eb9bc510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/aa1757e10d5e2a657d3bc346e5a1ade7eb9bc510"}],"sha":"19539c94bab6cabfbbcca87127858c294a85f879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/19539c94bab6cabfbbcca87127858c294a85f879"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/aa1757e10d5e2a657d3bc346e5a1ade7eb9bc510/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:09:00Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:09:00Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add ORCR/registration expiry tracking + fix Admin Vehicles click-through\n\nReal gap found: orcr_path stored the document but nothing tracked when the\nunderlying LTO registration actually expires. In the Philippines,\nprivate-vehicle registration renews annually -- that real deadline now\ndrives a renewal countdown, captured as a required date field alongside\nthe ORCR upload on Add/Edit Vehicle, surfaced as a warn/bad badge (60-day\nand expired thresholds) on both Admin Vehicle Approval and My Vehicles.\nChanging it post-approval forces re-review, same as plate_number/orcr_path/\nmodel_id -- otherwise an owner could quietly push the date forward without\nadmin ever re-checking the actual document.\n\nAlso fixed a real gap in Admin Vehicles: the \"view details/photos/ORCR\"\nbutton only rendered for approval_status=''pending'' -- approved and\nrejected vehicles were listed but completely unclickable. Every row is\nviewable now, and the detail panel shows the actual photo gallery (never\nfetched before) alongside the ORCR link.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fbf74d40d37e720558725d61eda58b7a0bbccb79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/fbf74d40d37e720558725d61eda58b7a0bbccb79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/aa1757e10d5e2a657d3bc346e5a1ade7eb9bc510","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/aa1757e10d5e2a657d3bc346e5a1ade7eb9bc510","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGFhMTc1N2UxMGQ1ZTJhNjU3ZDNiYzM0NmU1YTFhZGU3ZWI5YmM1MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/3450754f6c87f584cfccb0266787f5e370c9ff49","sha":"3450754f6c87f584cfccb0266787f5e370c9ff49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/3450754f6c87f584cfccb0266787f5e370c9ff49"}],"sha":"aa1757e10d5e2a657d3bc346e5a1ade7eb9bc510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/aa1757e10d5e2a657d3bc346e5a1ade7eb9bc510"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/3450754f6c87f584cfccb0266787f5e370c9ff49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T12:24:52Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T12:24:52Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Log record_login_event failures to console (still non-blocking)\n\nInvestigating a real report: a genuine login (confirmed via\nauth.users.last_sign_in_at) through the live site didn''t produce a\nlogin_events row. Verified server-side that the deployed bundle contains\nthe fix and that record_login_event() itself works correctly when called\ndirectly (twice, including the current post-053 definition) — so the gap\nis specific to something in that browser session, not a server-side bug.\nThe call was entirely fire-and-forget with the failure silently discarded,\nso there was zero trace to diagnose from. Still fire-and-forget (a logging\nhiccup must never block a real login), but now warns to console on failure\nso a repeat is actually debuggable instead of vanishing without a trace.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd3679ae48d740369aa789358ff3105972f283f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/bd3679ae48d740369aa789358ff3105972f283f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/3450754f6c87f584cfccb0266787f5e370c9ff49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/3450754f6c87f584cfccb0266787f5e370c9ff49","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDM0NTA3NTRmNmM4N2Y1ODRjZmNjYjAyNjY3ODdmNWUzNzBjOWZmNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/8da7609eabc929d485894fcadbf3812092d6289b","sha":"8da7609eabc929d485894fcadbf3812092d6289b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/8da7609eabc929d485894fcadbf3812092d6289b"}],"sha":"3450754f6c87f584cfccb0266787f5e370c9ff49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/3450754f6c87f584cfccb0266787f5e370c9ff49"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/8da7609eabc929d485894fcadbf3812092d6289b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T11:53:59Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T11:53:59Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix staff account provisioning: never promote an existing customer account\n\nReal gap: nothing stopped a super_admin from picking an arbitrary existing\nrenter/customer account out of Role Management and escalating it directly\nto staff. In real enterprise systems staff identities are always\nprovisioned separately from customer accounts -- a new hire gets a\ndedicated identity from day one, so a compromised customer account (weak\nreused password, phishing) can never become a path into internal tools.\n\nTwo-part fix, both server-side (not just hiding UI buttons):\n- promote_user_role() now rejects ''support'' grants where the target''s\n  current role is ''user'' -- pulled the exact live function body via\n  pg_get_functiondef before touching it, then added one guard clause. The\n  \"Demote (immediate, no approval needed)\" button was actually usable as a\n  single-actor, no-approval PROMOTION from user straight to support, a more\n  dangerous version of the same gap than the \"Request escalation\" path.\n- New create-staff-account Edge Function: super_admin provides an email,\n  it verifies the caller is a live super_admin (is_super_admin() --\n  role + aal2, same check every other super-admin RPC uses) then invites a\n  BRAND NEW account by email (Supabase''s invite flow, so the new hire sets\n  their own password -- no temp password ever exists to leak), starting at\n  ''support'' via the new set_new_staff_role() RPC (service_role-only,\n  matching the PayMongo webhook grant posture).\n\nRole Management''s \"Request escalation\" section now only shows for accounts\nalready at ''support'' (promoting an existing staff member up is normal\ninternal progression, still dual-approval-gated as before) -- never for\nrole=''user''. Verified live: unauthenticated calls to the new function\ncorrectly 401, and an authenticated admin (not super_admin) correctly 403s\nfrom the is_super_admin() check. Could not test the full success path\nend-to-end -- it requires a real super_admin session with a completed MFA\nchallenge, which needs an authenticator app this session has no access to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f157ab14eeb9382c42b1c08a1994ed455d5e6ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/f157ab14eeb9382c42b1c08a1994ed455d5e6ea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/8da7609eabc929d485894fcadbf3812092d6289b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/8da7609eabc929d485894fcadbf3812092d6289b","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDhkYTc2MDllYWJjOTI5ZDQ4NTg5NGZjYWRiZjM4MTIwOTJkNjI4OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/d7cd175d0f4aafa9438f1405754fab68e2c817c1","sha":"d7cd175d0f4aafa9438f1405754fab68e2c817c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/d7cd175d0f4aafa9438f1405754fab68e2c817c1"}],"sha":"8da7609eabc929d485894fcadbf3812092d6289b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/8da7609eabc929d485894fcadbf3812092d6289b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/d7cd175d0f4aafa9438f1405754fab68e2c817c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T11:52:24Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T11:52:24Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add app-layer login-attempt throttling\n\nStandards reviewed: NIST SP 800-63B and OWASP ASVS both deliberately avoid\na fixed attempt count, preferring throttling/increasing delay over hard\nlockout (a fixed lockout lets an attacker lock a victim out on purpose by\nrepeatedly failing their login). PCI-DSS v4.0 Req 8.3.4 is the one standard\nwith a concrete number (10 attempts, 30min minimum cooldown) -- landed on a\nblend matching Microsoft Entra ID''s \"Smart Lockout\": 10 failed attempts in\na rolling 24h window, then a cooldown that doubles each time the threshold\nis crossed again (15min -> 30min -> ..., capped at 4h), tracked per-email\nin a new login_failures table. A successful login clears that email''s\nfailure history so mistyped-password sessions don''t accumulate toward\nlockout across unrelated future visits.\n\nReal limitation, same category as the Security Log fix: this only protects\nSafeDrive''s own login form, not the Supabase auth API directly -- a true\nserver-side guarantee needs the same Auth Hook that hit the 402 paid-tier\nwall earlier. Verified live: 10 recorded failures correctly returns\nblocked=true with a ~15min retry_after.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e839c42069482513d6fc880c099774223ff7d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/9e839c42069482513d6fc880c099774223ff7d46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/d7cd175d0f4aafa9438f1405754fab68e2c817c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/d7cd175d0f4aafa9438f1405754fab68e2c817c1","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGQ3Y2QxNzVkMGY0YWFmYTk0MzhmMTQwNTc1NGZhYjY4ZTJjODE3YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/f44a167866ee31f23383d1bcc79f5f26f4d5f4b8","sha":"f44a167866ee31f23383d1bcc79f5f26f4d5f4b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/f44a167866ee31f23383d1bcc79f5f26f4d5f4b8"}],"sha":"d7cd175d0f4aafa9438f1405754fab68e2c817c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/d7cd175d0f4aafa9438f1405754fab68e2c817c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/f44a167866ee31f23383d1bcc79f5f26f4d5f4b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T11:12:00Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T11:12:00Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix verification submissions never surfacing for admin review\n\nverify.tsx made two separate client calls: insert into\nverification_submissions (succeeded), then a plain profiles UPDATE setting\nverified_status=''pending'' -- silently reverted by protect_profile_fields(),\nthe same bug class already fixed once for strike_count (021). Admin Users\nand the Dashboard''s pending count both key off verified_status, so a real,\nfully-submitted verification (ID documents, selfies, everything) could sit\ninvisible forever. Confirmed live: kelchua360@gmail.com had a real\nsubmission from 2026-07-22 that never once appeared for review.\n\nFixed with a single submit_verification() RPC doing the insert + status\nflip atomically (same set_config(''app.bypass_profile_protection'', ...)\nmechanism already used by add_strike()/approve_verification()), plus a\none-time data repair bringing the existing stuck submission back to\n''pending'' so it''s actually reviewable now.\n\nAlso fixed Admin Users'' account-management side panel showing no\nidentifying info at all when a user''s name fields are empty (normal for\nanyone not yet verified, since identity fields are only set on approval) --\nnow always shows the email, with a clear \"Name not yet on file\" fallback\ninstead of a blank header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c5dfc02e79fec07f8ad42f09a5f4f1f73bd16d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/4c5dfc02e79fec07f8ad42f09a5f4f1f73bd16d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/f44a167866ee31f23383d1bcc79f5f26f4d5f4b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/f44a167866ee31f23383d1bcc79f5f26f4d5f4b8","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGY0NGExNjc4NjZlZTMxZjIzMzgzZDFiY2M3OWY1ZjI2ZjRkNWY0Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/c64d58b6c4929daa8322613155e57e3ff75d46de","sha":"c64d58b6c4929daa8322613155e57e3ff75d46de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/c64d58b6c4929daa8322613155e57e3ff75d46de"}],"sha":"f44a167866ee31f23383d1bcc79f5f26f4d5f4b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/f44a167866ee31f23383d1bcc79f5f26f4d5f4b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/c64d58b6c4929daa8322613155e57e3ff75d46de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T09:06:34Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T09:06:34Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix Security Log: dead data source replaced with real login tracking\n\nget_auth_activity_log() read from auth.audit_log_entries, Supabase''s legacy\nPostgres-table auth audit log. Confirmed live: this project''s Auth config\nhas audit_log_disable_postgres = true and it is NOT settable back via the\nManagement API (a PATCH returns 200 but silently leaves it unchanged) --\nthe table had zero rows despite confirmed real logins\n(auth.users.last_sign_in_at proves it), so Security Log showed nothing for\nanyone, admin or renter, since it was built.\n\nFirst attempt (050): a new login_events table populated via Supabase''s\n\"Password Verification Attempt\" Auth Hook, which fires on every sign-in\nattempt server-side. Reverted after enabling it returned 402 -- custom Auth\nHooks require a paid Supabase organization tier, unavailable on this\nproject. Verified no partial/broken state resulted (hook stayed disabled).\n\nWorking fix (051): the app itself calls a record_login_event() RPC right\nafter a successful sign-in (both the plain and MFA-step-up paths in\nlogin.tsx). Honest limitation, called out directly in the Security Log\npage''s own description: this only captures successful logins made through\nSafeDrive''s login form, not failed attempts or logins via another client --\na real downside vs. a server-side hook, but real, accurate data instead of\nan empty table. Verified end-to-end with an actual password-grant login\nbefore considering this done.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42365d21cffe5304015d794123c6a20068d96250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/42365d21cffe5304015d794123c6a20068d96250"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/c64d58b6c4929daa8322613155e57e3ff75d46de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/c64d58b6c4929daa8322613155e57e3ff75d46de","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGM2NGQ1OGI2YzQ5MjlkYWE4MzIyNjEzMTU1ZTU3ZTNmZjc1ZDQ2ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9f05e1d727a0ce77f25facaeb964787f8f62e645","sha":"9f05e1d727a0ce77f25facaeb964787f8f62e645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9f05e1d727a0ce77f25facaeb964787f8f62e645"}],"sha":"c64d58b6c4929daa8322613155e57e3ff75d46de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/c64d58b6c4929daa8322613155e57e3ff75d46de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9f05e1d727a0ce77f25facaeb964787f8f62e645/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T09:05:54Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T09:05:54Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Broaden Super Admin to a strict superset of Admin''s operational access\n\nReconsidered per user request ahead of a capstone defense question: 044\nmodeled Super Admin narrowly (identity/access only, zero operational\npower), a real but less-common enterprise IAM pattern (Azure AD''s\nPrivileged Role Administrator). The more commonly referenced pattern (Okta,\nGoogle Workspace, GitHub Owner, Stripe Account Owner) gives the top role\neverything a regular admin has, plus more -- a narrower Super Admin is\nbackwards from that expectation. is_admin()/is_support_or_admin() now also\naccept ''super_admin'', which automatically extends access everywhere both\nfunctions already gate (nearly every admin/support RLS policy and RPC in\nthe codebase), so Super Admin now sees Dashboard, Analytics, Users, Vehicle\nApproval, Disputes, Inquiries, Catalog, Payments, Settings, and Company\nInfo, on top of the identity-only pages it already had.\n\nDeliberately unchanged: granting admin/super_admin still requires a\ndifferent super admin''s approval (044''s dual-approval flow checks\np_new_role explicitly, not is_admin()/is_support_or_admin()) -- broadening\n\"what Super Admin can see\" doesn''t touch \"who can create a new Super\nAdmin.\"\n\nAlso fixes a real pre-existing bug caught while auditing every role === ''admin''\ncheck for the same gap: TwoFactorSection''s isStaff flag excluded\nsuper_admin, so a super_admin would have seen a \"Disable 2FA\" button even\nthough MFA is mandatory and non-optional for their role too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce2633c8b10b5f44a1e0ce2be3c9ef4a269e5706","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/ce2633c8b10b5f44a1e0ce2be3c9ef4a269e5706"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/9f05e1d727a0ce77f25facaeb964787f8f62e645","v