:"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/ce082a9299e34de1d639d0edf432c057439038b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T09:05:11Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T09:05:11Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix RLS gap: super_admin couldn''t see any other user in Role Management\n\nprofiles_select_admin only granted read access via is_support_or_admin(),\nwhich checks role in (''support'', ''admin'') -- super_admin was never\nincluded. 044 built the entire Role Management page around a plain \"select\n* from profiles\", so a super_admin''s query was silently filtered by RLS\ndown to just their own row. Confirmed live before the fix: querying as\nenzomc360@gmail.com returned exactly one row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d1cd149bfe19bbdd5c4a464190e7d3f409b9073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/8d1cd149bfe19bbdd5c4a464190e7d3f409b9073"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/ce082a9299e34de1d639d0edf432c057439038b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/ce082a9299e34de1d639d0edf432c057439038b7","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGNlMDgyYTkyOTllMzRkZTFkNjM5ZDBlZGY0MzJjMDU3NDM5MDM4Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/7e174da3a595c0bf921a5bb7a20b7b56723b9026","sha":"7e174da3a595c0bf921a5bb7a20b7b56723b9026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/7e174da3a595c0bf921a5bb7a20b7b56723b9026"}],"sha":"ce082a9299e34de1d639d0edf432c057439038b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/ce082a9299e34de1d639d0edf432c057439038b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/7e174da3a595c0bf921a5bb7a20b7b56723b9026/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:23:14Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:23:14Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Block staff accounts from the renter/lister marketplace\n\nEvery login (and the app''s index route) hardcoded a redirect to /browse\nregardless of role, and /browse, /cars/:id, /bookings, /my-vehicles*,\n/bookings-received, and /verify had zero role restriction — an admin/\nsupport/super_admin account could fully book, list, and rent, which the\nRBAC design never intended (staff shouldn''t use their own login as a\nrenter, same reason a bank teller doesn''t open a personal account with\ntheir teller credentials). Added RequireRenter to block staff from those\nroutes, and a role-aware LandingRedirect (super_admin -> Role Management,\nadmin/support -> Dashboard, else -> Browse) replacing every hardcoded\n/browse redirect.\n\nAlso fixed AuthProvider not awaiting the profile fetch before clearing its\nloading flag, which let the shell briefly render with profile === null on\nevery load — read as \"not staff\", so admin/support/super_admin accounts saw\na flash of the full renter header (Switch to Lister, etc.) before it\nself-corrected once the real role loaded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a3a57d1b4154bdb3dd7bbe8c44dd95765651c8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/0a3a57d1b4154bdb3dd7bbe8c44dd95765651c8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/7e174da3a595c0bf921a5bb7a20b7b56723b9026","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/7e174da3a595c0bf921a5bb7a20b7b56723b9026","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDdlMTc0ZGEzYTU5NWMwYmY5MjFhNWJiN2EyMGI3YjU2NzIzYjkwMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/526586a67e8da0e4035ad945da6fd2de82fd790c","sha":"526586a67e8da0e4035ad945da6fd2de82fd790c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/526586a67e8da0e4035ad945da6fd2de82fd790c"}],"sha":"7e174da3a595c0bf921a5bb7a20b7b56723b9026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/7e174da3a595c0bf921a5bb7a20b7b56723b9026"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/526586a67e8da0e4035ad945da6fd2de82fd790c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:22:59Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:22:59Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add internal admin notes and search/filter to Admin Users and Vehicles\n\nNew admin-only admin_notes column on profiles/vehicles (protected by the\nsame protect_*_fields() trigger mechanism already locking down role/\napproval_status, since both tables allow the owner to PATCH their own row\ndirectly). Reviewers can now leave a note for the next admin instead of\nonly the user-facing rejection reason. Also adds a search box plus\nverification/account/approval status filters to both admin tables, which\npreviously had no way to narrow a growing list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52f699f3ff59c84bf9cc33f40f2456fe3d5cf262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/52f699f3ff59c84bf9cc33f40f2456fe3d5cf262"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/526586a67e8da0e4035ad945da6fd2de82fd790c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/526586a67e8da0e4035ad945da6fd2de82fd790c","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDUyNjU4NmE2N2U4ZGEwZTQwMzVhZDk0NWRhNmZkMmRlODJmZDc5MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/e08bee0134a1f4a640b23a3bcafd7c1e781a608f","sha":"e08bee0134a1f4a640b23a3bcafd7c1e781a608f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/e08bee0134a1f4a640b23a3bcafd7c1e781a608f"}],"sha":"526586a67e8da0e4035ad945da6fd2de82fd790c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/526586a67e8da0e4035ad945da6fd2de82fd790c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/e08bee0134a1f4a640b23a3bcafd7c1e781a608f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:22:28Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:22:28Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix Browse date filter: labels, past/inverted dates, and unblock search\n\nThe two date inputs had no labels (couldn''t tell start from end) and no min\nconstraints, so an end date before the start date or in the past was\naccepted. Added labels, min={today} on start, min={start+1} on end (auto-\nclears end if it''s no longer valid), and removed the \"Check availability\"\ndisabled-until-both-dates gate so body type/brand/model/city search works\nwithout picking dates at all.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2a209fb8cee18bb86534e1f1cc811236a5d5086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/b2a209fb8cee18bb86534e1f1cc811236a5d5086"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/e08bee0134a1f4a640b23a3bcafd7c1e781a608f","veri