ttps://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/b024eef36a4f3f5fedf3e25a912694cf46fb0a06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:22:13Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:22:13Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Surface payment/payout and dispute status on booking pages; fix dispute gaps\n\nBookings Received and My Bookings now show real payment/payout status and\nopen disputes instead of leaving owners/renters with no visibility into\neither. Also fixes resolve_dispute() never notifying either party (dead\nduplicate overload from 037 meant the real 4-arg function was still\nunpatched), and reject_booking()''s notification never including the reason\nthe owner already has to give. Bonus: rejected vehicle listings now show\ntheir rejection reason inline instead of just a status pill.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0ac82f3d21a85944849543a76287ce39ec33b8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/a0ac82f3d21a85944849543a76287ce39ec33b8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/b024eef36a4f3f5fedf3e25a912694cf46fb0a06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifi