","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/d5ad13c7e39d8c91781e0207cbbdfdd2fdfc8803/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:21:14Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:21:14Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add 3-tier RBAC (Super Admin / Admin / Support) with dual-approval role changes\n\nSuper Admin is a new, narrower identity-and-access role (account/role\nmanagement only, none of Admin''s operational power), modeled on the GitHub\nOwner / AWS root-vs-IAM pattern. Granting admin/super_admin now requires a\nsecond, different super admin''s approval. Includes the Role Management admin\npage, role badges on Profile, and updated nav/route guards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d626c88d1290b584fa6d3757a5a3c99a40a5f47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/7d626c88d1290b584fa6d3757a5a3c99a40a5f47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/d5ad13c7e39d8c91781e0207cbbdfdd2fdfc8803","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/d5ad13c7e39d8c91781e0207cbbdfdd2fdfc8803","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGQ1YWQxM2M3ZTM5ZDhjOTE3ODFlMDIwN2NiYmRmZGQyZmRmYzg4MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/ec9206115e327fc4e2a20c217023def03ba2c43e","sha":"ec9206115e327fc4e2a20c217023def03ba2c43e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/ec9206115e327fc4e2a20c217023def03ba2c43e"}],"sha":"d5ad13c7e39d8c91781e0207cbbdfdd2fdfc8803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/d5ad13c7e39d8c91781e0207cbbdfdd2fdfc8803"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/ec9206115e327fc4e2a20c217023def03ba2c43e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:41:44Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:41:44Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add structured city field and multi-select Browse filters with date carry-through\n\nExecutes the plan worked out over several rounds of discussion:\n\n- vehicles.city: a fixed CHECK-constraint enum (Metro Manila''s 17 cities/\n  municipality + a handful of adjacent cities + an ''other'' catch-all), not\n  an admin-managed catalog table like car_brands/car_models -- unlike car\n  models, PH cities don''t need routine curation and carry no per-row\n  derived metadata, so the simpler body_type/fuel_type-style pattern is the\n  right fit, not the heavier one. Existing vehicles default to ''other''\n  (honest about not being able to infer their real city from old free-text\n  pickup_location) with a note for owners to correct via Edit Vehicle.\n- New MultiSelectDropdown component (checkbox panel, same open/close shape\n  as NotificationBell) -- nothing like it existed; every filter before this\n  was a native single-select <select>.\n- Browse now filters by body type, brand, model, and city simultaneously,\n  each multi-select and AND-combined with the others and the free-text\n  search (narrowed to brand/model only now that city has a real filter).\n  Model options narrow to whatever brands are checked.\n- Selected availability dates now carry from Browse into Car Detail via URL\n  query params, prefilling that calendar instead of always starting blank\n  -- closes the real redundancy where a renter picked dates twice in two\n  disconnected pickers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c344027995ce1702d852fa03515c898922f4034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/5c344027995ce1702d852fa03515c898922f4034"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/ec9206115e327fc4e2a20c217023def03ba2c43e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/ec9206115e327fc4e2a20c217023def03ba2c43e","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGVjOTIwNjExNWUzMjdmYzRlMmEyMGMyMTcwMjNkZWYwM2JhMmM0M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/18f9739c49c7ac30ebde43e1eced52016f1d5460","sha":"18f9739c49c7ac30ebde43e1eced52016f1d5460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/18f9739c49c7ac30ebde43e1eced52016f1d5460"}],"sha":"ec9206115e327fc4e2a20c217023def03ba2c43e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/ec9206115e327fc4e2a20c217023def03ba2c43e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/18f9739c49c7ac30ebde43e1eced52016f1d5460/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:25:35Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:25:35Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Close audit-trail gap and add a security/login log\n\nFound by walking through the audit trail with the user: car catalog CRUD\n(add/edit/delete a brand or model) and every platform_settings change went\nthrough direct table writes with zero log_audit() call -- confirmed by\nreading admin/catalog.tsx and admin/settings.tsx. RLS already restricted\nthese to is_admin(), so it was never a security hole, just an accountability\none: every business-rule number in the system (commission %, cancellation\nfee %, etc.) could change with no record of who or from what value.\n\nFixed via triggers rather than converting call sites into new RPCs -- this\ncan''t be bypassed by a raw SQL write either, matching the same philosophy\nalready used for bookings/payments, and needed zero frontend changes.\n\nSeparately: distinguished audit trail (business actions) from a genuine gap\nin security/access logging (logins, IPs) -- nothing in this codebase tracked\neither. Rather than build a parallel capture system, the new Security Log\nadmin page reads Supabase Auth''s own auth.audit_log_entries table, which\nalready records every login/logout/password-recovery event with IP address\n-- just never surfaced inside SafeDrive''s own admin panel before. Same\ncross-schema-read-via-SECURITY-DEFINER pattern already proven working for\nget_cron_health() reading cron.job_run_details.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a29475f23be9bfd61c2306d6945a113ebd00e731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/a29475f23be9bfd61c2306d6945a113ebd00e731"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/18f9739c49c7ac30ebde43e1eced52016f1d5460","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/18f9739c49c7ac30ebde43e1eced52016f1d5460","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDE4Zjk3MzljNDljN2FjMzBlYmRlNDNlMWVjZWQ1MjAxNmYxZDU0NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/54e55574fa1cd1adc739d32a44f2ca80bc729f1c","sha":"54e55574fa1cd1adc739d32a44f2ca80bc729f1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/54e55574fa1cd1adc739d32a44f2ca80bc729f1c"}],"sha":"18f9739c49c7ac30ebde43e1eced52016f1d5460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/18f9739c49c7ac30ebde43e1eced52016f1d5460"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/54e55574fa1cd1adc739d32a44f2ca80bc729f1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T08:36:48Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T08:36:48Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix Car Detail transparency gaps: photo gallery, deposit, transmission, policies\n\nAudited what a renter actually sees before booking against what the system\ncollects but never surfaces. Found and fixed:\n\n- Real bug: only the cover photo ever displayed, despite owners uploading up\n  to 4. fetchVehicle() computed cover_image_url from images[0] and silently\n  dropped the rest -- Car Detail now shows a full gallery with thumbnails.\n- Model year was a required field at listing time but never shown to renters.\n- No transmission field existed anywhere in the schema or forms -- added to\n  vehicles (not car_models: the same model name legitimately exists in both\n  manual and automatic trims across different owners'' units, so per-model\n  catalog data was the wrong place for it). Not added to the sensitive-field\n  reapproval list like plate/model/year, since no eligibility check reads it.\n- Security deposit (up to 30% of total price, owner-configurable) was\n  collected at listing time but invisible to renters anywhere before booking\n  -- now shown both on the specs card and in the price breakdown.\n- New \"Booking policies\" card summarizing minimum age, the free-cancellation\n  window and its pickup-proximity cutoff, and the no-show grace period --\n  previously these only surfaced reactively (mid-cancel-flow, or as a raw\n  RPC rejection) rather than disclosed before the renter commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"668fcfe1b1ccb65fc00e8a4c0ae58dd6a253bbe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/668fcfe1b1ccb65fc00e8a4c0ae58dd6a253bbe2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/54e55574fa1cd1adc739d32a44f2ca80bc729f1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/54e55574fa1cd1adc739d32a44f2ca80bc729f1c","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDU0ZTU1NTc0ZmExY2QxYWRjNzM5ZDMyYTQ0ZjJjYTgwYmM3MjlmMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/ded6ca13f835a8c12315d3023ce450af89da3db2","sha":"ded6ca13f835a8c12315d3023ce450af89da3db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/ded6ca13f835a8c12315d3023ce450af89da3db2"}],"sha":"54e55574fa1cd1adc739d32a44f2ca80bc729f1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/54e55574fa1cd1adc739d32a44f2ca80bc729f1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/ded6ca13f835a8c12315d3023ce450af89da3db2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T08:12:07Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T08:12:07Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add peak pickup-time heatmap to admin and owner analytics\n\nPreviously \"popular car\" existed (top-5 models bar chart) but nothing showed\nWHEN rentals peak — this genuinely wasn''t answerable from the existing\ndashboards. Now possible because pickup_time exists on bookings from the\nearlier booking-flow work.\n\nNew day-of-week x hour-of-day heatmap, one per dashboard (admin: platform-\nwide over 12 weeks; owner: scoped to their own vehicles). Built per the\ndataviz skill''s method: magnitude encoded as a single-hue opacity ramp on\nthe existing --color-accent token rather than a fixed hex ramp, so it\nre-derives correctly in dark mode instead of going stale like the older\nFunnelChart''s hardcoded ramp. Legend + per-cell hover tooltip, no color-only\nencoding.\n\nConsidered and deliberately not built: an LLM-generated narrative layer on\ntop of the existing rule-based suggestions (replacing the hardcoded if/else\nstrings with Claude-written insights over the same verified SQL numbers).\nReal architecture, real cost estimate (~$0.002/call on Haiku, a few dollars/\nmonth) — user chose to skip the recurring cost for a capstone demo and keep\nthe free rule-based suggestions as-is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7de90428843954053fa9b2456c4d9a2901be5041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/7de90428843954053fa9b2456c4d9a2901be5041"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/ded6ca13f835a8c12315d3023ce450af89da3db2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/ded6ca13f835a8c12315d3023ce450af89da3db2","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGRlZDZjYTEzZjgzNWE4YzEyMzE1ZDMwMjNjZTQ1MGFmODlkYTNkYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a65281ff07cb09a0bc0e937f3f2cc400d41dc84c","sha":"a65281ff07cb09a0bc0e937f3f2cc400d41dc84c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a65281ff07cb09a0bc0e937f3f2cc400d41dc84c"}],"sha":"ded6ca13f835a8c12315d3023ce450af89da3db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/ded6ca13f835a8c12315d3023ce450af89da3db2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a65281ff07cb09a0bc0e937f3f2cc400d41dc84c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:52:23Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:52:23Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Dependabot config for automated dependency vulnerability alerts\n\nCloses the cheap gap flagged in docs/ISO27001_GAP_ANALYSIS.md (A.8.8\nVulnerability management) — previously dependency health only got checked\nwhenever npm audit happened to be run manually. Groups routine minor/patch\nbumps into one weekly PR so it doesn''t spam ~20 individual PRs; majors stay\nseparate since those are the ones actually worth reviewing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31c649d4b150da61f345a763ec74a409a1136556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/31c649d4b150da61f345a763ec74a409a1136556"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/a65281ff07cb09a0bc0e937f3f2cc400d41dc84c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a65281ff07cb09a0bc0e937f3f2cc400d41dc84c","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGE2NTI4MWZmMDdjYjA5YTBiYzBlOTM3ZjNmMmNjNDAwZDQxZGM4NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/99d9ac8fd978e97b20e8268d47b546fef3757690","sha":"99d9ac8fd978e97b20e8268d47b546fef3757690","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/99d9ac8fd978e97b20e8268d47b546fef3757690"}],"sha":"a65281ff07cb09a0bc0e937f3f2cc400d41dc84c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a65281ff07cb09a0bc0e937f3f2cc400d41dc84c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/99d9ac8fd978e97b20e8268d47b546fef3757690/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:49:33Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:49:33Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Refresh visual design: brighter palette, real icons, empty states\n\nAddresses direct feedback that the UI felt \"plain and gloomy.\" Root causes:\ndark mode''s surface layers (paper/surface/surface-2) sat almost\nindistinguishably dark, reading as murky rather than a deliberate premium\ndark theme; the accent teal was muted in both themes; and every icon in the\napp was a raw emoji despite lucide-react being installed and never used.\n\n- Rebuilt color tokens in index.css: real contrast steps between dark-mode\n  surfaces, more vivid accent/status colors in both themes, the ambient\n  background gradient roughly doubled in opacity (was nearly invisible).\n- New --glow-tint token gives primary buttons and cards a colored glow\n  instead of a flat black shadow, most noticeable in dark mode.\n- Replaced emoji with real lucide-react icons in the app''s most-seen chrome:\n  topbar, sidebar toggle, profile dropdown, notification bell, theme toggle.\n- New shared EmptyState component (icon + title + description + CTA) applied\n  to Browse and My Vehicles, replacing plain grey sentences in empty\n  whitespace — the flattest spots in the app.\n- My Bookings / Bookings Received now split into Active/History tabs.\n\nNot visually verified — no browser tool available this session. Built,\nlinted, and tested clean; needs an actual look in a running browser.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de542a2897167ee8bb0e92cac9b1026c33c0e2e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/de542a2897167ee8bb0e92cac9b1026c33c0e2e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/99d9ac8fd978e97b20e8268d47b546fef3757690","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/99d9ac8fd978e97b20e8268d47b546fef3757690","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDk5ZDlhYzhmZDk3OGU5N2IyMGU4MjY4ZDQ3YjU0NmZlZjM3NTc2OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/d96ec7ddacff54559978174c45861ae7c6f46392","sha":"d96ec7ddacff54559978174c45861ae7c6f46392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/d96ec7ddacff54559978174c45861ae7c6f46392"}],"sha":"99d9ac8fd978e97b20e8268d47b546fef3757690","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/99d9ac8fd978e97b20e8268d47b546fef3757690"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/d96ec7ddacff54559978174c45861ae7c6f46392/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:48:50Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:48:50Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix live anon-execute gaps, add audited role promotion, and security headers\n\nTriggered by verifying grants after adding new booking RPCs: dropping and\nrecreating a Postgres function resets its privileges to Supabase''s default\n(anon gets EXECUTE automatically), which had silently affected far more than\nthe new functions. Full audit of all 57 public-schema functions against live\nhas_function_privilege() checks found two genuinely exploitable, pre-existing\ngaps: add_strike() had zero internal auth check (anyone could strike any\naccount directly) and confirm_subscription_payment() had no caller\nverification (anyone could grant themselves free slots). Both fixed, plus\n~10 more functions locked down that were unintentionally anon-reachable.\nis_aal2()/is_support_or_admin() were checked and deliberately left alone —\nrequired inside RLS policies both anon and authenticated actually need.\n\n- promote_user_role(): the only role change path used to be unlogged raw\n  SQL. Now audited via audit_trail, with a self-closing bootstrap exception\n  (self-promotion to admin only, only while zero admins exist) that also\n  fixes a real bug — protect_profile_fields() would otherwise revert a\n  bootstrap admin promotion even via the Supabase SQL editor, since the\n  trigger fires regardless of which role executes the UPDATE.\n- vercel.json: CSP, HSTS, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, and\n  Permissions-Policy headers, previously entirely absent.\n- docs/ISO27001_GAP_ANALYSIS.md: honest Annex A control mapping for capstone\n  documentation — explicitly not a certification claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e020012c77cc8382dea48c784c56cdc828bfa4ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/e020012c77cc8382dea48c784c56cdc828bfa4ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/d96ec7ddacff54559978174c45861ae7c6f46392","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/d96ec7ddacff54559978174c45861ae7c6f46392","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGQ5NmVjN2RkYWNmZjU0NTU5OTc4MTc0YzQ1ODYxYWU3YzZmNDYzOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/bbc54ca8769187a401ad64a0355d69822d4114c3","sha":"bbc54ca8769187a401ad64a0355d69822d4114c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/bbc54ca8769187a401ad64a0355d69822d4114c3"}],"sha":"d96ec7ddacff54559978174c45861ae7c6f46392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/d96ec7ddacff54559978174c45861ae7c6f46392"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/bbc54ca8769187a401ad64a0355d69822d4114c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:47:33Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:47:33Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add pickup-time booking flow, no-show handling, and owner-blocked calendar\n\nBooking now captures a pickup time (not just date), and the meetup flow is\nmodeled on how e-commerce delivery confirmation actually works: the owner\nis the sole confirmer at both handover and return (mark_complete is now\nsingle-tap, replacing the two-sided renter/owner completion gate that was\nthe real source of friction), with the other party''s recourse being the\nexisting Report/Dispute flow rather than a mandatory check-in.\n\n- New 3-color availability calendar (available/booked/owner-blocked) on Car\n  Detail, backed by a new vehicle_blocked_dates table and get_vehicle_calendar()\n  RPC — owner-blocked dates are genuinely new, not just a UI tweak.\n- Free cancellation now also respects proximity to pickup (mirrors Airbnb''s\n  \"48h grace period, but not if check-in is <14 days away\" rule) — previously\n  only checked time-since-payment.\n- cancel_no_show() repurposed from \"unpaid cash at meetup\" (no longer\n  applicable now the balance is always paid online) to \"renter never showed\n  up by pickup time + grace period\"; new report_owner_no_show() mirrors it\n  for the renter''s side, auto-refunding and opening a dispute for admin review.\n- Admin dispute resolution can now optionally strike whichever party was at\n  fault, verified before punishing rather than auto-striking on report.\n- Active/History tabs on My Bookings and Bookings Received, and a user''s own\n  rating now shown on their Profile — both gaps found during a UI audit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68e68d4a30e6b9abaf1e08806c586cbd30e08f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/68e68d4a30e6b9abaf1e08806c586cbd30e08f15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/bbc54ca8769187a401ad64a0355d69822d4114c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/bbc54ca8769187a401ad64a0355d69822d4114c3","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGJiYzU0Y2E4NzY5MTg3YTQwMWFkNjRhMDM1NWQ2OTgyMmQ0MTE0YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/5304b252bdb750e92d73d7d093af83d57773161c","sha":"5304b252bdb750e92d73d7d093af83d57773161c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5304b252bdb750e92d73d7d093af83d57773161c"}],"sha":"bbc54ca8769187a401ad64a0355d69822d4114c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/bbc54ca8769187a401ad64a0355d69822d4114c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5304b252bdb750e92d73d7d093af83d57773161c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:51:43Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:51:43Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Wire up real email notifications via Resend\n\nnotify_user(p_send_email=true) has been a no-op since day one (030 fixed\nit from hard-erroring to silently skipping, but nothing ever sent). Now\nit actually sends.\n\n- New send-email Edge Function: looks up the user''s email from `profiles`,\n  maps notification `type` to a subject line, sends via Resend''s API.\n  Never called from a browser (only by notify_user() through pg_net), so\n  no CORS handling needed, same as paymongo-webhook.\n- notify_user() switched from reading current_setting(''app.settings.xxx'')\n  (an older Supabase pattern) to Supabase Vault, since ALTER DATABASE/ROLE\n  SET for custom GUCs is blocked on the hosted platform -- verified live\n  (\"permission denied to set parameter\") before switching approaches.\n  The Edge Function URL isn''t sensitive so it''s hardcoded directly; the\n  service_role key (the actual secret, used so send-email''s own JWT check\n  accepts the internal call) is seeded into Vault outside of any committed\n  file (036_notify_user_via_vault.sql only contains the lookup query, never\n  the key itself).\n- Verified live end-to-end twice: once calling send-email directly with a\n  real service_role JWT (real email sent via Resend, confirmed 200 sent:true),\n  and once through notify_user() itself, checking pg_net''s actual recorded\n  HTTP response (200, {\"sent\":true}) rather than just assuming the\n  fire-and-forget call succeeded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f09d25023d6492a11a12e10f37e6325babef125e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/f09d25023d6492a11a12e10f37e6325babef125e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/5304b252bdb750e92d73d7d093af83d57773161c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/5304b252bdb750e92d73d7d093af83d57773161c","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDUzMDRiMjUyYmRiNzUwZTkyZDczZDdkMDkzYWY4M2Q1Nzc3MzE2MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9ad8c635193430d895fdcfba8612992b9e2d7cfb","sha":"9ad8c635193430d895fdcfba8612992b9e2d7cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9ad8c635193430d895fdcfba8612992b9e2d7cfb"}],"sha":"5304b252bdb750e92d73d7d093af83d57773161c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5304b252bdb750e92d73d7d093af83d57773161c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9ad8c635193430d895fdcfba8612992b9e2d7cfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:02:54Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:02:54Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix systemic broken notification links (/my-bookings never existed as a route)\n\nWhole-system re-audit per user request, cross-checking every notify_user()\nlink literal, every frontend RPC call, every storage bucket name, and every\nLink/navigate target against what actually exists.\n\nFound: 6 live functions (accept_booking, reject_booking, cancel_booking,\ncancel_no_show, confirm_handover, mark_complete) sent renter notifications\nlinking to ''/my-bookings'', which has never been a real route -- the actual\nroute is ''/bookings''. Clicking almost any renter-facing notification\n(booking accepted/rejected/cancelled, rental started, completed) silently\nbounced them to Browse via the catch-all route instead of showing their\nbooking. This is the exact \"button''s there but nothing really happens\"\nclass of bug, just one level removed (notification, not a button).\n\nFixed by pulling the exact live function definitions via\npg_get_functiondef and correcting only the link string -- no other logic\ntouched, avoiding the risk of reconstructing 6 nontrivial functions from\nmemory. Verified live: re-scanned every function in the schema afterward,\nzero remaining ''/my-bookings'' references, and confirmed the only 4\ndistinct notification link paths left in the whole database\n(/bookings, /my-vehicles, /verify, /bookings-received) are all real routes.\n\nAlso verified clean in this pass: all 24 RPC names called from the\nfrontend exist live, all 3 Edge Function invocations are covered by the\nCORS fix, all 5 storage bucket names match real buckets, and no\nLink/navigate target points to a nonexistent route. report-issue-dialog.tsx\nbrought in line with the rest of the app (friendlyErrorMessage, glass\nmodal styling) while in there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"006febde5bd02599a8224aa7d40f54bb5dac3c54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/006febde5bd02599a8224aa7d40f54bb5dac3c54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/9ad8c635193430d895fdcfba8612992b9e2d7cfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9ad8c635193430d895fdcfba8612992b9e2d7cfb","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDlhZDhjNjM1MTkzNDMwZDg5NWZkY2ZiYTg2MTI5OTJiOWUyZDdjZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/276c30ce8869e1e8be82d4b1850852239515c94d","sha":"276c30ce8869e1e8be82d4b1850852239515c94d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/276c30ce8869e1e8be82d4b1850852239515c94d"}],"sha":"9ad8c635193430d895fdcfba8612992b9e2d7cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9ad8c635193430d895fdcfba8612992b9e2d7cfb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/276c30ce8869e1e8be82d4b1850852239515c94d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T10:46:49Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T10:46:49Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix critical CORS bug breaking Subscribe/Pay Downpayment/Pay Balance, gate subscribe on verification, audit every mutation for silent failures\n\nRoot cause of \"clicking Subscribe did nothing\": create-checkout had zero\nCORS handling. Any browser call to it fails the preflight check and is\nsilently blocked by the browser before the actual request even goes out\n-- with no error surfacing anywhere except the browser console. This\naffected all three buttons that call it: Subscribe (My Vehicles), Pay\nDownpayment and Pay Balance (My Bookings). New supabase/functions/_shared/cors.ts,\napplied to create-checkout and (pre-emptively, before its first deploy)\nprocess-refund. paymongo-webhook doesn''t need it — PayMongo calls it\nserver-to-server, not from a browser.\n\n- Subscribe is now also gated on verified_status, both client-side (button\n  relabels to \"Get Verified to Subscribe\" and redirects to /verify instead\n  of calling the function) and server-side in create-checkout itself (the\n  real boundary — client-side is only a UX convenience).\n- Systematic audit of every useMutation in the app for missing error\n  handling, prompted by the same silent-failure pattern: added onError +\n  visible error text to booking/support chat send, admin catalog CRUD,\n  company info save, dispute resolve, admin inquiry replies, platform\n  settings save, vehicle approve/reject/dismiss-report, verification\n  reject/suspend/ban/clear-strikes, booking cancel/mark-complete/pay,\n  bookings-received accept/decline/confirm-handover/mark-complete/cancel-\n  no-show, and MFA unenroll. Several of these were exactly the kind of\n  action that could now fail because of the rate-limiting cooldowns added\n  last round (chat messages, listing reports) with nothing to show for it.\n- ConfirmDialog (shared by cancel/decline/no-show/report-listing dialogs)\n  gained an optional `error` prop so every dialog built on it can surface\n  its mutation''s failure instead of just closing silently.\n\nStill not deployed: create-checkout''s fix and process-refund need the\nSupabase access token requested earlier -- this is now a confirmed live\nbug blocking real payment flows, not just a nice-to-have.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17b34950679f7150bbc30955c02268d0d096796b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/17b34950679f7150bbc30955c02268d0d096796b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/276c30ce8869e1e8be82d4b1850852239515c94d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/276c30ce8869e1e8be82d4b1850852239515c94d","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDI3NmMzMGNlODg2OWUxZThiZTgyZDRiMTg1MDg1MjIzOTUxNWM5NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/bb776ef33990cfd83bddd7ab3cb16dbc7400b58b","sha":"bb776ef33990cfd83bddd7ab3cb16dbc7400b58b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/bb776ef33990cfd83bddd7ab3cb16dbc7400b58b"}],"sha":"276c30ce8869e1e8be82d4b1850852239515c94d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/276c30ce8869e1e8be82d4b1850852239515c94d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/bb776ef33990cfd83bddd7ab3cb16dbc7400b58b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:22:18Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:22:18Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Make 2FA mandatory for admin/support accounts\n\n2FA existed but was opt-in for everyone, including staff. Rather than\nbuilding a separate admin portal (the real-world justification for that\nis mainly attack-surface reduction and a stricter security posture for\nprivileged accounts), this gets the same benefit cheaply on the existing\none: is_admin()/is_support_or_admin() now also require the current\nsession to be aal2, not just the right role. A staff account with no\nverified TOTP factor can never reach aal2, so this forces enrollment as\na side effect of the same check.\n\n- New is_aal2() helper (reads the standard Supabase Auth `aal` JWT claim);\n  is_admin()/is_support_or_admin() updated to require it\n  (034_mandatory_mfa_for_staff.sql). Verified live by simulating aal1 vs\n  aal2 JWT sessions for the same admin profile.\n- New MandatoryMfaGate component wraps the whole AppShell for staff\n  profiles: blocks all admin content behind either a mandatory enrollment\n  flow (no verified factor yet) or a code-entry challenge (factor exists\n  but this session hasn''t completed it), before anything else renders.\n  Without this, staff would reach admin pages fine but then have every\n  RLS read/RPC call silently fail — a confusing half-broken page instead\n  of a clear reason why.\n- TwoFactorSection (Profile page) hides the \"Disable\" button and explains\n  why for staff accounts, instead of letting them opt back out.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa75be3e5e4f7184341b203258cf5b251d8f2b41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/aa75be3e5e4f7184341b203258cf5b251d8f2b41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/bb776ef33990cfd83bddd7ab3cb16dbc7400b58b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/bb776ef33990cfd83bddd7ab3cb16dbc7400b58b","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGJiNzc2ZWYzMzk5MGNmZDgzYmRkZDdhYjNjYjE2ZGJjNzQwMGI1OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/55dff740b870bec190d494459a41334d3539bd4d","sha":"55dff740b870bec190d494459a41334d3539bd4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/55dff740b870bec190d494459a41334d3539bd4d"}],"sha":"bb776ef33990cfd83bddd7ab3cb16dbc7400b58b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/bb776ef33990cfd83bddd7ab3cb16dbc7400b58b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/55dff740b870bec190d494459a41334d3539bd4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:07:03Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:07:03Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add a basic Vitest test suite covering the highest-risk pure business logic\n\nNo automated tests existed anywhere in the project. Not full coverage —\na safety net over the pieces most likely to silently regress and that\ninvolve real money or security:\n- cancellation.ts: previewCancellation() fee/refund math (mirrors\n  cancel_booking()''s math) across free-window, fee-applied, refund-floor,\n  and balance-paid-refund scenarios.\n- friendly-error.ts: every error-mapping branch plus the passthrough case.\n- password-input.ts: passwordMeetsRules() — each missing-rule case plus\n  a fully-valid password.\n- file-upload-box.ts: validateFile() — type rejection, default size limit,\n  and a custom size limit.\n- utils.ts: currency/date/relative-time formatting and the cn() Tailwind\n  merge helper.\n\n24 tests, all passing. `npm run test` (vitest run) added alongside\nbuild/lint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"567087419ce5e37b6adc0a653a1e85b8e68eef47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/567087419ce5e37b6adc0a653a1e85b8e68eef47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/55dff740b870bec190d494459a41334d3539bd4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/55dff740b870bec190d494459a41334d3539bd4d","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDU1ZGZmNzQwYjg3MGJlYzE5MGQ0OTQ0NTlhNDEzMzRkMzUzOWJkNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/2f1e542f8740d5627365e196072ee2996b833f50","sha":"2f1e542f8740d5627365e196072ee2996b833f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/2f1e542f8740d5627365e196072ee2996b833f50"}],"sha":"55dff740b870bec190d494459a41334d3539bd4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/55dff740b870bec190d494459a41334d3539bd4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/2f1e542f8740d5627365e196072ee2996b833f50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:01:46Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T09:01:46Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add real PayMongo Refunds API automation for security deposit refunds\n\nDeposit refunds were 100% manual (admin clicks \"mark refunded\", no actual\nmoney movement verification). Since the deposit is bundled into the\noriginal downpayment charge rather than being its own payment,\n\"refunding the deposit\" means a partial refund of that original payment\nvia PayMongo''s Refunds API (POST /v1/refunds, amount < full paid amount).\n\n- New RPCs: mark_deposit_refund_processing (admin-triggered, records a\n  ''pending'' refund payment row), get_downpayment_paymongo_reference\n  (finds the original payment to refund against), and\n  confirm_deposit_refund_result (idempotent, called by the webhook when\n  PayMongo reports succeeded/failed) — 033_paymongo_refund_automation.sql.\n  Verified live end-to-end against synthetic booking/payment fixtures,\n  including a replayed-webhook idempotency check.\n- New process-refund Edge Function calls PayMongo''s Refunds API and kicks\n  off the pending record; paymongo-webhook now also handles\n  `refund.updated` events to confirm the terminal status.\n- Admin Send Payments: \"Mark Refunded\" replaced with \"Send Refund via\n  PayMongo\" (calls the new function) plus a smaller \"Mark manually\n  refunded\" fallback for deposits returned outside PayMongo. New\n  \"Refunds in progress\" section shows deposits currently mid-flight so\n  admin doesn''t double-trigger a refund. mark_deposit_refunded() (011) is\n  kept as the manual-fallback path, not removed.\n\nNot yet deployed: the Edge Function changes need a fresh Supabase access\ntoken (the prior one was revoked per earlier advice) — asked the user for\none. The DB-side logic is fully applied and verified live regardless.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4306cfb2cce56668f460c7109f773a36886d03ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/4306cfb2cce56668f460c7109f773a36886d03ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/2f1e542f8740d5627365e196072ee2996b833f50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/2f1e542f8740d5627365e196072ee2996b833f50","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDJmMWU1NDJmODc0MGQ1NjI3MzY1ZTE5NjA3MmVlMjk5NmI4MzNmNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/45ba3aef263b06a717eaefa561024cbd614b1db6","sha":"45ba3aef263b06a717eaefa561024cbd614b1db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/45ba3aef263b