ded.\n  Verified live: a rapid second call is correctly blocked.\n- New /privacy route: a plain-language data notice (what''s collected, why,\n  who can see it) explicitly framed as a capstone simulation, not a real\n  registered personal information controller -- honest awareness of RA\n  10173 without fabricating a legal certification.\n- Signup now requires a Terms/Privacy consent checkbox before submitting;\n  Get Verified requires a specific consent checkbox for ID/selfie\n  processing before submitting. Both link to /privacy in a new tab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25ac4a484631876dede541dc3054efa11cc31393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/25ac4a484631876dede541dc3054efa11cc31393"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/45ba3aef263b06a717eaefa561024cbd614b1db6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/