 unusable on a phone/narrow\nviewport. Below 860px the sidebar becomes a slide-in drawer (fixed\nposition, backdrop overlay, closes on nav-link click or backdrop click)\ntriggered by a hamburger button in the topbar; main content padding and\nthe wordmark/icon spacing shrink slightly on narrow screens too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ce0597bb12b447cee548b76879246621fb6a04f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/0ce0597bb12b447cee548b76879246621fb6a04f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/a236bb9a3a7f9090619dc15cbccae783981e0000","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a236bb9a3a7f9090619dc15cbccae783981e0000","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGEyMzZiYjlhM2E3ZjkwOTA2MTlkYzE1Y2JjY2FlNzgzOTgxZTAwMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9c332c7bab2ee21e16e8defc0bf0b8198a51251d","sha":"9c332c7bab2ee21e16e8defc0bf0b8198a51251d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9c332c7bab2ee21e16e8defc0bf0b8198a51251d"}],"sha":"a236bb9a3a7f9090619dc15cbccae783981e0000","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a236bb9a3a7f9090619dc15cbccae783981e0000"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9c332c7bab2ee21e16e8defc0bf0b8198a51251d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:35:18Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:35:18Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix critical notify_user() hard-failure bug, enforce vehicle quota, add in-app notification bell\n\n- CRITICAL BUG FIX: notify_user(p_send_email=true) was throwing a hard\n  Postgres error (\"null value in column url\") instead of silently skipping\n  email, because app.settings.send_email_function_url was never configured.\n  Since 25+ RPCs call this (accept_booking, reject_booking,\n  approve_verification, approve_vehicle, mark_complete, etc.), every one of\n  those was likely aborting its entire transaction on that code path, not\n  just failing to send an email. Found while testing quota enforcement;\n  reproduced live before fixing. Fixed to gracefully no-op when the email\n  endpoint isn''t configured, and wrapped the HTTP call in an exception\n  handler so a notification-delivery problem can never take down the real\n  booking/payment action that triggered it (030_fix_notify_user_hard_failure.sql).\n- Vehicle quota enforcement was completely missing despite the whole\n  subscription system and a progress bar implying a limit existed. Added\n  get_vehicle_slot_capacity() (free_vehicle_slots + active subscription\n  slots) and wired approve_vehicle() to pause a vehicle over quota at\n  approval time; a new monthly expire-lapsed-subscriptions cron job re-pauses\n  vehicles when a subscription lapses. Enforces going forward only, per\n  explicit decision — existing already-active vehicles are not retroactively\n  touched (029_vehicle_quota_enforcement.sql). Verified live end-to-end with\n  a real 3-vehicle/2-slot test after simulating a real admin JWT session.\n  My Vehicles'' progress bar and Add Vehicle now both read the real capacity\n  (free + subscription slots) instead of just the free-tier number, and Add\n  Vehicle shows a non-blocking heads-up banner when already at capacity.\n- New in-app notification bell (notification-bell.tsx): the `notifications`\n  table has been written to by every major event since the very first\n  migration but nothing ever read it — no bell, no dropdown, nothing. Added\n  a topbar bell with unread count, realtime updates (table was also never\n  added to the realtime publication — 031_notifications_realtime.sql, same\n  easy-to-miss gap hit twice before with chat tables), mark-as-read on\n  click, and mark-all-read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c27941f84cf8bd74647dbe9461972196ec74b5d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/c27941f84cf8bd74647dbe9461972196ec74b5d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/9c332c7bab2ee21e16e8defc0bf0b8198a51251d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9c332c7bab2ee21e16e8defc0bf0b8198a51251d","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDljMzMyYzdiYWIyZWUyMWUxNmU4ZGVmYzBiZjBiODE5OGE1MTI1MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9050efd82930e04cfcddbd653655f72759bcc82e","sha":"9050efd82930e04cfcddbd653655f72759bcc82e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9050efd82930e04cfcddbd653655f72759bcc82e"}],"sha":"9c332c7bab2ee21e16e8defc0bf0b8198a51251d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9c332c7bab2ee21e16e8defc0bf0b8198a51251d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9050efd82930e04cfcddbd653655f72759bcc82e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T07:20:57Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T07:20:57Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix camera capture bug, add profile pictures from verified selfies, surface ratings on both sides of a booking\n\n- Real bug fix: CameraCapture assigned the MediaStream to videoRef before\n  the <video> element existed (it only mounts once `active` is true), so\n  the ref was always null and the preview/capture silently did nothing.\n  Moved the srcObject assignment into an effect keyed on `active`, and\n  added a guard so Capture shows a clear message instead of grabbing a\n  blank 0x0 frame if clicked before the camera stream is ready.\n- The \"selfie, face only\" from Get Verified now becomes the user''s visible\n  profile picture once admin approves the submission: new `avatars` public\n  storage bucket + `profiles.avatar_url` (027_profile_avatar.sql).\n  approve_verification() takes an optional avatar path; the actual file\n  copy (private user-verification bucket -> public avatars bucket) happens\n  client-side in admin''s Approve action, since Postgres can''t move storage\n  objects across buckets itself.\n- New Avatar component (initials fallback for unverified/pending users)\n  wired into Car Detail (owner), My Bookings (owner — previously showed no\n  owner info at all), Bookings Received (renter), the admin Users table,\n  Profile, and the topbar profile menu.\n- Renter ratings were structurally impossible to ever populate: only\n  renter-rates-owner existed (My Bookings \"Rate this rental\"), so an\n  owner-rates-renter path never existed and Bookings Received never showed\n  a renter''s rating. Added the reciprocal \"Rate this renter\" flow (reuses\n  RateBookingDialog) plus a lean get_rating_summary() RPC\n  (028_rating_summary_and_renter_reviews.sql) so a rating badge can show on\n  both sides without pulling full review lists per booking row — it\n  respects the same blind-until-both-submit-or-14-days visibility rule as\n  the existing review display, so this can''t leak an early review.\n- Brought RateBookingDialog''s modal in line with the earlier glass/motion\n  pass (was still the old flat/no-animation modal).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"698d2c80ac9b02784bb2ddbbd9ebd06aba67eba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/698d2c80ac9b02784bb2ddbbd9ebd06aba67eba1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/9050efd82930e04cfcddbd653655f72759bcc82e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9050efd82930e04cfcddbd653655f72759bcc82e","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDkwNTBlZmQ4MjkzMGUwNGNmY2RkYmQ2NTM2NTVmNzI3NTliY2M4MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/4f94458c54a654d7b0681a9d03bce181cf7c0d6b","sha":"4f94458c54a654d7b0681a9d03bce181cf7c0d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/4f94458c54a654d7b0681a9d03bce181cf7c0d6b"}],"sha":"9050efd82930e04cfcddbd653655f72759bcc82e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9050efd82930e04cfcddbd653655f72759bcc82e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/4f94458c54a654d7b0681a9d03bce181cf7c0d6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T07:03:15Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T07:03:15Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Polish UI with a glassmorphism/premium visual pass — frosted surfaces, gradient accent, smoother motion\n\n- New --color-accent-2 (deep indigo) token pairs with the existing teal accent\n  for a two-stop gradient, used sparingly on primary buttons, badges, and an\n  ambient background wallpaper (fixed radial-gradient blooms behind the glass)\n- New .glass utility (translucent bg + backdrop-blur) applied to Card, topbar,\n  sidebar, the profile dropdown, and confirm dialogs so they read as frosted\n  panels floating over the wallpaper instead of flat opaque boxes\n- Card/Button/dialog shadows now use a shared --shadow-tint variable for a\n  soft color-tinted depth instead of plain black drop shadows\n- Global smooth transitions (200ms, eased) on color/border/shadow/transform\n  everywhere; buttons press with a slight scale, cards/nav/upload-boxes lift\n  on hover; dropdown and modal have real enter animations instead of popping in\n  - Active sidebar nav item gets a left accent bar instead of just a bg tint\n- Upload boxes (file-upload-box.tsx and the matching hand-rolled ones in\n  add-vehicle/edit-vehicle/verify) get the same frosted-glass treatment\n- input-base gets a soft inset shadow and an accent glow on focus instead of\n  a flat border-color swap\n- Kept it restrained: no new colors beyond the one accent pair, animations\n  stay short (150-220ms) and respect prefers-reduced-motion, semantic status\n  colors (warn/good/bad/info) untouched\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ca091a2192de839f878b4742feed6a7ba4c9b29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/0ca091a2192de839f878b4742feed6a7ba4c9b29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/4f94458c54a654d7b0681a9d03bce181cf7c0d6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/4f94458c54a654d7b0681a9d03bce181cf7c0d6b","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDRmOTQ0NThjNTRhNjU0ZDdiMDY4MWE5ZDAzYmNlMTgxY2Y3YzBkNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/5825eac48bb9a3285b825914de72317c89890911","sha":"5825eac48bb9a3285b825914de72317c89890911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5825eac48bb9a3285b825914de72317c89890911"}],"sha":"4f94458c54a654d7b0681a9d03bce181cf7c0d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/4f94458c54a654d7b0681a9d03bce181cf7c0d6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5825eac48bb9a3285b825914de72317c89890911/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:49:17Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:49:17Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix live-testing feedback: password strength UI, verification redesign, mandatory rental agreement, hard input limits, friendly errors, dark/light mode\n\n- Password strength checklist + show/hide toggle on signup/reset\n- Vercel SPA rewrite (vercel.json) fixes 404 on refresh/cross-device email link\n- Back-to-sign-in links after signup/reset email sent\n- Get Verified: drop typed national ID number, add secondary ID type dropdown,\n  live camera capture for both selfies (no file upload) to prevent fraud,\n  relabeled document fields\n- Profile vs Get Verified clarified: identity fields (name, birthday) now\n  locked server-side via protect_profile_fields(), only editable via\n  approve_verification(); only phone/address stay user-editable\n- Added PayMongo payout account setup (bank transfer or GCash) on Profile,\n  surfaced to admin on Send Payments so they know where to actually send money\n- Removed mileage from vehicle listing/edit/detail entirely\n- Rental agreement is now required, not optional, on Add Vehicle\n- Bordered, clickable FileUploadBox component replaces bare file inputs\n  across Add/Edit Vehicle and Verify (user testing showed bare inputs weren''t\n  recognized as clickable)\n- Hard client-side input limits (maxLength/min/max/regex) on plate number,\n  model year, prices, phone, addresses — restricts invalid input as it''s\n  typed instead of only failing on submit\n- friendlyErrorMessage() maps raw Postgres/RLS errors to plain text; early\n  verified-status guards on Add Vehicle and booking block unverified users\n  with a clear \"get verified first\" message instead of a raw RLS error\n- Dark/light theme toggle in topbar, defaults to system preference,\n  persisted via localStorage\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87a7ced6a8708f84f67d8448a5f4e35d1249fc5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/87a7ced6a8708f84f67d8448a5f4e35d1249fc5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/5825eac48bb9a3285b825914de72317c89890911","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/5825eac48bb9a3285b825914de72317c89890911","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDU4MjVlYWM0OGJiOWEzMjg1YjgyNTkxNGRlNzIzMTdjODk4OTA5MTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/65cb8a1ab725e5446b9d73ccec7ee7ddcf6d12e4","sha":"65cb8a1ab725e5446b9d73ccec7ee7ddcf6d12e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/65cb8a1ab725e5446b9d73ccec7ee7ddcf6d12e4"}],"sha":"5825eac48bb9a3285b825914de72317c89890911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/5825eac48bb9a3285b825914de72317c89890911"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/65cb8a1ab725e5446b9d73ccec7ee7ddcf6d12e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:02:05Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:02:05Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add per-booking chat, subscription purchase, and reviews display\n\nThree features whose backend already existed with no UI to trigger them\n- same gap pattern as the earlier orphaned-RPC audit:\n\n- Per-booking chat: the `messages` table/RLS have existed since 001/002\n  but were never added to the realtime publication (same fix as the\n  Inquire chat needed) and no UI ever called them. Added a toggleable\n  BookingChat thread on My Bookings / Bookings Received once a booking is\n  accepted, real-time via Supabase Realtime.\n- Subscription purchase: create-checkout already supported\n  payment_type=''subscription'' and confirm_subscription_payment existed,\n  but My Vehicles had no button. Added one, wired to the real checkout flow.\n- Reviews display: submission worked (Rate this rental) but nothing showed\n  ratings anywhere. Implemented the blind-until-both-submit-or-14-days rule\n  that was decided but never built - required adding bookings.completed_at\n  (updated_at isn''t a reliable proxy for completion time) and a\n  get_visible_reviews_for_owner() function. Verified live with real\n  completed bookings: a lone review past 14 days shows, a lone review\n  within the window stays hidden, and it becomes visible immediately once\n  both sides submit even within the window. Shown as an average rating +\n  review list on Car Detail (about the owner, not fabricated per-vehicle -\n  consistent with the earlier Lister Analytics honesty note, since reviews\n  are tied to the person, not a specific car in this schema).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"525ab9023b13e9ff04296c4d775022c5db914157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/525ab9023b13e9ff04296c4d775022c5db914157"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/65cb8a1ab725e5446b9d73ccec7ee7ddcf6d12e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/65cb8a1ab725e5446b9d73ccec7ee7ddcf6d12e4","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDY1Y2I4YTFhYjcyNWU1NDQ2YjlkNzNjY2VjN2VlN2RkY2Y2ZDEyZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/2791570c99ec6809b4ee036a09891676f088a936","sha":"2791570c99ec6809b4ee036a09891676f088a936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/2791570c99ec6809b4ee036a09891676f088a936"}],"sha":"65cb8a1ab725e5446b9d73ccec7ee7ddcf6d12e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/65cb8a1ab725e5446b9d73ccec7ee7ddcf6d12e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/2791570c99ec6809b4ee036a09891676f088a936/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:38:06Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:38:06Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add 2FA (TOTP) - this was mistakenly reported as done earlier but never built\n\nSelf-caught: the trust & safety backlog was previously reported as \"all 10\ndone\" but 2FA was never actually implemented - a grep for mfa/totp turned\nup nothing. Fixing that gap now rather than letting an inflated status\nstand.\n\n- TwoFactorSection (Profile page): enroll (renders Supabase''s own QR SVG\n  directly, no client-side QR library needed), confirm via 6-digit code,\n  disable. Opt-in for any user, not just admin, per the earlier decision.\n- Login: after password check succeeds, checks\n  getAuthenticatorAssuranceLevel() - if the account has TOTP enrolled and\n  still needs to step up to aal2, shows a code-entry step instead of\n  navigating straight in.\n- Verified against the live project''s actual Auth config (not assumed):\n  mfa_totp_enroll_enabled and mfa_totp_verify_enabled are both true,\n  mfa_allow_low_aal is false (so aal2 step-up is actually enforced) -\n  confirms the flow this code assumes is really how the project is\n  configured.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f07f23ef0fc9e1160a9d8fd4f01fb1fc05c25e9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/f07f23ef0fc9e1160a9d8fd4f01fb1fc05c25e9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/2791570c99ec6809b4ee036a09891676f088a936","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/2791570c99ec6809b4ee036a09891676f088a936","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDI3OTE1NzBjOTllYzY4MDliNGVlMDM2YTA5ODkxNjc2ZjA4OGE5MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/20c203b2ad4b9ee9a937fd5010a97a88670ed550","sha":"20c203b2ad4b9ee9a937fd5010a97a88670ed550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/20c203b2ad4b9ee9a937fd5010a97a88670ed550"}],"sha":"2791570c99ec6809b4ee036a09891676f088a936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/2791570c99ec6809b4ee036a09891676f088a936"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/20c203b2ad4b9ee9a937fd5010a97a88670ed550/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:29:34Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:29:34Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Company Info admin module - makes support contact dynamic, not hardcoded\n\nRather than hardcoding an emergency contact number/email (which would\nhave meant either fabricating fake-looking contact info or blocking on\none specific value), added a proper admin-editable module - consistent\nwith the project''s standing principle that business-configurable values\nlive in an editable table, not hardcoded in the app.\n\n- New company_info table (text key/value, admin-write, readable by\n  anyone) - kept separate from platform_settings since that table is\n  numeric business rules and its Admin Settings page assumes every value\n  is a number; contact details are text and a distinct concern\n- Admin > Company Info: edit support_email/support_phone/emergency_note\n- EmergencyBanner component: shown on My Bookings / Bookings Received\n  whenever the viewer has an active rental, pulling from company_info\n  live. Renders nothing if neither contact field is configured yet,\n  rather than showing a placeholder that looks real but isn''t\n\nCloses the last item in the trust & safety / ops backlog - all 10 items\nplus the webhook idempotency fix and the strike-protection bug are now\nbuilt and verified against the live database.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4e310b5106b3374710d80d13075b9d09f45f1da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/b4e310b5106b3374710d80d13075b9d09f45f1da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/20c203b2ad4b9ee9a937fd5010a97a88670ed550","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/20c203b2ad4b9ee9a937fd5010a97a88670ed550","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDIwYzIwM2IyYWQ0YjllZTlhOTM3ZmQ1MDEwYTk3YTg4NjcwZWQ1NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/52744f4ba9c94318d448acf1114d0f07bd20b43d","sha":"52744f4ba9c94318d448acf1114d0f07bd20b43d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/52744f4ba9c94318d448acf1114d0f07bd20b43d"}],"sha":"20c203b2ad4b9ee9a937fd5010a97a88670ed550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/20c203b2ad4b9ee9a937fd5010a97a88670ed550"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/52744f4ba9c94318d448acf1114d0f07bd20b43d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:21:26Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:21:26Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Help/FAQ page, cron health check, strike decay - and fix a real bug\n\n- Help page (/help): FAQ accordion + CTA into the Inquire chat, linked\n  from the profile menu. No separate support email needed since Inquire\n  already exists.\n- Cron health check: get_cron_health() wraps cron.job_run_details (not\n  normally reachable via the REST API - only public schema is exposed),\n  surfaced as a \"Scheduled jobs\" card on the Admin Dashboard. Verified live:\n  both jobs have real run history and are succeeding.\n- Strike decay: replaced the flat strike_count integer with a proper\n  strikes table (one row per event, with a timestamp), since decay-by-time\n  can''t be represented by a single counter. get_active_strike_count() only\n  counts strikes within strike_decay_months (platform_settings); an\n  already-flagged account stays flagged until admin clears it (no\n  background job needed - decay is evaluated at read/write time, not on\n  a schedule).\n\nFound and fixed a real, pre-existing bug while verifying strike decay live:\nprotect_profile_fields() has silently reverted strike_count/account_flagged\non every update since it was written, because cancel_booking()/\ncancel_no_show() are called by the renter or owner themselves - never an\nadmin - so is_admin() was always false in that context and the trigger\ndiscarded the change before it reached the table. The entire strike system\nhas never actually recorded a strike in production. Verified directly:\nadd_strike() left strike_count at 0 both before and after the call, while\nget_active_strike_count() correctly showed the real count. Fixed with a\ntransaction-local flag that only add_strike()/clear_strikes() can set,\nwhich the trigger trusts - nothing client-facing can set it, so a user\nstill can''t PATCH their own row to fake these fields. Re-verified live\nafter the fix: strike_count now updates correctly (0 -> 3 across three\nadd_strike calls), and clear_strikes'' own admin-only check was confirmed\nstill intact (rejected a non-admin caller as expected).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08dc4360ef8f4f6ffeb210cdc22e011a1ffbbb56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/08dc4360ef8f4f6ffeb210cdc22e011a1ffbbb56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/52744f4ba9c94318d448acf1114d0f07bd20b43d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/52744f4ba9c94318d448acf1114d0f07bd20b43d","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDUyNzQ0ZjRiYTljOTQzMThkNDQ4YWNmMTExNGQwZjA3YmQyMGI0M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/859ec768233ee6a129bb3d6024f3ef8bd2ab61b1","sha":"859ec768233ee6a129bb3d6024f3ef8bd2ab61b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/859ec768233ee6a129bb3d6024f3ef8bd2ab61b1"}],"sha":"52744f4ba9c94318d448acf1114d0f07bd20b43d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/52744f4ba9c94318d448acf1114d0f07bd20b43d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/859ec768233ee6a129bb3d6024f3ef8bd2ab61b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:07:26Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:07:26Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Report Listing flow (fake photos/misleading info, separate from disputes)\n\nAny logged-in user browsing can flag a listing even without having booked\nit - previously the only re-review trigger was the owner editing a\nsensitive field. Doesn''t auto-hide the listing, just queues it for\nadmin/support review.\n\n- listing_reports table + resolve_listing_report() RPC\n- Car Detail: \"Report this listing\" link opens a reason dialog\n- Admin Vehicle Approval: new \"Reported Listings\" section above the main\n  table, with Review Vehicle (opens the existing detail panel) / Dismiss\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36429208daf449c14cf7b9bf25dc3e0e6f91ff59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/36429208daf449c14cf7b9bf25dc3e0e6f91ff59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/859ec768233ee6a129bb3d6024f3ef8bd2ab61b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/859ec768233ee6a129bb3d6024f3ef8bd2ab61b1","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDg1OWVjNzY4MjMzZWU2YTEyOWJiM2Q2MDI0ZjNlZjhiZDJhYjYxYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9d8791fbc3cf5a545601ec026f1693ac963d432d","sha":"9d8791fbc3cf5a545601ec026f1693ac963d432d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9d8791fbc3cf5a545601ec026f1693ac963d432d"}],"sha":"859ec768233ee6a129bb3d6024f3ef8bd2ab61b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/859ec768233ee6a129bb3d6024f3ef8bd2ab61b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9d8791fbc3cf5a545601ec026f1693ac963d432d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:58:43Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:58:43Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add ban-evasion check, minimum renter age, max vehicle age, support admin role\n\n- Ban-evasion: new verification_submissions.ban_evasion_flag, set by a\n  trigger checking whether the license/national ID number was ever tied to\n  a banned account. Surfaced as a warning banner in Admin Users review,\n  never auto-blocks - admin makes the final call.\n- Minimum renter age: platform_settings.minimum_renter_age (21), enforced\n  in request_booking() at the actual risky action, matching how\n  verified_status is already gated there.\n- Max vehicle age: vehicles.model_year (new column) + platform_settings.\n  max_vehicle_age_years (15), enforced via trigger on insert/update. Added\n  to both Add/Edit Vehicle forms; treated as a sensitive field on edit\n  (re-triggers admin approval, matching plate_number/model_id/orcr_path -\n  updated protect_vehicle_fields() so the UI''s warning matches actual\n  backend behavior instead of promising something that doesn''t happen).\n- Support-tier admin role: profiles.role now allows ''support'', a narrower\n  role that can review/resolve verifications, vehicles, disputes, and\n  inquiries, but cannot touch Settings, Send Payments, Audit Trail, Car\n  Catalog, or suspend/ban/clear-strikes actions - both in RLS and inside\n  the RPCs themselves (is_support_or_admin() vs is_admin()). Frontend:\n  AppShell hides restricted nav items, App.tsx has a stricter guard for\n  full-admin-only routes, Admin Users hides ban actions from support.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a67af1f6a42f979fc1084dcc8a1812b326cce97e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/a67af1f6a42f979fc1084dcc8a1812b326cce97e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/9d8791fbc3cf5a545601ec026f1693ac963d432d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/9d8791fbc3cf5a545601ec026f1693ac963d432d","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDlkODc5MWZiYzNjZjVhNTQ1NjAxZWMwMjZmMTY5M2FjOTYzZDQzMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/197a0e951c08d5ac5a64b30c9cda50acf5c3546c","sha":"197a0e951c08d5ac5a64b30c9cda50acf5c3546c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/197a0e951c08d5ac5a64b30c9cda50acf5c3546c"}],"sha":"9d8791fbc3cf5a545601ec026f1693ac963d432d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/9d8791fbc3cf5a545601ec026f1693ac963d432d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/197a0e951c08d5ac5a64b30c9cda50acf5c3546c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:37:20Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:37:20Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Fix: make PayMongo webhook handlers idempotent against duplicate deliveries\n\nconfirm_downpayment_paid/confirm_balance_paid/confirm_subscription_payment\npreviously raised an exception (-> 500 -> PayMongo retries indefinitely)\nif a webhook was delivered twice for the same event, since the booking was\nalready past the expected status on the second delivery. No data\ncorruption risk existed, but the webhook looked broken under retry.\n\nFix: check whether this exact paymongo_reference was already recorded for\nthis payment_type first; if so, no-op success instead of raising. A\ngenuinely wrong-state call (not a retry) still raises correctly.\n\nVerified live: replayed the same webhook event twice against a real test\nbooking, confirmed both return 200 and exactly one payment row exists (no\nduplicate processing), then cleaned up the fixtures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78d5d691f559817e1dc49d1fdd8cac9e24d9d30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/78d5d691f559817e1dc49d1fdd8cac9e24d9d30c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/197a0e951c08d5ac5a64b30c9cda50acf5c3546c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/197a0e951c08d5ac5a64b30c9cda50acf5c3546c","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDE5N2EwZTk1MWMwOGQ1YWM1YTY0YjMwYzljZGE1MGFjZjVjMzU0NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/177df2a0ff1dc1d2852857887c94f6b9f79a8958","sha":"177df2a0ff1dc1d2852857887c94f6b9f79a8958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/177df2a0ff1dc1d2852857887c94f6b9f79a8958"}],"sha":"197a0e951c08d5ac5a64b30c9cda50acf5c3546c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/197a0e951c08d5ac5a64b30c9cda50acf5c3546c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/177df2a0ff1dc1d2852857887c94f6b9f79a8958/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:28:37Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:28:37Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Admin Analytics and Lister Analytics (My Vehicles > Analytics tab)\n\nFollowed the dataviz skill''s method rather than ad-hoc chart code:\n- Bookings and revenue are two separate single-hue line charts, not one\n  dual-axis chart (the \"one axis\" rule - two different scales never share\n  a y-axis)\n- Top vehicle models / top locations use one hue (the brand accent), since\n  comparing magnitude across already-labeled categories doesn''t need a\n  categorical rainbow - using one would be the anti-pattern, not the fix\n- Booking funnel (requested -> accepted -> paid -> completed) uses an\n  ordinal light-to-dark ramp of the same hue, per the palette''s guidance\n  for ordered stages, not four unrelated colors\n- Suggestion cards use the app''s existing semantic tokens (good/warn/info),\n  never color alone - icon + label per the status-color rule\n- Bar labels capped at 72% max bar width so the tip label never gets\n  clipped by the card edge on near-max values\n\nAdmin: bookings/revenue trends, top models/locations, funnel, rule-based\nsuggestions (all computed from real data, not fabricated).\n\nLister: per-vehicle bookings/revenue/occupancy + suggestions, revenue\ntrend. Overall rating shown once (not per-vehicle) since reviews are tied\nto the owner as a person in this schema, not to a specific vehicle -\nshowing a fake per-vehicle rating would have been dishonest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c073528ddd5e6383fd064ae77d94c9b4f6c3eeff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/c073528ddd5e6383fd064ae77d94c9b4f6c3eeff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/177df2a0ff1dc1d2852857887c94f6b9f79a8958","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/177df2a0ff1dc1d2852857887c94f6b9f79a8958","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKDE3N2RmMmEwZmYxZGMxZDI4NTI4NTc4ODdjOTRmNmI5Zjc5YTg5NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a34bd3767341e98f5c5f2c7012f621b68a9aae8c","sha":"a34bd3767341e98f5c5f2c7012f621b68a9aae8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a34bd3767341e98f5c5f2c7012f621b68a9aae8c"}],"sha":"177df2a0ff1dc1d2852857887c94f6b9f79a8958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/177df2a0ff1dc1d2852857887c94f6b9f79a8958"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a34bd3767341e98f5c5f2c7012f621b68a9aae8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:14:56Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:14:56Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Inquire: real-time general support chat, distinct from ticketed Disputes\n\nOne ongoing conversation per user with admin (support_conversations +\nsupport_messages), matching the live-chat product pattern (Intercom/Zendesk\nChat/WhatsApp Business) rather than a ticketing pattern, since this is\nexplicitly meant to stay separate from the booking-scoped, status-tracked\nDisputes system.\n\n- get_or_create_support_conversation() / mark_support_read() RPCs\n- Real-time via Supabase Realtime (postgres_changes) - required adding both\n  tables to the supabase_realtime publication, which is a separate step\n  from RLS; without it the subscriptions would silently never fire\n- User side: persistent chat icon in the topbar -> /inquire\n- Admin side: /admin/inquiries inbox, unread indicator per conversation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df38226a36f637b57d306f7d316ac572c3bbe2c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/df38226a36f637b57d306f7d316ac572c3bbe2c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/a34bd3767341e98f5c5f2c7012f621b68a9aae8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a34bd3767341e98f5c5f2c7012f621b68a9aae8c","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGEzNGJkMzc2NzM0MWU5OGY1YzVmMmM3MDEyZjYyMWI2OGE5YWFlOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a1715ef8322215ab1a18d54ce676def95e6d3cc4","sha":"a1715ef8322215ab1a18d54ce676def95e6d3cc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a1715ef8322215ab1a18d54ce676def95e6d3cc4"}],"sha":"a34bd3767341e98f5c5f2c7012f621b68a9aae8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a34bd3767341e98f5c5f2c7012f621b68a9aae8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a1715ef8322215ab1a18d54ce676def95e6d3cc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T03:37:42Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T03:37:42Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"UI audit: fix orphaned backend logic, dead buttons, and a real z-index bug\n\nRan a systematic audit cross-referencing every backend RPC against the\nfrontend to find logic with no way to trigger it, plus a manual sweep for\nbuttons that render but do nothing. Found and fixed:\n\n- clear_strikes and set_account_status (suspend/ban) RPCs existed with zero\n  UI anywhere - Admin Users only showed a strike count, no action. Rebuilt\n  the panel so every user (not just pending-verification ones) opens an\n  Account Standing section with Clear Strikes / Suspend / Ban / Reactivate\n- \"Report an Issue\" and \"Rate this rental\" in My Bookings were dead buttons\n  (no onClick at all) despite disputes/reviews having full schema+RLS\n  support - built ReportIssueDialog and RateBookingDialog to actually wire\n  them up, including hiding the rate button once already reviewed\n- Rental agreement download was entirely missing from Car Detail and My\n  Bookings despite being an explicit original-spec requirement and fully\n  supported by storage/RLS - added it to both, via signed URLs since\n  vehicle-documents is a private bucket\n- Real CSS stacking bug: the profile dropdown menu had no z-index while the\n  sticky sidebar (its own stacking context, later in DOM) could paint over\n  it. Also the topbar was missing `sticky top-0` entirely, so it scrolled\n  away on any long page instead of staying pinned like the prototype\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ad223b2b9503db77b5eecbdb5bfe4f80546d7f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/6ad223b2b9503db77b5eecbdb5bfe4f80546d7f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/a1715ef8322215ab1a18d54ce676def95e6d3cc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/a1715ef8322215ab1a18d54ce676def95e6d3cc4","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGExNzE1ZWY4MzIyMjE1YWIxYTE4ZDU0Y2U2NzZkZWY5NWU2ZDNjYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/c14244e4e8eae7a1096bf935c9b63fcbfdf788a3","sha":"c14244e4e8eae7a1096bf935c9b63fcbfdf788a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/c14244e4e8eae7a1096bf935c9b63fcbfdf788a3"}],"sha":"a1715ef8322215ab1a18d54ce676def95e6d3cc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/a1715ef8322215ab1a18d54ce676def95e6d3cc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/c14244e4e8eae7a1096bf935c9b63fcbfdf788a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T03:20:41Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T03:20:41Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Finish remaining Admin pages: Settings, Catalog, Payments, Disputes, Audit, Dashboard\n\nAdmin work no longer requires running SQL by hand:\n- Settings: inline CRUD over platform_settings, takes effect immediately\n- Car Catalog: add/remove brands and models, seat count auto-suggests from\n  body type per the original seats-by-body-type table\n- Send Payments: owner payouts due + deposit refunds due, wired to\n  mark_payout_sent / new mark_deposit_refunded RPC\n- Disputes: evidence photo viewer (signed URLs) + resolution/refund form,\n  wired to resolve_dispute\n- Audit Trail: filterable read-only log\n- Dashboard: real counts (users, pending verifications, active listings/\n  bookings, commission revenue, open disputes) with quick links\n\nTwo gaps found and fixed while wiring Payments/Disputes:\n- No RPC existed to mark a deposit refunded (mark_deposit_refunded, new)\n- disputes.photo_paths had nowhere to actually store files - no bucket had\n  ever been created for dispute evidence (dispute-evidence bucket + RLS, new)\n\nAlso removed ComingSoon.tsx - dead code now that every placeholder route\nhas a real page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9aae85a0996c3a17a3a77338f10f044824e8a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/b9aae85a0996c3a17a3a77338f10f044824e8a81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/c14244e4e8eae7a1096bf935c9b63fcbfdf788a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/c14244e4e8eae7a1096bf935c9b63fcbfdf788a3","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGMxNDI0NGU0ZThlYWU3YTEwOTZiZjkzNWM5YjYzZmNiZmRmNzg4YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/c45661d543aebd547bc94d36eb2729f789e362e7","sha":"c45661d543aebd547bc94d36eb2729f789e362e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/c45661d543aebd547bc94d36eb2729f789e362e7"}],"sha":"c14244e4e8eae7a1096bf935c9b63fcbfdf788a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/c14244e4e8eae7a1096bf935c9b63fcbfdf788a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commits/c45661d543aebd547bc94d36eb2729f789e362e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T03:13:30Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T03:13:30Z","email":"kelchua360@gmail.com","name":"Karl Chua"},"message":"Add Vehicle Edit, cancel/decline confirmation UI, profile editing, password reset\n\n- Edit Vehicle page: instant-edit fields (price/location/photos/listing\n  status) vs. sensitive fields (plate/model/ORCR) that visibly warn they''ll\n  re-trigger admin approval, matching the protect_vehicle_fields() trigger\n- Cancel (My Bookings) now shows the actual computed fee/refund preview\n  before confirming, mirroring cancel_booking()''s fee math client-side\n- Decline (Bookings Received) now requires a reason; no-show cancellation\n  gets a confirmation dialog explaining the consequence\n- My Profile page: update phone/address without resubmitting verification\n- Password reset flow: forgot-password on login -> reset-password route\n- Storage buckets now enforce file type/size server-side (previously only\n  a client-side <input accept=> hint, trivially bypassed)\n- Fixed a live bug found while wiring this up: Supabase Auth site_url was\n  still the 