ullable\n- My Vehicles: quota bar + listing table\n- Bookings Received: accept/reject/confirm-handover (respecting the\n  balance-must-be-paid-first gate)/mark complete, wired to the RPCs\n- Admin Users & Vehicle Approval: review panels with signed-URL document\n  viewing and approve/reject wired to the RPCs\n- AppShell: added the profile menu (Get Verified / Switch to Lister) that\n  was missing, needed to actually reach /verify and toggle lister mode\n- Fixed a real bug: Browse/Car Detail were rendering raw storage paths as\n  <img src>, not resolved public URLs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b09fe13e1da39627bf18e5d55b55b4dd3d92962d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/b09fe13e1da39627bf18e5d55b55b4dd3d92962d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/8d1d4d96faa1c7acd886f8107fb906431f83b0d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g