e-checkout (PayMongo Checkout Sessions) and paymongo-webhook\n(signature-verified, calls confirm_downpayment_paid/confirm_balance_paid/\nconfirm_subscription_payment) Edge Functions, plus the previously-missing\nconfirm_subscription_payment RPC. Wires Pay Downpayment/Pay Balance buttons\nin My Bookings to actually create a checkout session and redirect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b339ff211a144ed3a44708a6e7df20de25b9c712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/trees/b339ff211a144ed3a44708a6e7df20de25b9c712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/git/commits/d367d7e74a26bc57e28bf5338ba714b9bf839a04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201449048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa","id":201449048,"login":"AzuAizawa","node_id":"U_kgDODAHeWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzuAizawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuAizawa/PorjectSafeDrive/commit/d367d7e74a26bc57e28bf5338ba714b9bf839a04","node_id":"C_kwDOTfozbNoAKGQzNjdkN2U3NGEyNmJjNTdlMjhiZjUzMzhiYTcxNGI5YmY4MzlhMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzuA