epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/95c10356d0b758e67b36d469e2f47299e94609f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:43Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:43Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"message":"Fix inaccuracies in README.md\n\n- devkit''s build output is apps/devkit/dist/devkit, not a root-level\n  dist/devkit.\n- devkit uses federation.config.js (CommonJS), not federation.config.mjs.\n- `npx ng generate application` no longer works for scaffolding a new\n  Angular remote since angular.json was removed and no @nx/angular\n  plugin is wired in; replace with guidance to manually scaffold\n  following apps/coming-soon''s project.json pattern.","tree":{"sha":"aa38449db6c5e03d818aa86fef1c2a8fdde9b85f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/trees/aa38449db6c5e03d818aa86fef1c2a8fdde9b85f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/commits/95c10356d0b758e67b36d469e2f47299e94609f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/95c10356d0b758e67b36d469e2f47299e94609f8","node_id":"C_kwDOTfrCstoAKDk1YzEwMzU2ZDBiNzU4ZTY3YjM2ZDQ2OWUyZjQ3Mjk5ZTk0NjA5Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/5c84111b5f839b02ad35f946ae8bf22d8460b32c","sha":"5c84111b5f839b02ad35f946ae8bf22d8460b32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/5c84111b5f839b02ad35f946ae8bf22d8460b32c"}],"sha":"95c10356d0b758e67b36d469e2f47299e94609f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/95c10356d0b758e67b36d469e2f47299e94609f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/5c84111b5f839b02ad35f946ae8bf22d8460b32c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:33Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:33Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"message":"Fix devkit''s tsc errors and add a typecheck target\n\napps/devkit/tsconfig.json''s \"types\": [\"vite/client\"] doesn''t ship\n@testing-library/jest-dom''s vitest matcher augmentations (causing\n~27 errors like toBeInTheDocument not existing on Assertion) or Node\ntypes (causing errors in build/build.ts''s use of path/fs/process/\n__dirname), and no Vite bundler is actually used here. Replace it\nwith [\"node\", \"@testing-library/jest-dom/vitest\"], and add @types/node\nas a devDependency since nothing in the workspace previously provided\nit.\n\nCopyButton.tsx''s useRef<ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>>() (no initial\nvalue) is rejected by React 19''s stricter types; give it an explicit\n`| undefined` initial value.\n\nAdd a typecheck target (tsc --noEmit) to project.json so `npx nx\ntypecheck devkit` can catch this class of regression going forward.","tree":{"sha":"83dc3ac2089acbd48e434bf960326c9fbb54c6c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/trees/83dc3ac2089acbd48e434bf960326c9fbb54c6c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/commits/5c84111b5f839b02ad35f946ae8bf22d8460b32c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/5c84111b5f839b02ad35f946ae8bf22d8460b32c","node_id":"C_kwDOTfrCstoAKDVjODQxMTFiNWY4MzliMDJhZDM1Zjk0NmFlOGJmMjJkODQ2MGIzMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/05b200f413b02dc8bc2c24baa8129d745dd07f90","sha":"05b200f413b02dc8bc2c24baa8129d745dd07f90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/05b200f413b02dc8bc2c24baa8129d745dd07f90"}],"sha":"5c84111b5f839b02ad35f946ae8bf22d8460b32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/5c84111b5f839b02ad35f946ae8bf22d8460b32c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/05b200f413b02dc8bc2c24baa8129d745dd07f90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:24Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:24Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"message":"Fix Nx build cache outputs for devkit and coming-soon\n\nnx.json declared a single global targetDefaults.build.outputs of\n{projectRoot}/dist, which is wrong for coming-soon (its Angular\nbuilder writes to the root-level dist/coming-soon, not\napps/coming-soon/dist) and imprecise for devkit (whose output is\napps/devkit/dist/devkit). A cache hit on coming-soon:build would\nreport success while restoring nothing. Move outputs out of the\nglobal default and into each project''s own build target.","tree":{"sha":"6944d1042711ffd2c126da2f6129fb697bf02663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/trees/6944d1042711ffd2c126da2f6129fb697bf02663"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/commits/05b200f413b02dc8bc2c24baa8129d745dd07f90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/05b200f413b02dc8bc2c24baa8129d745dd07f90","node_id":"C_kwDOTfrCstoAKDA1YjIwMGY0MTNiMDJkYzhiYzJjMjRiYWE4MTI5ZDc0NWRkMDdmOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/b371b500e6ffde903bc6943651451c5241cb71d2","sha":"b371b500e6ffde903bc6943651451c5241cb71d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/b371b500e6ffde903bc6943651451c5241cb71d2"}],"sha":"05b200f413b02dc8bc2c24baa8129d745dd07f90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/05b200f413b02dc8bc2c24baa8129d745dd07f90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/b371b500e6ffde903bc6943651451c5241cb71d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:18Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:18Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"message":"Fix deploy.yml to find devkit''s actual build output path\n\ndevkit''s esbuild-based build runs from apps/devkit with\noutputPath: ''dist/devkit'', landing at apps/devkit/dist/devkit rather\nthan a root-level dist/devkit. The workflow''s copy logic only checked\ndist/$project/browser (Angular) and dist/$project (root-level), so it\nnever found devkit''s output. Add apps/$project/dist/$project as a\nfallback, plus a hard failure if none of the known layouts match.","tree":{"sha":"0316803063b3b55cece882111baf3e18377e9102","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/trees/0316803063b3b55cece882111baf3e18377e9102"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/commits/b371b500e6ffde903bc6943651451c5241cb71d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/b371b500e6ffde903bc6943651451c5241cb71d2","node_id":"C_kwDOTfrCstoAKGIzNzFiNTAwZTZmZmRlOTAzYmM2OTQzNjUxNDUxYzUyNDFjYjcxZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/41a64e3cae1fbf81427d7838b706d953f7bc7d49","sha":"41a64e3cae1fbf81427d7838b706d953f7bc7d49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/41a64e3cae1fbf81427d7838b706d953f7bc7d49"}],"sha":"b371b500e6ffde903bc6943651451c5241cb71d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/b371b500e6ffde903bc6943651451c5241cb71d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/41a64e3cae1fbf81427d7838b706d953f7bc7d49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:11Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:59:11Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"message":"Fix devkit CSS never loading by injecting it into a shadow root\n\nesbuild''s `css` loader emits sibling .css files but injects no\n<link>/<style> reference anywhere, so the theme and tool-panel\nstylesheets were built but never applied. Switch build.ts to the\n`text` loader, import the raw CSS strings in register.tsx, and render\nthe app into a shadow root with an injected <style> element instead of\ninto the custom element directly.\n\nRendering into a shadow root also scopes theme.css''s :root custom\nproperties and `*` box-sizing reset to just this element, so they\ncan no longer collide with or leak onto the portfolio host page''s own\ndesign tokens. theme.css''s `:root`/`dk-devkit-app` selectors become\n`:host` accordingly, since `:root` never matches inside a shadow tree.\n\nregister.test.tsx now asserts against `el.shadowRoot.textContent`\nsince Element.textContent doesn''t traverse the shadow boundary.","tree":{"sha":"bf48cf188a508456d745975516355f7f22c02e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/trees/bf48cf188a508456d745975516355f7f22c02e69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/commits/41a64e3cae1fbf81427d7838b706d953f7bc7d49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/41a64e3cae1fbf81427d7838b706d953f7bc7d49","node_id":"C_kwDOTfrCstoAKDQxYTY0ZTNjYWUxZmJmODE0MjdkNzgzOGI3MDZkOTUzZjdiYzdkNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commit/ace47566226f4000ea9aae50eb393cadade05b43","sha":"ace47566226f4000ea9aae50eb393cadade05b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/ace47566226f4000ea9aae50eb393cadade05b43"}],"sha":"41a64e3cae1fbf81427d7838b706d953f7bc7d49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/41a64e3cae1fbf81427d7838b706d953f7bc7d49"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/commits/ace47566226f4000ea9aae50eb393cadade05b43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:39:01Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:39:01Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"message":"Remove old Angular projects/devkit workspace after React port verified working\n\n- Delete projects/devkit/ (obsolete Angular scaffolding, superseded by\n  apps/devkit React remote, verified end-to-end in Task 23)\n- Delete angular.json entirely: empirically confirmed apps/coming-soon\n  builds and tests fine without it, since Nx drives coming-soon via its\n  own apps/coming-soon/project.json rather than the Angular CLI workspace\n  file\n- Fix root tsconfig.json, which still referenced the now-deleted\n  projects/devkit/tsconfig.{app,spec}.json, breaking coming-soon''s\n  Vitest run via a stale TS project reference\n- Update README.md to describe the new apps/devkit (React) +\n  apps/coming-soon (Angular) layout and nx-based commands\n- No package.json dependency pruning needed: every candidate package is\n  still required either by apps/coming-soon (protected per brief:\n  @angular/*, rxjs, tslib, es-module-shims,\n  @angular-architects/native-federation - coming-soon has no own\n  package.json) or by root tooling (nx, prettier, typescript, tsx)","tree":{"sha":"53097580f80f0c6c5c9acaf999610aa0ef44207e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/trees/53097580f80f0c6c5c9acaf999610aa0ef44207e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/commits/ace47566226f4000ea9aae50eb393cadade05b43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat