ts/dba4d668c9b1e2b8c162ac874f66d2e41005f480/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:06:59Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:06:59Z","email":"39931045+hntidat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dat-honguyen"},"message":"Fix apps/devkit build hanging forever after completing successfully\n\nfederationBuilder.build() bundles register.tsx via native-federation-esbuild''s\nesbuild.context() API, which spins up a persistent service process for\nincremental rebuilds. That process is only disposed by federationBuilder.close()\n- never called here - so the script''s application code finished correctly (all\nartifacts written) but node never exited. Verified via instrumented tracing\nthrough the installed native-federation package: every awaited call returned,\nmain() reached its last line, and the process still hung indefinitely.","tree":{"sha":"0951ccbb4bf8a96834f0ad0fc0ce7aa9f269250c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/trees/0951ccbb4bf8a96834f0ad0fc0ce7aa9f269250c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dat-honguyen/my-tools/git/commits/dba4d668c9b1e2b8c162ac874f66d2e41005f480","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39931045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hntidat","id":39931045,"login":"hntidat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntidat/