pretianjeel@gmail.com","name":"anjeelupreti"},"message":"feat: monitor detail page with filterable check/incident history\n\nBackend: added since/until/is_up filters to /api/checks/ and\nsince/until/resolved to /api/incidents/ - plain query-param parsing in\nthe viewset, didn''t pull in django-filter for three optional params.\n\nFrontend: /monitors/:id shows a monitor''s config plus two independent\nhistory panels (CheckHistory, IncidentHistory), each with their own\nfilters and a 10s poll so new data shows up without a manual reload -\nthis is the \"recent shown, but down/up becomes a new log entry\" behavior\nthat was actually already implemented by the Incident model, just not\nsurfaced anywhere until now. CheckHistory also has \"load more\" via DRF''s\npagination next-link, and pauses its own polling once you''ve paged past\nrecent so auto-refresh doesn''t yank you back to page 1.\n\nVerified in a real browser: seeded a Check+Incident directly in the DB\n(simulating the engine running) while the detail page was open, and\nconfirmed both showed up within one poll cycle with no reload, and that\nthe down/ongoing filters actually change what''s returned.","tree":{"sha":"684ab9cec2d003a3691d752301b93c7d2f565677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anjeelupreti/apiPulse/git/trees/684ab9cec2d003a3691d752301b93c7d2f565677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anjeelupreti/apiPulse/git/commits/c215e4dcb1940108338654570c2ef7caf76be41d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154815988?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anjeelupreti/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anjeelupreti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anjeelupreti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anjeelupreti/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anjeelupr